window.COUNTRIES = [{"slug":"nepal","name":"Nepal","region":"Asia","flag":"np","mapId":"524","readOrder":1,"summary":"Mountains, temples, and two major religious traditions shape this Himalayan country.","summaryZh":"高山、寺庙以及两种重要宗教传统共同塑造了这个喜马拉雅国家。","facts":{"Capital":"Kathmandu","Language":"Nepali","Landscape":"Himalayas and valleys","Reading path":"Start"},"versions":{"A1":{"title":"Nepal — Easy Country Guide","titleZh":"Nepal——A1 基础版","summary":"Short sentences, essential facts, culture, festivals, and visual clues for easier reading.","summaryZh":"使用较短句子介绍地理、文化、节庆与视觉特色，适合基础阅读。","sections":[{"heading":"Land and Mountains","headingZh":"Land and Mountains","en":"Nepal is between China and India. The Himalayas are in the north, and many people live in valleys and mountain towns.","zh":"尼泊尔位于中国和印度之间。北部是喜马拉雅山，许多人住在山谷和山区城镇。","imagePages":["Nepal","Himalayas"],"caption":"Land and Mountains"},{"heading":"Temples and Beliefs","headingZh":"Temples and Beliefs","en":"Hinduism and Buddhism are both important in Nepal. Temples, stupas, prayer flags, and small shrines are easy to see.","zh":"印度教和佛教在尼泊尔都很重要。寺庙、佛塔、经幡和小神龛都很常见。","imagePages":["Swayambhunath","Boudhanath"],"caption":"Temples and Beliefs"},{"heading":"Tihar","headingZh":"Tihar","en":"Tihar is a five-day festival of lights. People honor crows, dogs, cows, and family members, and many homes are decorated with lamps.","zh":"提哈尔是一个持续五天的灯节。人们会敬奉乌鸦、狗、牛和家人，许多家庭会用灯来装饰。","imagePages":["Tihar (festival)","Tihar"],"caption":"Tihar"},{"heading":"Daily Life","headingZh":"Daily Life","en":"Tea, rice, lentils, and vegetables are common foods. In villages and cities, family life, markets, schools, and religious places are close parts of everyday life.","zh":"茶、米饭、扁豆和蔬菜是常见食物。在乡村和城市里，家庭、市场、学校和宗教场所都是日常生活的一部分。","imagePages":["Dal bhat","Kathmandu"],"caption":"Daily Life"}]},"B1":{"title":"Nepal — Culture, History, and Everyday Life","titleZh":"Nepal——B1 深入版","summary":"A fuller country profile with geography, history, architecture, living traditions, festivals, crafts, and social life.","summaryZh":"更完整介绍地理、历史、建筑、活态传统、节庆、手工艺与社会生活。","sections":[{"heading":"Location and Capital","headingZh":"位置与首都","en":"Nepal is in Asia. China is to the north, and India is around the other sides. The capital is Kathmandu, a busy city in a large valley.","zh":"尼泊尔位于亚洲。中国在北边，印度在其他几侧。首都是加德满都，这是一座位于大山谷中的繁忙城市。","imagePages":["Nepal","Kathmandu Valley"],"caption":"Nepal and the Kathmandu Valley"},{"heading":"High Mountains","headingZh":"高山","en":"Nepal has many high mountains. Mount Everest, the highest mountain on Earth, is on its northern border. Many visitors come to see the Himalayas and enjoy the mountain landscape.","zh":"尼泊尔有许多高山。世界最高峰珠穆朗玛峰位于它的北部边境。许多游客来到这里欣赏喜马拉雅山和高山风景。","imagePages":["Mount Everest","Himalayas"],"caption":"Mount Everest and the Himalayas"},{"heading":"Temples and Religion","headingZh":"寺庙与宗教","en":"Nepal has many temples and old religious places. Hinduism and Buddhism are both important. Lumbini, in southern Nepal, is known as the birthplace of the Buddha.","zh":"尼泊尔有许多寺庙和古老的宗教场所。印度教和佛教都很重要。位于尼泊尔南部的蓝毗尼被认为是佛陀的出生地。","imagePages":["Lumbini","Swayambhunath"],"caption":"Religious heritage in Nepal"},{"heading":"Festival of Lights","headingZh":"Festival of Lights","en":"Tihar is one of Nepal’s most distinctive annual celebrations. Across five days, different beings are honored, including crows, dogs, cows, and brothers and sisters. Homes are lit with oil lamps and electric lights, and colorful rangoli designs often appear near entrances. The sequence of days shows how religious ideas, family relationships, and respect for animals can meet inside one festival.","zh":"提哈尔是尼泊尔最有特色的年度节庆之一。五天里会分别敬奉不同对象，包括乌鸦、狗、牛以及兄弟姐妹。家庭会点油灯或电灯，门口也常出现彩色地画。这个节庆把宗教观念、家庭关系以及对动物的尊重结合在一起。","imagePages":["Tihar (festival)","Tihar"],"caption":"Festival of Lights"},{"heading":"Architecture and Sacred Space","headingZh":"Architecture and Sacred Space","en":"Kathmandu Valley contains temple squares, carved wooden windows, brick courtyards, stupas, and shrines. Hindu and Buddhist sites often stand close to ordinary homes and shops, so sacred architecture is not separated from daily urban life. Earthquakes have damaged many monuments, but restoration work continues to protect the valley’s historic character.","zh":"加德满都谷地有寺庙广场、木雕窗、砖造庭院、佛塔和神龛。印度教与佛教场所常与住家和商店相邻，因此宗教建筑并没有与日常城市生活完全分开。地震曾破坏许多古迹，但修复工作持续进行，以保护谷地的历史风貌。","imagePages":["Kathmandu Durbar Square","Patan Durbar Square"],"caption":"Architecture and Sacred Space"},{"heading":"People and Mountain Life","headingZh":"People and Mountain Life","en":"Nepal is highly diverse in language, ethnicity, and landscape. A farming family in the lowlands, a shopkeeper in Kathmandu, and a household in a high Himalayan valley may live very different daily lives. Yet seasonal festivals, family networks, tea shops, local markets, and religious places create social spaces that connect communities.","zh":"尼泊尔在语言、族群和地景上都非常多元。低地农家、加德满都商人和喜马拉雅高山谷地家庭，日常生活可能完全不同。不过季节性节庆、家庭网络、茶店、地方市场和宗教场所仍构成连接社区的重要社会空间。","imagePages":["Kathmandu","Himalayan village"],"caption":"People and Mountain Life"}]}}},{"slug":"kazakhstan","name":"Kazakhstan","region":"Asia","flag":"kz","mapId":"398","readOrder":2,"summary":"Wide grasslands, mountains, horse culture, and modern cities meet in Central Asia.","summaryZh":"广阔草原、高山、马文化与现代城市在中亚交会。","facts":{"Capital":"Astana","Languages":"Kazakh and Russian","Landscape":"Steppe, lakes, mountains","Tradition":"Horse culture"},"versions":{"A1":{"title":"Kazakhstan — Easy Country Guide","titleZh":"Kazakhstan——A1 基础版","summary":"Short sentences, essential facts, culture, festivals, and visual clues for easier reading.","summaryZh":"使用较短句子介绍地理、文化、节庆与视觉特色，适合基础阅读。","sections":[{"heading":"Wide Steppe","headingZh":"Wide Steppe","en":"Kazakhstan has huge open grasslands called steppe. It also has lakes, deserts, and high mountains in the southeast.","zh":"哈萨克斯坦有广阔的草原。这里也有湖泊、沙漠，东南部还有高山。","imagePages":["Kazakh Steppe","Charyn Canyon"],"caption":"Wide Steppe"},{"heading":"Horse Culture","headingZh":"Horse Culture","en":"Horses have been important for travel and herding for a very long time. Horse riding is still a strong symbol of Kazakh culture.","zh":"很久以来，马在交通和放牧中都很重要。骑马至今仍是哈萨克文化的重要象征。","imagePages":["Kazakh horse","Equestrianism in Kazakhstan"],"caption":"Horse Culture"},{"heading":"Nauryz","headingZh":"Nauryz","en":"Nauryz is a spring festival around March 21. Families visit one another, share food, and welcome a new season.","zh":"纳乌鲁兹是在三月二十一日前后举行的春季节日。家人会互相拜访、分享食物，并迎接新的季节。","imagePages":["Nowruz in Kazakhstan","Nauryz"],"caption":"Nauryz"},{"heading":"Yurts and Music","headingZh":"Yurts and Music","en":"The yurt is a round portable home from nomadic life. The dombra, a two-string instrument, is also a well-known part of Kazakh music.","zh":"毡房是一种来自游牧生活的圆形可移动住所。冬不拉是一种两弦乐器，也是哈萨克音乐的重要特色。","imagePages":["Yurt","Dombra"],"caption":"Yurts and Music"}]},"B1":{"title":"Kazakhstan — Culture, History, and Everyday Life","titleZh":"Kazakhstan——B1 深入版","summary":"A fuller country profile with geography, history, architecture, living traditions, festivals, crafts, and social life.","summaryZh":"更完整介绍地理、历史、建筑、活态传统、节庆、手工艺与社会生活。","sections":[{"heading":"Grasslands and Mountains","headingZh":"草原与高山","en":"Kazakhstan is in Central Asia. It has huge grasslands, lakes, and high mountains in the southeast. The capital is Astana.","zh":"哈萨克斯坦位于中亚。这里有广阔的草原、湖泊，东南部还有高山。首都是阿斯塔纳。","imagePages":["Kazakhstan","Kazakh Steppe"],"caption":"The open steppe of Kazakhstan"},{"heading":"Horses and Nomadic Culture","headingZh":"马与游牧文化","en":"Horses have been important here for a very long time. In the past, many families moved across the grasslands with their animals. Horse riding and nomadic traditions are still strong cultural symbols today.","zh":"马在这里已经重要了很长时间。过去，许多家庭会带着牲畜在草原上移动。今天，骑马和游牧传统仍然是重要的文化象征。","imagePages":["Kazakh horse","Yurt"],"caption":"Horse and nomadic traditions"},{"heading":"Modern Cities","headingZh":"现代城市","en":"Astana and Almaty have modern buildings, universities, cafés, and busy roads. This creates a clear contrast with the wide open land outside the cities.","zh":"阿斯塔纳和阿拉木图有现代建筑、大学、咖啡馆和繁忙道路。这与城市外广阔开阔的土地形成明显对比。","imagePages":["Astana","Almaty"],"caption":"Modern urban life in Kazakhstan"},{"heading":"Nauryz and Spring Renewal","headingZh":"Nauryz and Spring Renewal","en":"Nauryz is celebrated around the spring equinox and marks renewal after winter. Public squares may host music, games, decorated yurts, and large shared meals. A traditional dish called nauryz kozhe is often prepared with several ingredients. The holiday connects modern national celebration with older seasonal customs from the steppe.","zh":"纳乌鲁兹在春分前后举行，象征冬天之后的更新。公共广场常有音乐、游戏、装饰毡房和大型共享餐食。人们常准备由多种材料制成的传统料理纳乌鲁兹粥。这项节日把现代国家庆典与草原上的古老季节习俗连接起来。","imagePages":["Nauryz","Nowruz in Kazakhstan"],"caption":"Nauryz and Spring Renewal"},{"heading":"Dombra and Oral Tradition","headingZh":"Dombra and Oral Tradition","en":"The dombra is a long-necked, two-string instrument closely connected with Kazakh music. Instrumental pieces can tell stories without words, using changes in rhythm and melody. Music, epic tales, and spoken performance were especially important in nomadic settings where cultural knowledge had to travel with people rather than remain in fixed buildings.","zh":"冬不拉是一种长颈双弦乐器，与哈萨克音乐密切相关。器乐曲可以不用文字，而透过节奏与旋律变化讲故事。在游牧环境中，人们不断移动，因此音乐、史诗与口述表演特别重要，文化知识可以随人一起移动，而不必依赖固定建筑。","imagePages":["Dombra","Kazakh music"],"caption":"Dombra and Oral Tradition"},{"heading":"From Nomadic Space to Modern Cities","headingZh":"From Nomadic Space to Modern Cities","en":"Much of Kazakhstan’s historic identity comes from life on open steppe, yet today most people live in settled towns and cities. Astana presents monumental modern architecture, while Almaty sits near mountains and remains a major cultural center. This contrast between vast pastoral landscapes and dense urban life is one of the country’s strongest modern features.","zh":"哈萨克斯坦许多历史认同来自开阔草原上的游牧生活，但今天大多数人住在固定城镇与城市。阿斯塔纳有大型现代建筑，阿拉木图则靠近山脉并保持重要文化中心地位。辽阔牧区与密集都市生活之间的对比，是这个国家最鲜明的现代特色之一。","imagePages":["Astana","Almaty"],"caption":"From Nomadic Space to Modern Cities"}]}}},{"slug":"kyrgyzstan","name":"Kyrgyzstan","region":"Asia","flag":"kg","mapId":"417","readOrder":3,"summary":"A mountain country where yurts, summer pastures, and horse culture remain easy to see.","summaryZh":"这是一个高山国家，蒙古包、夏季牧场与马文化至今仍很常见。","facts":{"Capital":"Bishkek","Languages":"Kyrgyz and Russian","Landscape":"Tien Shan mountains","Tradition":"Yurts and summer pastures"},"versions":{"A1":{"title":"Kyrgyzstan — Easy Country Guide","titleZh":"Kyrgyzstan——A1 基础版","summary":"Short sentences, essential facts, culture, festivals, and visual clues for easier reading.","summaryZh":"使用较短句子介绍地理、文化、节庆与视觉特色，适合基础阅读。","sections":[{"heading":"Mountain Country","headingZh":"Mountain Country","en":"Kyrgyzstan is covered by mountains, especially the Tien Shan. Many roads and villages follow valleys between the mountains.","zh":"吉尔吉斯斯坦大部分地区都是山区，尤其是天山。许多道路和村庄分布在山谷之间。","imagePages":["Tian Shan","Kyrgyzstan"],"caption":"Mountain Country"},{"heading":"Yurts and Pastures","headingZh":"Yurts and Pastures","en":"Some families move animals to high summer pastures. Yurts are still used there because they are easy to move and build.","zh":"一些家庭会把牲畜带到高山夏季牧场。毡房在那里仍然常用，因为它容易搬运和搭建。","imagePages":["Yurt","Jailoo"],"caption":"Yurts and Pastures"},{"heading":"Kok Boru","headingZh":"Kok Boru","en":"Kok boru is a famous horse game. Riders work in teams, showing strength, speed, and control on horseback.","zh":"科克博鲁是一种著名的马背游戏。骑手分队比赛，展现力量、速度和控马能力。","imagePages":["Kok-boru","World Nomad Games"],"caption":"Kok Boru"},{"heading":"Felt and Patterns","headingZh":"Felt and Patterns","en":"Kyrgyz crafts often use felt, wool, and bright patterns. Felt carpets and wall decorations are common traditional objects.","zh":"吉尔吉斯传统手工艺常使用毛毡、羊毛和鲜艳图案。毛毡地毯和墙饰是常见的传统物品。","imagePages":["Shyrdak","Kyrgyz carpet"],"caption":"Felt and Patterns"}]},"B1":{"title":"Kyrgyzstan — Culture, History, and Everyday Life","titleZh":"Kyrgyzstan——B1 深入版","summary":"A fuller country profile with geography, history, architecture, living traditions, festivals, crafts, and social life.","summaryZh":"更完整介绍地理、历史、建筑、活态传统、节庆、手工艺与社会生活。","sections":[{"heading":"A Mountain Country","headingZh":"高山国家","en":"Kyrgyzstan is in Central Asia, and mountains cover most of the country. The Tien Shan range shapes roads, villages, weather, and travel.","zh":"吉尔吉斯斯坦位于中亚，大部分国土都是山区。天山山脉影响道路、村庄、天气和交通。","imagePages":["Kyrgyzstan","Tian Shan"],"caption":"The Tien Shan mountains"},{"heading":"Yurts and Summer Pastures","headingZh":"蒙古包与夏季牧场","en":"The yurt is a round portable home connected with nomadic life. In warm months, some families move animals to high summer pastures, where yurts are still used.","zh":"蒙古包是一种与游牧生活有关的圆形可移动住所。在温暖的月份，一些家庭会把牲畜带到高山夏季牧场，那里至今仍会使用蒙古包。","imagePages":["Yurt","Jailoo"],"caption":"Yurts on high summer pastures"},{"heading":"Horses and Modern Life","headingZh":"马文化与现代生活","en":"Horses remain important in traditional games and rural life. At the same time, Bishkek has apartments, universities, cafés, and modern businesses.","zh":"马在传统游戏和乡村生活中仍然很重要。同时，比什凯克也有公寓、大学、咖啡馆和现代企业。","imagePages":["Kok-boru","Bishkek"],"caption":"Traditional horse culture and modern Bishkek"},{"heading":"Kok Boru and Nomadic Games","headingZh":"Kok Boru and Nomadic Games","en":"Kok boru is a team horse game that demands excellent riding skill, speed, and physical control. It is commonly demonstrated at festivals and major cultural events. Other traditional competitions include wrestling, archery, and horse races. Together these games preserve skills that once mattered in pastoral and warrior life.","zh":"科克博鲁是一种团队马背运动，需要非常好的骑术、速度和身体控制。它常在节庆和大型文化活动中出现。其他传统竞赛还包括摔跤、射箭和赛马。这些游戏共同保留过去牧业与战士生活中重要的技能。","imagePages":["Kok-boru","World Nomad Games"],"caption":"Kok Boru and Nomadic Games"},{"heading":"Felt, Shyrdak, and the Yurt","headingZh":"Felt, Shyrdak, and the Yurt","en":"Felt is central to Kyrgyz material culture because sheep wool was widely available to pastoral families. Shyrdak carpets use cut pieces of contrasting felt to create strong geometric designs. Inside a yurt, felt can appear in carpets, wall coverings, bedding, and insulation, turning a portable home into a richly decorated living space.","zh":"毛毡是吉尔吉斯物质文化的核心之一，因为牧民家庭容易取得羊毛。什尔达克地毯会把不同颜色的毛毡切割组合，形成强烈几何图案。在毡房里，毛毡可用于地毯、墙饰、寝具和保温，让可移动住所也能成为装饰丰富的生活空间。","imagePages":["Shyrdak","Yurt"],"caption":"Felt, Shyrdak, and the Yurt"},{"heading":"Summer Pastures and Social Life","headingZh":"Summer Pastures and Social Life","en":"The summer pasture, or jailoo, remains an important cultural image. Families may move livestock to high grasslands when the weather warms, creating a seasonal rhythm between villages and mountain pastures. Visitors often associate these landscapes with horses, yurts, fermented mare’s milk, and long meals shared outdoors.","zh":"夏季牧场“жайлоо”至今仍是重要文化意象。天气转暖时，一些家庭会把牲畜带到高山草地，让村庄与山地牧场之间形成季节性移动节奏。游客常把这些地景与马、毡房、发酵马奶以及户外长时间共享餐食联系在一起。","imagePages":["Jailoo","Song-Kul"],"caption":"Summer Pastures and Social Life"}]}}},{"slug":"uzbekistan","name":"Uzbekistan","region":"Asia","flag":"uz","mapId":"860","readOrder":4,"summary":"Silk Road cities, plov, blue-tiled architecture, crafts, and round bread define this Central Asian stop.","summaryZh":"丝绸之路城市、抓饭、蓝色瓷砖建筑、手工艺和圆饼，是这个中亚国家的重要特色。","facts":{"Capital":"Tashkent","Language":"Uzbek","Heritage":"Silk Road","Food":"Plov and round bread"},"versions":{"A1":{"title":"Uzbekistan — Easy Country Guide","titleZh":"Uzbekistan——A1 基础版","summary":"Short sentences, essential facts, culture, festivals, and visual clues for easier reading.","summaryZh":"使用较短句子介绍地理、文化、节庆与视觉特色，适合基础阅读。","sections":[{"heading":"Silk Road Cities","headingZh":"Silk Road Cities","en":"Uzbekistan was a major stop on the Silk Road. Samarkand, Bukhara, and Khiva are famous for old buildings and trade history.","zh":"乌兹别克斯坦曾是丝绸之路上的重要地区。撒马尔罕、布哈拉和希瓦以古老建筑和贸易历史闻名。","imagePages":["Registan","Bukhara"],"caption":"Silk Road Cities"},{"heading":"Blue Architecture","headingZh":"Blue Architecture","en":"Many historic buildings have blue tiles, domes, and detailed geometric patterns. The color and decoration make the cities easy to recognize.","zh":"许多历史建筑有蓝色瓷砖、圆顶和精细的几何图案。这些颜色和装饰让城市很容易辨认。","imagePages":["Registan","Shah-i-Zinda"],"caption":"Blue Architecture"},{"heading":"Navruz","headingZh":"Navruz","en":"Navruz welcomes spring in March. People clean homes, visit family, cook special foods, and join public celebrations.","zh":"纳乌鲁兹在三月迎接春天。人们会打扫家里、探望亲人、准备特别食物并参加公共庆祝活动。","imagePages":["Nowruz","Navruz in Uzbekistan"],"caption":"Navruz"},{"heading":"Plov and Crafts","headingZh":"Plov and Crafts","en":"Plov is a rice dish often cooked for many people. Traditional crafts include ceramics, embroidery, wood carving, and colorful textiles.","zh":"抓饭是一种常为很多人准备的米饭料理。传统手工艺包括陶器、刺绣、木雕和彩色纺织品。","imagePages":["Plov","Suzani"],"caption":"Plov and Crafts"}]},"B1":{"title":"Uzbekistan — Culture, History, and Everyday Life","titleZh":"Uzbekistan——B1 深入版","summary":"A fuller country profile with geography, history, architecture, living traditions, festivals, crafts, and social life.","summaryZh":"更完整介绍地理、历史、建筑、活态传统、节庆、手工艺与社会生活。","sections":[{"heading":"Silk Road Cities","headingZh":"丝绸之路城市","en":"For centuries, important Silk Road routes crossed Uzbekistan. Old cities became centers of trade and learning, and many buildings were covered with blue tiles, domes, and detailed patterns.","zh":"几个世纪以来，重要的丝绸之路路线经过乌兹别克斯坦。古老城市成为贸易和学习中心，许多建筑覆盖着蓝色瓷砖、圆顶和精细图案。","imagePages":["Registan","Samarkand"],"caption":"Blue-tiled Silk Road architecture"},{"heading":"Plov for Many Guests","headingZh":"为许多客人准备的抓饭","en":"Plov is one of the best-known foods in Uzbekistan. Rice, meat, carrots, and spices are cooked in a large pot, and the dish is often prepared for many guests at weddings or family events.","zh":"抓饭是乌兹别克斯坦最有名的食物之一。米饭、肉、胡萝卜和香料会放在大锅里一起煮，婚礼或家庭活动时常会为许多客人准备。","imagePages":["Plov","Uzbek cuisine"],"caption":"Plov cooked in a large pot"},{"heading":"Crafts and Round Bread","headingZh":"手工艺与圆饼","en":"Traditional crafts include colorful cloth, pottery, wood carving, and metal work. Round bread is also part of daily meals and is treated with respect in many homes.","zh":"传统手工艺包括彩色布料、陶器、木雕和金属工艺。圆饼也是日常饮食的一部分，在许多家庭中会受到尊重。","imagePages":["Suzani","Obi non"],"caption":"Traditional textiles and round bread"},{"heading":"Navruz and Mahalla Life","headingZh":"Navruz and Mahalla Life","en":"Navruz marks the arrival of spring and is celebrated through food, visits, performances, and neighborhood activities. In many places the mahalla, or local neighborhood community, remains important for social organization. During major holidays, public squares and family courtyards can become spaces for collective cooking and celebration.","zh":"纳乌鲁兹象征春天到来，人们会透过食物、拜访、表演和社区活动庆祝。在许多地方，“马哈拉”这种地方邻里社区仍是重要社会组织。重大节日时，公共广场和家庭庭院都可能成为集体烹饪与庆祝的空间。","imagePages":["Navruz in Uzbekistan","Mahalla"],"caption":"Navruz and Mahalla Life"},{"heading":"Blue Tile Architecture","headingZh":"Blue Tile Architecture","en":"The historic centers of Samarkand, Bukhara, and Khiva contain madrasas, mosques, minarets, courtyards, and market streets. Blue and turquoise tiles are especially striking, but the decoration also uses calligraphy, stars, flowers, and geometric patterns. These cities make Silk Road history visible through architecture rather than through text alone.","zh":"撒马尔罕、布哈拉和希瓦的历史中心有经学院、清真寺、宣礼塔、庭院和市场街道。蓝色与青绿色瓷砖特别醒目，装饰中也有书法、星形、花卉和几何图案。这些城市让丝绸之路历史透过建筑直接呈现，而不只是存在于文字中。","imagePages":["Registan","Itchan Kala"],"caption":"Blue Tile Architecture"},{"heading":"Textiles, Ceramics, and Bread","headingZh":"Textiles, Ceramics, and Bread","en":"Suzani embroidery, ceramics, carved wood, and metalwork show strong regional craft traditions. Round flatbread is also visually distinctive and often stamped with patterns before baking. Craft markets therefore offer a useful way to understand how decoration, food, and household life intersect in Uzbek culture.","zh":"苏扎尼刺绣、陶器、木雕和金属工艺展现强烈地方手工传统。圆形扁面包也很有辨识度，烘烤前常会压上花纹。因此手工艺市场能让人看到装饰、饮食和家庭生活如何在乌兹别克文化中交会。","imagePages":["Suzani","Obi non"],"caption":"Textiles, Ceramics, and Bread"}]}}},{"slug":"turkmenistan","name":"Turkmenistan","region":"Asia","flag":"tm","mapId":"795","readOrder":5,"summary":"Desert life, white marble public architecture, carpets, and Silk Road culture are the main themes.","summaryZh":"沙漠生活、白色大理石公共建筑、地毯与丝绸之路文化是这里的主要主题。","facts":{"Language":"Turkmen","Landscape":"Karakum Desert","Craft":"Carpet weaving","History":"Silk Road culture"},"versions":{"A1":{"title":"Turkmenistan — Easy Country Guide","titleZh":"Turkmenistan——A1 基础版","summary":"Short sentences, essential facts, culture, festivals, and visual clues for easier reading.","summaryZh":"使用较短句子介绍地理、文化、节庆与视觉特色，适合基础阅读。","sections":[{"heading":"Karakum Desert","headingZh":"Karakum Desert","en":"Much of Turkmenistan is covered by the Karakum Desert. Towns and farms depend on water from rivers, canals, wells, and oases.","zh":"土库曼斯坦大部分地区被卡拉库姆沙漠覆盖。城镇和农田依靠河流、运河、水井和绿洲的水。","imagePages":["Karakum Desert","Turkmenistan"],"caption":"Karakum Desert"},{"heading":"Carpets","headingZh":"Carpets","en":"Turkmen carpets often use deep red colors and repeating geometric shapes. Carpet designs are an important symbol of identity.","zh":"土库曼地毯常使用深红色和重复的几何图案。地毯设计是重要的文化象征。","imagePages":["Turkmen rug","Turkmen carpet"],"caption":"Carpets"},{"heading":"Akhal-Teke Horses","headingZh":"Akhal-Teke Horses","en":"The Akhal-Teke is a famous horse breed from Turkmenistan. It is known for speed, endurance, and a shiny coat.","zh":"阿哈尔捷金马是来自土库曼斯坦的著名马种。它以速度、耐力和有光泽的毛色闻名。","imagePages":["Akhal-Teke","Akhal-Teke horse"],"caption":"Akhal-Teke Horses"},{"heading":"Spring Traditions","headingZh":"Spring Traditions","en":"Spring celebrations include Nowruz traditions shared across Central Asia. Families prepare food, visit relatives, and celebrate the new season.","zh":"春季庆祝活动包括中亚地区共同的诺鲁孜传统。家人会准备食物、拜访亲友并庆祝新季节。","imagePages":["Nowruz","Nowruz in Turkmenistan"],"caption":"Spring Traditions"}]},"B1":{"title":"Turkmenistan — Culture, History, and Everyday Life","titleZh":"Turkmenistan——B1 深入版","summary":"A fuller country profile with geography, history, architecture, living traditions, festivals, crafts, and social life.","summaryZh":"更完整介绍地理、历史、建筑、活态传统、节庆、手工艺与社会生活。","sections":[{"heading":"Life in the Karakum Desert","headingZh":"卡拉库姆沙漠中的生活","en":"Much of Turkmenistan is covered by the Karakum Desert. Water is limited, so settlements and farming have depended on oases, rivers, wells, and canals.","zh":"土库曼斯坦大部分地区被卡拉库姆沙漠覆盖。水资源有限，因此聚落和农业长期依靠绿洲、河流、水井和运河。","imagePages":["Karakum Desert","Turkmenistan"],"caption":"The Karakum Desert"},{"heading":"White Marble Architecture","headingZh":"白色大理石建筑","en":"Large white marble buildings and wide public spaces are a noticeable part of modern urban design in the country. Their bright stone surfaces create a very different image from the surrounding dry landscape.","zh":"大型白色大理石建筑和宽阔公共空间，是这个国家现代城市设计中很醒目的部分。明亮的石材表面与周围干燥的景观形成很不同的画面。","imagePages":["Architecture of Turkmenistan","Ashgabat"],"caption":"White marble public architecture"},{"heading":"Carpets and Silk Road Culture","headingZh":"地毯与丝绸之路文化","en":"Turkmen carpets often use deep red colors and repeating geometric patterns. The region was also connected with Silk Road travel, so desert routes carried people, ideas, and goods across Central Asia.","zh":"土库曼地毯常使用深红色和重复的几何图案。这个地区也与丝绸之路旅行相连，沙漠路线曾让人、思想和商品穿越中亚。","imagePages":["Turkmen rug","Silk Road"],"caption":"Turkmen carpets and historic trade routes"},{"heading":"Carpet Language","headingZh":"Carpet Language","en":"Turkmen carpets are not simply decorative objects; regional groups developed recognizable motifs, colors, and layouts. Deep red is common, and repeated medallion-like forms can identify a weaving tradition. Carpets appear in homes, ceremonies, state symbols, and museums, showing how one craft can carry both family memory and public identity.","zh":"土库曼地毯不只是装饰物；不同地区群体发展出可辨认的图案、色彩与布局。深红色很常见，重复的徽章状图案也能代表特定编织传统。地毯出现在家庭、仪式、国家象征和博物馆中，说明一种手工艺可以同时承载家庭记忆与公共认同。","imagePages":["Turkmen rug","Turkmen carpet"],"caption":"Carpet Language"},{"heading":"Akhal-Teke and Horse Identity","headingZh":"Akhal-Teke and Horse Identity","en":"The Akhal-Teke horse is closely associated with Turkmen identity. The breed developed under harsh, dry conditions and became known for endurance, speed, and a metallic-looking coat. Horse imagery appears in ceremonies and public culture, linking modern national symbols with older pastoral traditions.","zh":"阿哈尔捷金马与土库曼认同关系密切。这种马在干燥严酷环境中发展，以耐力、速度和金属光泽般的毛色闻名。马的形象常出现在仪式与公共文化中，把现代国家象征与更古老的牧业传统连接起来。","imagePages":["Akhal-Teke","Akhal-Teke horse"],"caption":"Akhal-Teke and Horse Identity"},{"heading":"Oases, Trade, and Merv","headingZh":"Oases, Trade, and Merv","en":"Desert geography made water and oasis settlements extremely important. Historic Merv grew where caravan routes could find water, food, protection, and markets. Although modern transport has changed movement across the country, old oasis sites still explain why cities appeared where they did.","zh":"沙漠地理让水源和绿洲聚落变得极为重要。历史上的梅尔夫在商队能够取得水、食物、保护和市场的地方发展。现代交通虽然已经改变国内移动方式，但古老绿洲遗址仍能解释城市为什么形成在特定地点。","imagePages":["Merv","Karakum Desert"],"caption":"Oases, Trade, and Merv"}]}}},{"slug":"afghanistan","name":"Afghanistan","region":"Asia","flag":"af","mapId":"004","readOrder":6,"summary":"High mountains, old trade routes, bazaars, and strong regional traditions define this crossroads.","summaryZh":"高山、古老贸易路线、集市与强烈的地区传统共同塑造了这个十字路口。","facts":{"Capital":"Kabul","Languages":"Dari and Pashto","Landscape":"Hindu Kush and valleys","Level note":"A2–B1"},"versions":{"A1":{"title":"Afghanistan — Easy Country Guide","titleZh":"Afghanistan——A1 基础版","summary":"Short sentences, essential facts, culture, festivals, and visual clues for easier reading.","summaryZh":"使用较短句子介绍地理、文化、节庆与视觉特色，适合基础阅读。","sections":[{"heading":"Mountains and Valleys","headingZh":"Mountains and Valleys","en":"The Hindu Kush mountains cross Afghanistan. Many people live in valleys, plateaus, and cities separated by difficult mountain roads.","zh":"兴都库什山脉穿过阿富汗。许多人生活在山谷、高原和由崎岖山路分隔的城市中。","imagePages":["Hindu Kush","Geography of Afghanistan"],"caption":"Mountains and Valleys"},{"heading":"Old Crossroads","headingZh":"Old Crossroads","en":"Afghanistan has long connected Central Asia, Iran, and South Asia. Traders and travelers carried goods, languages, and ideas through the region.","zh":"阿富汗长期连接中亚、伊朗和南亚。商人和旅行者曾把商品、语言和思想带过这个地区。","imagePages":["Silk Road","Afghanistan"],"caption":"Old Crossroads"},{"heading":"Nowruz","headingZh":"Nowruz","en":"Nowruz is celebrated by many communities in spring. People may visit family, prepare special food, and welcome the new year.","zh":"许多社区会在春天庆祝诺鲁孜。人们可能会探望家人、准备特别食物并迎接新年。","imagePages":["Nowruz in Afghanistan","Nowruz"],"caption":"Nowruz"},{"heading":"Carpets and Markets","headingZh":"Carpets and Markets","en":"Handmade carpets, embroidery, metalwork, and pottery are important crafts. Bazaars bring food, cloth, tools, and conversation together in one place.","zh":"手工地毯、刺绣、金属工艺和陶器都是重要手工艺。集市把食物、布料、工具和人们的交流集中在一起。","imagePages":["Afghan rug","Bazaar"],"caption":"Carpets and Markets"}]},"B1":{"title":"Afghanistan — Culture, History, and Everyday Life","titleZh":"Afghanistan——B1 深入版","summary":"A fuller country profile with geography, history, architecture, living traditions, festivals, crafts, and social life.","summaryZh":"更完整介绍地理、历史、建筑、活态传统、节庆、手工艺与社会生活。","sections":[{"heading":"Mountains and Valleys","headingZh":"高山与山谷","en":"The Hindu Kush mountains divide many parts of Afghanistan. Because travel between valleys can be difficult, communities developed strong local languages, customs, clothing, and food traditions.","zh":"兴都库什山脉把阿富汗许多地区分隔开来。因为不同山谷之间的交通可能很困难，各地发展出很强的地方语言、习俗、服装和饮食传统。","imagePages":["Hindu Kush","Geography of Afghanistan"],"caption":"The Hindu Kush mountains"},{"heading":"Old Crossroads","headingZh":"古老十字路口","en":"For centuries, routes through this land linked Central Asia, Iran, and the Indian subcontinent. Traders and travelers carried goods and ideas through mountain passes and important towns.","zh":"几个世纪以来，经过这片土地的路线连接中亚、伊朗和印度次大陆。商人和旅行者通过山口和重要城镇带来商品与思想。","imagePages":["Silk Road","Bamyan"],"caption":"Historic routes through Afghanistan"},{"heading":"Bazaars and Hospitality","headingZh":"集市与待客文化","en":"Traditional bazaars sell food, cloth, tools, carpets, and household goods. Tea and hospitality are also important when guests visit a home, and family networks remain central in many communities.","zh":"传统集市出售食物、布料、工具、地毯和家庭用品。客人到家里时，茶和待客文化也很重要，而家庭关系在许多社区中仍然处于核心位置。","imagePages":["Bazaar","Culture of Afghanistan"],"caption":"Bazaar life and hospitality"},{"heading":"Regional Diversity","headingZh":"Regional Diversity","en":"Afghanistan is often described as one country, but daily life varies greatly among mountain valleys, urban neighborhoods, farming areas, and desert-edge settlements. Dari and Pashto are major languages, while several other languages are also spoken. Local clothing, food, music, and architecture therefore change noticeably from region to region.","zh":"阿富汗虽然是一个国家，但高山谷地、城市社区、农业地区和沙漠边缘聚落的日常生活差异很大。达里语和普什图语是主要语言，此外还有多种其他语言。因此服装、食物、音乐和建筑会随地区明显变化。","imagePages":["Ethnic groups in Afghanistan","Afghanistan"],"caption":"Regional Diversity"},{"heading":"Bamiyan and Cultural Memory","headingZh":"Bamiyan and Cultural Memory","en":"The Bamiyan Valley was an important stop on routes connecting Central and South Asia. Giant Buddha statues once stood in the cliffs there, and the surrounding landscape contains caves and archaeological remains. Although the statues were destroyed in 2001, Bamiyan remains a powerful example of Afghanistan’s long multicultural history.","zh":"巴米扬谷地曾是连接中亚与南亚路线上的重要地点。过去巨型佛像立于岩壁中，周围地景也保留洞窟与考古遗迹。佛像在二〇〇一年被毁，但巴米扬仍是阿富汗悠久多文化历史的重要象征。","imagePages":["Buddhas of Bamiyan","Bamyan Valley"],"caption":"Bamiyan and Cultural Memory"},{"heading":"Nowruz, Craft, and Hospitality","headingZh":"Nowruz, Craft, and Hospitality","en":"Nowruz is celebrated by many communities in the north and center of the country. Handmade carpets, embroidery, carved wood, and metalwork remain important craft traditions. Hospitality commonly centers on tea, fruit, nuts, and shared food, turning the guest room into an important social space.","zh":"诺鲁孜在北部与中部许多社区中都会庆祝。手工地毯、刺绣、木雕和金属工艺仍是重要传统。待客常围绕茶、水果、坚果和共享食物展开，让客房成为重要社交空间。","imagePages":["Nowruz in Afghanistan","Afghan rug"],"caption":"Nowruz, Craft, and Hospitality"}]}}},{"slug":"pakistan","name":"Pakistan","region":"Asia","flag":"pk","mapId":"586","readOrder":7,"summary":"The Indus River, ancient urban history, mountain valleys, and strong regional cultures shape Pakistan.","summaryZh":"印度河、古代城市历史、高山山谷和强烈的地区文化共同塑造巴基斯坦。","facts":{"Capital":"Islamabad","Language":"Urdu plus regional languages","River":"Indus","Landscape":"Plains, deserts, high mountains"},"versions":{"A1":{"title":"Pakistan — Easy Country Guide","titleZh":"Pakistan——A1 基础版","summary":"Short sentences, essential facts, culture, festivals, and visual clues for easier reading.","summaryZh":"使用较短句子介绍地理、文化、节庆与视觉特色，适合基础阅读。","sections":[{"heading":"Indus River","headingZh":"Indus River","en":"The Indus River runs through Pakistan from north to south. It supports farms, cities, and many communities.","zh":"印度河从北向南流经巴基斯坦。它支持农业、城市和许多社区。","imagePages":["Indus River","Geography of Pakistan"],"caption":"Indus River"},{"heading":"Mountains and Cities","headingZh":"Mountains and Cities","en":"Pakistan has very high mountains in the north and large cities on the plains and coast. The landscape changes greatly from region to region.","zh":"巴基斯坦北部有很高的山脉，平原和海岸则有大型城市。不同地区的景观差异很大。","imagePages":["Karakoram","Lahore"],"caption":"Mountains and Cities"},{"heading":"Truck Art","headingZh":"Truck Art","en":"Pakistani trucks are often painted with bright colors, flowers, birds, calligraphy, and patterns. This moving art is easy to recognize.","zh":"巴基斯坦卡车常用鲜艳颜色、花朵、鸟、书法和图案装饰。这种流动艺术很容易辨认。","imagePages":["Truck art in South Asia","Truck art in Pakistan"],"caption":"Truck Art"},{"heading":"Shandur Polo","headingZh":"Shandur Polo","en":"The Shandur Polo Festival is held in a high mountain area. Polo teams play on horseback while visitors watch music and local celebrations.","zh":"尚杜尔马球节在高山地区举行。马球队在马背上比赛，游客也会欣赏音乐和当地庆祝活动。","imagePages":["Shandur Polo Festival","Shandur Pass"],"caption":"Shandur Polo"}]},"B1":{"title":"Pakistan — Culture, History, and Everyday Life","titleZh":"Pakistan——B1 深入版","summary":"A fuller country profile with geography, history, architecture, living traditions, festivals, crafts, and social life.","summaryZh":"更完整介绍地理、历史、建筑、活态传统、节庆、手工艺与社会生活。","sections":[{"heading":"The Indus River","headingZh":"印度河","en":"The Indus River runs through a large part of Pakistan. Its water supports farms, towns, and cities, especially across the broad plains of the country.","zh":"印度河流经巴基斯坦很大一部分地区。它的水支持农田、城镇和城市，特别是在这个国家广阔的平原上。","imagePages":["Indus River","Indus Valley"],"caption":"The Indus River"},{"heading":"Ancient Urban History","headingZh":"古代城市历史","en":"Thousands of years ago, the Indus region had planned cities with streets, wells, and drainage systems. These sites show that complex urban life developed here very early.","zh":"几千年前，印度河地区已经有规划整齐的城市，拥有街道、水井和排水系统。这些遗址说明复杂的城市生活很早就在这里发展。","imagePages":["Mohenjo-daro","Indus Valley Civilisation"],"caption":"Ancient Indus cities"},{"heading":"Many Regions and Cultures","headingZh":"多样的地区与文化","en":"Pakistan includes deserts, farming plains, large cities, and very high mountain valleys. Languages, clothing, music, and food change from one region to another, so the country has strong local identities.","zh":"巴基斯坦包含沙漠、农业平原、大城市和非常高的山谷。语言、服装、音乐和食物会因地区而不同，因此这个国家有很强的地方特色。","imagePages":["Karakoram","Culture of Pakistan"],"caption":"High mountain regions and local cultures"},{"heading":"Indus Civilizations","headingZh":"Indus Civilizations","en":"The Indus River basin supported some of South Asia’s earliest large urban communities. Archaeological sites such as Mohenjo-daro reveal planned streets, drainage systems, brick buildings, and long-distance trade. Modern Pakistan therefore sits on a landscape with a very deep urban history.","zh":"印度河流域孕育了南亚最早的大型城市社会之一。摩亨佐达罗等考古遗址显示有规划的街道、排水系统、砖造建筑和远距离贸易。现代巴基斯坦因此位于一个拥有非常深厚城市历史的地景上。","imagePages":["Mohenjo-daro","Indus Valley Civilisation"],"caption":"Indus Civilizations"},{"heading":"Truck Art as Moving Folk Art","headingZh":"Truck Art as Moving Folk Art","en":"Pakistani truck art turns commercial vehicles into moving canvases. Painters cover panels with flowers, birds, landscapes, calligraphy, portraits, and reflective decoration. Because trucks travel long distances, the art spreads regional styles across the country and has become internationally recognizable.","zh":"巴基斯坦卡车艺术把商业车辆变成移动画布。画家会用花、鸟、风景、书法、肖像和反光装饰覆盖车身。由于卡车长距离行驶，这种艺术会把地方风格带到全国，也因此具有国际辨识度。","imagePages":["Truck art in Pakistan","Truck art in South Asia"],"caption":"Truck Art as Moving Folk Art"},{"heading":"Mountain Festivals and Polo","headingZh":"Mountain Festivals and Polo","en":"The Shandur Polo Festival takes place on a very high plateau between northern valleys. Teams play polo on horseback while visitors camp nearby and attend music and community events. The festival links mountain geography, horse culture, tourism, and local identity in one dramatic setting.","zh":"尚杜尔马球节在北部山谷之间的高原举行。队伍骑马比赛，游客则在附近露营并参加音乐与社区活动。这个节庆把高山地理、马文化、旅游和地方认同集中在同一个鲜明场景中。","imagePages":["Shandur Polo Festival","Shandur Pass"],"caption":"Mountain Festivals and Polo"}]}}},{"slug":"iran","name":"Iran","region":"Middle East & Caucasus","flag":"ir","mapId":"364","readOrder":8,"summary":"Persian gardens, tiled architecture, bazaars, poetry, and family hospitality are central themes.","summaryZh":"波斯花园、瓷砖建筑、集市、诗歌与家庭待客文化是主要主题。","facts":{"Capital":"Tehran","Language":"Persian","Landscape":"Mountains, plateaus, deserts","Culture":"Persian heritage"},"versions":{"A1":{"title":"Iran — Easy Country Guide","titleZh":"Iran——A1 基础版","summary":"Short sentences, essential facts, culture, festivals, and visual clues for easier reading.","summaryZh":"使用较短句子介绍地理、文化、节庆与视觉特色，适合基础阅读。","sections":[{"heading":"Mountains and Deserts","headingZh":"Mountains and Deserts","en":"Iran has high mountains, deserts, fertile valleys, and long coastlines. Its geography creates many different climates and regional cultures.","zh":"伊朗有高山、沙漠、肥沃山谷和长海岸线。不同地理条件形成多样的气候与地区文化。","imagePages":["Geography of Iran","Dasht-e Kavir"],"caption":"Mountains and Deserts"},{"heading":"Persian Gardens","headingZh":"Persian Gardens","en":"Persian gardens use water, shade, trees, and clear geometric plans. They create cool, calm spaces in dry areas.","zh":"波斯花园会使用水、树荫、植物和清楚的几何布局，在干燥地区创造凉爽安静的空间。","imagePages":["Persian garden","Fin Garden"],"caption":"Persian Gardens"},{"heading":"Nowruz","headingZh":"Nowruz","en":"Nowruz is the Persian New Year at the beginning of spring. Families clean homes, prepare a Haft-Seen table, and visit relatives.","zh":"诺鲁孜是春季开始时的波斯新年。家庭会打扫房屋、准备七鲜桌并探望亲人。","imagePages":["Nowruz","Haft-Seen"],"caption":"Nowruz"},{"heading":"Carpets and Poetry","headingZh":"Carpets and Poetry","en":"Persian carpets use detailed patterns and strong color traditions. Poetry is also an important part of Iranian cultural life and public memory.","zh":"波斯地毯有精细图案和鲜明色彩传统。诗歌也是伊朗文化生活与公共记忆的重要部分。","imagePages":["Persian carpet","Persian literature"],"caption":"Carpets and Poetry"}]},"B1":{"title":"Iran — Culture, History, and Everyday Life","titleZh":"Iran——B1 深入版","summary":"A fuller country profile with geography, history, architecture, living traditions, festivals, crafts, and social life.","summaryZh":"更完整介绍地理、历史、建筑、活态传统、节庆、手工艺与社会生活。","sections":[{"heading":"Persian Gardens","headingZh":"波斯花园","en":"Persian gardens often use straight paths, trees, shade, and flowing water. In a dry climate, the careful design creates a cool and calm space.","zh":"波斯花园常使用笔直小路、树木、阴影和流动的水。在干燥气候中，这种细致设计能创造凉爽而平静的空间。","imagePages":["Persian garden","Fin Garden"],"caption":"A Persian garden"},{"heading":"Tile Architecture","headingZh":"瓷砖建筑","en":"Many historic buildings use blue, turquoise, and yellow tiles with geometric or flower patterns. Domes, courtyards, and calligraphy are also common parts of Persian architecture.","zh":"许多历史建筑使用蓝色、青绿色和黄色瓷砖，并带有几何或花卉图案。圆顶、庭院和书法也是波斯建筑中常见的元素。","imagePages":["Iranian architecture","Shah Mosque (Isfahan)"],"caption":"Persian tile architecture"},{"heading":"Bazaars and Hospitality","headingZh":"集市与待客文化","en":"Traditional bazaars connect shops, workshops, food stalls, and social life. When guests visit a home, tea, fruit, and sweets are common ways to welcome them.","zh":"传统集市把商店、工坊、食物摊位和社交生活连接在一起。客人到家里时，茶、水果和甜点是常见的招待方式。","imagePages":["Grand Bazaar, Tehran","Iranian tea culture"],"caption":"Bazaar and hospitality culture"},{"heading":"Nowruz and the Haft-Seen Table","headingZh":"Nowruz and the Haft-Seen Table","en":"Nowruz begins at the spring equinox and is one of Iran’s most important cultural celebrations. Families clean homes, buy new clothes, visit relatives, and prepare a Haft-Seen table with symbolic items whose Persian names begin with the letter “s.” The holiday connects family ritual, seasonal change, food, and older Persian cultural traditions.","zh":"诺鲁孜从春分开始，是伊朗最重要的文化节庆之一。家庭会打扫房屋、买新衣、拜访亲友，并准备“七鲜桌”，摆放名称以波斯语字母 s 开头的象征性物品。这个节日把家庭仪式、季节变化、食物与古老波斯文化传统连接在一起。","imagePages":["Haft-Seen","Nowruz"],"caption":"Nowruz and the Haft-Seen Table"},{"heading":"Persian Garden Design","headingZh":"Persian Garden Design","en":"Persian gardens are carefully structured spaces built around water, shade, plants, and geometry. Channels and pools do practical work in dry climates but also create reflection, sound, and visual balance. The four-part garden idea influenced landscape design far beyond Iran.","zh":"波斯花园围绕水、树荫、植物和几何结构精心设计。水渠和水池在干燥气候中具有实际功能，也创造倒影、声音与视觉平衡。四分式花园理念影响了伊朗以外很广的园林设计。","imagePages":["Persian garden","Fin Garden"],"caption":"Persian Garden Design"},{"heading":"Carpets, Calligraphy, and Poetry","headingZh":"Carpets, Calligraphy, and Poetry","en":"Persian cultural arts often value dense pattern, rhythm, and layered meaning. Carpets combine geometry and plant forms; calligraphy turns writing into visual design; poetry remains widely quoted in homes and public life. Together they show how language, craft, and decoration can overlap.","zh":"波斯文化艺术常重视密集图案、节奏和多层意义。地毯结合几何与植物纹样，书法把文字变成视觉设计，诗歌则常在家庭与公共生活中被引用。三者显示语言、手工艺和装饰可以互相重叠。","imagePages":["Persian carpet","Persian calligraphy"],"caption":"Carpets, Calligraphy, and Poetry"}]}}},{"slug":"azerbaijan","name":"Azerbaijan","region":"Middle East & Caucasus","flag":"az","mapId":"031","readOrder":9,"summary":"Natural fire, Caspian coastal life, carpets, tea, and the meeting of several cultural regions.","summaryZh":"天然火焰、里海沿岸生活、地毯、茶文化，以及多种文化区域的交会。","facts":{"Capital":"Baku","Language":"Azerbaijani","Coast":"Caspian Sea","Craft":"Carpet weaving"},"versions":{"A1":{"title":"Azerbaijan — Easy Country Guide","titleZh":"Azerbaijan——A1 基础版","summary":"Short sentences, essential facts, culture, festivals, and visual clues for easier reading.","summaryZh":"使用较短句子介绍地理、文化、节庆与视觉特色，适合基础阅读。","sections":[{"heading":"Caspian Coast","headingZh":"Caspian Coast","en":"Azerbaijan lies beside the Caspian Sea and near the Caucasus Mountains. Its location connects Europe and western Asia.","zh":"阿塞拜疆位于里海旁和高加索山脉附近。它的位置连接欧洲与西亚。","imagePages":["Caspian Sea","Geography of Azerbaijan"],"caption":"Caspian Coast"},{"heading":"Old Baku","headingZh":"Old Baku","en":"The old part of Baku has stone walls, narrow streets, towers, and historic buildings. Modern towers rise nearby.","zh":"巴库老城区有石墙、窄街、塔楼和历史建筑，附近则有现代高楼。","imagePages":["Old City (Baku)","Baku"],"caption":"Old Baku"},{"heading":"Novruz","headingZh":"Novruz","en":"Novruz welcomes spring with fire, food, family visits, and public events. People often jump over small fires before the holiday.","zh":"诺鲁孜用火、食物、家庭拜访和公共活动迎接春天。节日前人们常会跳过小火堆。","imagePages":["Novruz in Azerbaijan","Nowruz"],"caption":"Novruz"},{"heading":"Carpet and Mugham","headingZh":"Carpet and Mugham","en":"Azerbaijani carpets use regional patterns and colors. Mugham is a traditional musical form built around melody and improvisation.","zh":"阿塞拜疆地毯有地区性的图案和色彩。木卡姆是一种以旋律和即兴为核心的传统音乐形式。","imagePages":["Azerbaijani rug","Mugham"],"caption":"Carpet and Mugham"}]},"B1":{"title":"Azerbaijan — Culture, History, and Everyday Life","titleZh":"Azerbaijan——B1 深入版","summary":"A fuller country profile with geography, history, architecture, living traditions, festivals, crafts, and social life.","summaryZh":"更完整介绍地理、历史、建筑、活态传统、节庆、手工艺与社会生活。","sections":[{"heading":"Fire from the Ground","headingZh":"从地下燃烧的火","en":"Natural gas reaches the surface in some places in Azerbaijan and can burn for long periods. Because of this, fire became a strong historical and modern symbol of the country.","zh":"在阿塞拜疆的一些地方，天然气会从地表冒出并长时间燃烧。因此，火焰成为这个国家重要的历史与现代象征。","imagePages":["Yanar Dag","Ateshgah of Baku"],"caption":"Natural fire near Baku"},{"heading":"Carpets and Patterns","headingZh":"地毯与图案","en":"Carpet weaving has a long tradition. Different regions developed their own colors and geometric patterns, and carpets were used both in homes and for special events.","zh":"地毯编织有很长的传统。不同地区发展出自己的颜色和几何图案，地毯既用于家庭，也用于特殊活动。","imagePages":["Azerbaijani rug","Azerbaijan Carpet Museum"],"caption":"Azerbaijani carpet traditions"},{"heading":"The Caspian and Tea","headingZh":"里海与茶文化","en":"Baku stands on the Caspian Sea, so the waterfront is an important part of the city. Tea is also common in social life and is often served to guests with sweets or jam.","zh":"巴库位于里海岸边，因此海滨是城市的重要部分。茶在社交生活中也很常见，招待客人时常会配上甜点或果酱。","imagePages":["Baku Boulevard","Azerbaijani tea culture"],"caption":"Baku and tea culture"},{"heading":"Novruz and Fire","headingZh":"Novruz and Fire","en":"Novruz is celebrated with spring cleaning, sweets, family visits, music, and fire rituals. On the Tuesdays before the holiday, traditions symbolically connect water, fire, wind, and earth. Small bonfires are especially visible, giving the festival a strong visual identity.","zh":"诺鲁孜会以春季大扫除、甜食、家庭拜访、音乐和火的仪式庆祝。节日前的几个星期二，传统会象征性连接水、火、风和土地。小型火堆特别常见，让这个节庆拥有很鲜明的视觉特征。","imagePages":["Novruz in Azerbaijan","Nowruz"],"caption":"Novruz and Fire"},{"heading":"Carpet Schools","headingZh":"Carpet Schools","en":"Azerbaijani carpet traditions differ by region, and designs can indicate a place of origin. Geometric shapes, flowers, animals, and symbolic borders appear in many styles. Carpet-making therefore provides a visual map of regional identity as well as a record of household craft knowledge.","zh":"阿塞拜疆地毯传统会因地区不同而变化，图案有时能显示产地。几何形、花朵、动物和象征性边框常出现在不同风格中。因此地毯制作既像一张视觉化的地方认同地图，也记录家庭手工知识。","imagePages":["Azerbaijani rug","Azerbaijani carpet"],"caption":"Carpet Schools"},{"heading":"Mugham and Baku’s Contrasts","headingZh":"Mugham and Baku’s Contrasts","en":"Mugham is a musical tradition built around modes, improvisation, and expressive performance. In Baku, this older musical culture exists beside a dramatic urban landscape of medieval stone walls, oil-era buildings, and contemporary towers. The city makes Azerbaijan’s position between several cultural worlds easy to see.","zh":"木卡姆是一种围绕调式、即兴和表现性演奏发展的音乐传统。在巴库，这种较古老的音乐文化与中世纪石墙、石油时代建筑和现代高楼并存。城市景观让人很容易看见阿塞拜疆处于多个文化世界之间的位置。","imagePages":["Mugham","Old City (Baku)"],"caption":"Mugham and Baku’s Contrasts"}]}}},{"slug":"georgia","name":"Georgia","region":"Middle East & Caucasus","flag":"ge","mapId":"268","readOrder":10,"summary":"Caucasus mountains, stone churches, an ancient wine tradition, and a distinctive alphabet.","summaryZh":"高加索山脉、石造教堂、古老酿酒传统与独特字母，是格鲁吉亚的重要特色。","facts":{"Capital":"Tbilisi","Language":"Georgian","Landscape":"Caucasus mountains","Tradition":"Wine in clay vessels"},"versions":{"A1":{"title":"Georgia — Easy Country Guide","titleZh":"Georgia——A1 基础版","summary":"Short sentences, essential facts, culture, festivals, and visual clues for easier reading.","summaryZh":"使用较短句子介绍地理、文化、节庆与视觉特色，适合基础阅读。","sections":[{"heading":"Caucasus Mountains","headingZh":"Caucasus Mountains","en":"Georgia lies between the Black Sea and the Caucasus Mountains. Green valleys and high snowy peaks are close to one another.","zh":"格鲁吉亚位于黑海和高加索山脉之间。绿色山谷与高耸雪峰距离很近。","imagePages":["Caucasus Mountains","Geography of Georgia (country)"],"caption":"Caucasus Mountains"},{"heading":"Stone Churches","headingZh":"Stone Churches","en":"Old stone churches and monasteries stand in cities, valleys, and mountain areas. Christianity has shaped architecture and art for many centuries.","zh":"古老石教堂和修道院分布在城市、山谷和山区。基督教数百年来深刻影响当地建筑与艺术。","imagePages":["Svetitskhoveli Cathedral","Georgian Orthodox Church"],"caption":"Stone Churches"},{"heading":"Wine and Qvevri","headingZh":"Wine and Qvevri","en":"Georgia has a very old wine tradition. Some wine is made in large clay jars called qvevri that are placed underground.","zh":"格鲁吉亚拥有非常古老的葡萄酒传统。有些酒会在埋入地下的大型陶罐“克维夫里”中酿造。","imagePages":["Qvevri","Georgian wine"],"caption":"Wine and Qvevri"},{"heading":"Supra","headingZh":"Supra","en":"A supra is a traditional feast with many dishes, toasts, and long conversation. A toast leader guides the meal and gives meaning to the gathering.","zh":"苏普拉是一种传统宴席，有许多菜肴、祝酒和长时间交谈。祝酒主持人会引导宴席并赋予聚会特别意义。","imagePages":["Supra (feast)","Georgian cuisine"],"caption":"Supra"}]},"B1":{"title":"Georgia — Culture, History, and Everyday Life","titleZh":"Georgia——B1 深入版","summary":"A fuller country profile with geography, history, architecture, living traditions, festivals, crafts, and social life.","summaryZh":"更完整介绍地理、历史、建筑、活态传统、节庆、手工艺与社会生活。","sections":[{"heading":"Caucasus Mountains","headingZh":"高加索山脉","en":"Georgia lies between the Black Sea and the Caucasus Mountains. High valleys and mountain roads create dramatic landscapes and have helped different regions keep strong local traditions.","zh":"格鲁吉亚位于黑海与高加索山脉之间。高山山谷和山路形成壮观景色，也让不同地区保留了强烈的地方传统。","imagePages":["Caucasus Mountains","Geography of Georgia (country)"],"caption":"The Caucasus landscape"},{"heading":"Stone Churches","headingZh":"石造教堂","en":"Old stone churches and monasteries can be seen on hills, in valleys, and inside historic towns. Christianity has been important in Georgian culture for many centuries.","zh":"古老的石造教堂和修道院可以在山丘、山谷和历史城镇中看到。基督教在格鲁吉亚文化中已经重要了许多个世纪。","imagePages":["Georgian Orthodox Church","Jvari Monastery"],"caption":"Georgian stone churches"},{"heading":"Wine and Alphabet","headingZh":"葡萄酒与字母","en":"Georgia has a very old wine-making tradition, including wine made in large clay vessels placed in the ground. Georgian also uses its own alphabet, so written Georgian has a very distinctive appearance.","zh":"格鲁吉亚有非常古老的酿酒传统，其中包括把葡萄酒放在埋入地下的大型陶罐中制作。格鲁吉亚语也使用自己的字母，因此书写形式非常独特。","imagePages":["Georgian wine","Georgian scripts"],"caption":"Wine vessels and Georgian writing"},{"heading":"Qvevri Wine-Making","headingZh":"Qvevri Wine-Making","en":"Traditional Georgian wine can be fermented and stored in large clay vessels called qvevri. The vessels are buried underground, helping keep temperature stable. Wine is closely linked with family meals and ceremonial toasts, so production methods and social customs are difficult to separate.","zh":"传统格鲁吉亚葡萄酒可在大型陶罐“克维夫里”中发酵和储存。陶罐会埋在地下，以帮助维持稳定温度。葡萄酒与家庭餐食和仪式性祝酒关系密切，因此酿造方式与社交习俗很难完全分开。","imagePages":["Qvevri","Georgian wine"],"caption":"Qvevri Wine-Making"},{"heading":"Supra and the Tamada","headingZh":"Supra and the Tamada","en":"A supra is a structured feast rather than simply a large dinner. The tamada, or toast leader, guides a sequence of toasts about family, friendship, ancestors, guests, and life. Food, wine, speech, and hospitality therefore form one shared performance around the table.","zh":"苏普拉不是单纯的大餐，而是一种有结构的宴席。塔马达，也就是祝酒主持人，会引导关于家庭、友谊、祖先、客人和人生的一连串祝酒。因此食物、葡萄酒、言语和待客共同形成餐桌上的集体表演。","imagePages":["Supra (feast)","Tamada"],"caption":"Supra and the Tamada"},{"heading":"Alphabet, Churches, and Landscape","headingZh":"Alphabet, Churches, and Landscape","en":"The Georgian alphabet gives the written language a very distinctive visual identity. Stone churches often stand on hills, in valleys, or against high mountain backgrounds, making religious architecture part of the landscape itself. This combination of script, stone, and geography is central to how Georgia presents its cultural heritage.","zh":"格鲁吉亚字母让书面语言拥有非常独特的视觉认同。石造教堂常位于山丘、山谷或高山背景前，让宗教建筑本身成为地景的一部分。文字、石材和地理的结合，是格鲁吉亚文化遗产形象的核心。","imagePages":["Georgian scripts","Jvari Monastery"],"caption":"Alphabet, Churches, and Landscape"}]}}},{"slug":"greece","name":"Greece","region":"Europe","flag":"gr","mapId":"300","readOrder":11,"summary":"Ancient city culture, islands, Orthodox traditions, olive oil, and sea life shape Greece.","summaryZh":"古代城市文化、岛屿、东正教传统、橄榄油与海洋生活共同塑造希腊。","facts":{"Capital":"Athens","Language":"Greek","Currency":"Euro","Landscape":"Mountains and islands"},"versions":{"A1":{"title":"Greece — Easy Country Guide","titleZh":"Greece——A1 基础版","summary":"Short sentences, essential facts, culture, festivals, and visual clues for easier reading.","summaryZh":"使用较短句子介绍地理、文化、节庆与视觉特色，适合基础阅读。","sections":[{"heading":"Sea and Islands","headingZh":"Sea and Islands","en":"Greece has a mainland and many islands. The sea has shaped travel, trade, fishing, and daily life for thousands of years.","zh":"希腊有大陆和许多岛屿。数千年来，海洋一直影响交通、贸易、捕鱼和日常生活。","imagePages":["Greek islands","Aegean Sea"],"caption":"Sea and Islands"},{"heading":"Ancient Places","headingZh":"Ancient Places","en":"Temples, theaters, and city ruins show the history of ancient Greece. Many ideas about politics, drama, and philosophy developed in ancient Greek city-states.","zh":"寺庙、剧场和城市遗址展现古希腊历史。许多关于政治、戏剧和哲学的思想形成于古希腊城邦。","imagePages":["Acropolis of Athens","Ancient Greek theatre"],"caption":"Ancient Places"},{"heading":"Orthodox Easter","headingZh":"Orthodox Easter","en":"Orthodox Easter is one of the most important religious celebrations in Greece. Families attend church, light candles, and share a large meal.","zh":"东正教复活节是希腊最重要的宗教节庆之一。家庭会去教堂、点蜡烛并一起吃丰盛餐点。","imagePages":["Easter in Greece","Greek Orthodox Church"],"caption":"Orthodox Easter"},{"heading":"Olive and Café Life","headingZh":"Olive and Café Life","en":"Olive oil, vegetables, cheese, bread, and seafood are common foods. Outdoor cafés and village squares are important social spaces.","zh":"橄榄油、蔬菜、奶酪、面包和海鲜都是常见食物。户外咖啡馆和村庄广场是重要社交空间。","imagePages":["Greek cuisine","Kafeneio"],"caption":"Olive and Café Life"}]},"B1":{"title":"Greece — Culture, History, and Everyday Life","titleZh":"Greece——B1 深入版","summary":"A fuller country profile with geography, history, architecture, living traditions, festivals, crafts, and social life.","summaryZh":"更完整介绍地理、历史、建筑、活态传统、节庆、手工艺与社会生活。","sections":[{"heading":"Ancient Cities and Ideas","headingZh":"古代城市与思想","en":"Ancient Greek cities developed important traditions in politics, theater, philosophy, art, and science. Temples and ruins still make this past visible in modern Greece.","zh":"古希腊城市在政治、戏剧、哲学、艺术和科学方面发展出重要传统。今天的希腊仍能通过神庙和遗址看见这段过去。","imagePages":["Acropolis of Athens","Ancient Greece"],"caption":"Ancient Greek architecture"},{"heading":"Islands and the Sea","headingZh":"岛屿与海洋","en":"Greece has thousands of islands and a very long coastline. Small harbors, ferries, fishing boats, white houses, and narrow streets are common sights in many island communities.","zh":"希腊拥有数千个岛屿和很长的海岸线。小港口、渡轮、渔船、白色房屋和狭窄街道，在许多岛屿社区都很常见。","imagePages":["Greek islands","Santorini"],"caption":"Greek island life"},{"heading":"Orthodox Traditions and Food","headingZh":"东正教传统与饮食","en":"Orthodox churches and religious holidays remain important in many communities. Everyday food often uses olive oil, vegetables, bread, cheese, fish, and grilled meat.","zh":"东正教教堂和宗教节日在许多社区中仍然很重要。日常饮食常使用橄榄油、蔬菜、面包、奶酪、鱼和烤肉。","imagePages":["Greek Orthodox Church","Greek cuisine"],"caption":"Religion and Mediterranean food"},{"heading":"Orthodox Easter","headingZh":"Orthodox Easter","en":"Greek Orthodox Easter combines church ritual, candlelight, family gatherings, and regional foods. On Holy Saturday, worshippers carry candles and wait for the announcement of the Resurrection at midnight. The following meal and Sunday celebrations turn religious time into a major family and community event.","zh":"希腊东正教复活节结合教会仪式、烛光、家庭聚会和地区性食物。圣周六晚上，信众带着蜡烛等待午夜宣布复活。之后的餐食与星期日庆祝，让宗教时间转变成重要家庭和社区事件。","imagePages":["Easter in Greece","Greek Orthodox Church"],"caption":"Orthodox Easter"},{"heading":"Island Architecture and Climate","headingZh":"Island Architecture and Climate","en":"White walls, flat roofs, narrow shaded lanes, and blue details are especially associated with Cycladic islands. These visual choices are not only decorative; they respond to intense sun, limited space, and local building materials. Architecture therefore reflects both climate and social life.","zh":"白墙、平屋顶、狭窄遮阴巷道与蓝色细节特别让人联想到基克拉泽斯群岛。这些视觉选择不只是装饰，也回应强烈阳光、有限空间和地方建筑材料。因此建筑同时反映气候与社会生活。","imagePages":["Cycladic architecture","Santorini"],"caption":"Island Architecture and Climate"},{"heading":"Ancient Performance and Modern Public Space","headingZh":"Ancient Performance and Modern Public Space","en":"Theater began as a public religious and civic activity in ancient Greek cities. Large open-air theaters used hillside acoustics to gather thousands of spectators. Modern Greece continues to use ancient sites for performances, creating a direct link between archaeological heritage and living cultural events.","zh":"戏剧在古希腊城市中最初是一种公共宗教与公民活动。大型露天剧场利用山坡声学效果容纳数千观众。现代希腊仍会在古代遗址举行表演，让考古遗产与当代文化活动直接连接。","imagePages":["Ancient Theatre of Epidaurus","Greek theatre"],"caption":"Ancient Performance and Modern Public Space"}]}}},{"slug":"bulgaria","name":"Bulgaria","region":"Europe","flag":"bg","mapId":"100","readOrder":12,"summary":"Damask roses, red-and-white spring threads, and yogurt give Bulgaria several distinctive cultural symbols.","summaryZh":"大马士革玫瑰、红白春季手绳与酸奶，让保加利亚拥有几个很鲜明的文化符号。","facts":{"Capital":"Sofia","Language":"Bulgarian","Region":"Balkans","Distinctive":"Roses, martenitsa, yogurt"},"versions":{"A1":{"title":"Bulgaria — Easy Country Guide","titleZh":"Bulgaria——A1 基础版","summary":"Short sentences, essential facts, culture, festivals, and visual clues for easier reading.","summaryZh":"使用较短句子介绍地理、文化、节庆与视觉特色，适合基础阅读。","sections":[{"heading":"Mountains and Black Sea","headingZh":"Mountains and Black Sea","en":"Bulgaria has mountains, valleys, the Danube River, and a Black Sea coast. This gives the country many different landscapes.","zh":"保加利亚有山脉、山谷、多瑙河和黑海海岸，因此拥有多样的地景。","imagePages":["Geography of Bulgaria","Black Sea coast of Bulgaria"],"caption":"Mountains and Black Sea"},{"heading":"Rila Monastery","headingZh":"Rila Monastery","en":"Rila Monastery is a famous Orthodox monastery in the mountains. Its courtyards, arches, and painted walls show a long religious art tradition.","zh":"里拉修道院是山区著名的东正教修道院。庭院、拱廊和彩绘墙壁展现悠久的宗教艺术传统。","imagePages":["Rila Monastery","Bulgarian Orthodox Church"],"caption":"Rila Monastery"},{"heading":"Rose Festival","headingZh":"Rose Festival","en":"The Rose Valley is known for flowers used to make rose oil. Spring festivals celebrate the harvest with costumes, music, and parades.","zh":"玫瑰谷以用于制作玫瑰油的花朵闻名。春季节庆会用服装、音乐和游行庆祝采收。","imagePages":["Rose Valley, Bulgaria","Rose Festival, Kazanlak"],"caption":"Rose Festival"},{"heading":"Kukeri","headingZh":"Kukeri","en":"Kukeri performers wear large masks, bells, and animal-like costumes. They dance in winter traditions meant to chase away evil and welcome health and spring.","zh":"库克里表演者会戴大型面具、铃铛和动物造型服装。他们在冬季传统中跳舞，象征驱走邪恶并迎接健康与春天。","imagePages":["Kukeri","Surva"],"caption":"Kukeri"}]},"B1":{"title":"Bulgaria — Culture, History, and Everyday Life","titleZh":"Bulgaria——B1 深入版","summary":"A fuller country profile with geography, history, architecture, living traditions, festivals, crafts, and social life.","summaryZh":"更完整介绍地理、历史、建筑、活态传统、节庆、手工艺与社会生活。","sections":[{"heading":"Damask Roses and the Rose Valley","headingZh":"大马士革玫瑰与玫瑰谷","en":"In central Bulgaria, the Rose Valley is known for Damask roses. Their flowers are collected to make rose oil and rose water, and the harvest season is celebrated with local events.","zh":"在保加利亚中部，玫瑰谷以大马士革玫瑰闻名。花朵会被采集来制作玫瑰油和玫瑰水，收获季也会举行当地活动。","imagePages":["Rose Valley, Bulgaria","Rosa × damascena"],"caption":"Damask roses in Bulgaria"},{"heading":"Red-and-White Threads","headingZh":"红白线","en":"At the beginning of March, people often give small red-and-white threads called martenitsa. They are worn for good health and the arrival of spring, and later they may be tied to a tree.","zh":"三月初，人们常会互赠叫做马尔泰尼察的红白小线饰。它们象征健康和春天到来，之后有时会绑在树上。","imagePages":["Martenitsa","Baba Marta"],"caption":"Martenitsa spring threads"},{"heading":"Yogurt","headingZh":"酸奶","en":"Yogurt is common in Bulgarian food and is used in both simple meals and cold soups. It is one of the foods most strongly connected with the country’s everyday cuisine.","zh":"酸奶在保加利亚饮食中很常见，会用于简单餐点和冷汤。它是最能让人联想到这个国家日常饮食的食物之一。","imagePages":["Bulgarian yogurt","Tarator"],"caption":"Bulgarian yogurt and tarator"},{"heading":"Rose Valley and Harvest Festivals","headingZh":"Rose Valley and Harvest Festivals","en":"Central Bulgaria’s Rose Valley is associated with oil-bearing roses used in perfume and cosmetics. During the spring harvest, local festivals include picking demonstrations, folk costumes, music, and parades. The celebration turns an agricultural crop into a regional cultural identity.","zh":"保加利亚中部玫瑰谷以可提炼香精和化妆品用油的玫瑰闻名。春季采收时，地方节庆会有采花展示、民俗服装、音乐和游行。这个庆典把农业作物转化成地区文化认同。","imagePages":["Rose Valley, Bulgaria","Rose Festival, Kazanlak"],"caption":"Rose Valley and Harvest Festivals"},{"heading":"Kukeri Masks and Bells","headingZh":"Kukeri Masks and Bells","en":"Kukeri traditions use dramatic masks, animal-like costumes, and heavy bells. Groups move through villages with noise and dance in rituals associated with protection, fertility, and the end of winter. The costumes are intentionally exaggerated, making the performers look more like spirits than ordinary people.","zh":"库克里传统会使用夸张面具、动物造型服装和沉重铃铛。队伍会在村庄里以声音和舞蹈进行与保护、丰收及冬季结束有关的仪式。服装刻意做得夸张，使表演者看起来更像精灵而不是普通人。","imagePages":["Kukeri","Surva"],"caption":"Kukeri Masks and Bells"},{"heading":"Monasteries, Icons, and Cyrillic Culture","headingZh":"Monasteries, Icons, and Cyrillic Culture","en":"Orthodox monasteries preserve frescoes, icons, manuscripts, and architectural traditions. Bulgaria also has a strong historical connection with the development and spread of the Cyrillic writing tradition in the medieval Slavic world. Religious art and written culture therefore meet in many historic sites.","zh":"东正教修道院保存壁画、圣像、手稿和建筑传统。保加利亚也与中世纪斯拉夫世界中西里尔字母传统的发展和传播有深厚历史关系。因此宗教艺术与书写文化会在许多古迹中交会。","imagePages":["Rila Monastery","Cyrillic script"],"caption":"Monasteries, Icons, and Cyrillic Culture"}]}}},{"slug":"north-macedonia","name":"North Macedonia","region":"Europe","flag":"mk","mapId":"807","readOrder":13,"summary":"An ancient lake, red-pepper traditions, and silver craftwork are memorable features of North Macedonia.","summaryZh":"古老湖泊、红椒传统与银饰工艺，是北马其顿容易记住的特色。","facts":{"Capital":"Skopje","Language":"Macedonian","Landmark":"Lake Ohrid","Craft":"Silver filigree"},"versions":{"A1":{"title":"North Macedonia — Easy Country Guide","titleZh":"North Macedonia——A1 基础版","summary":"Short sentences, essential facts, culture, festivals, and visual clues for easier reading.","summaryZh":"使用较短句子介绍地理、文化、节庆与视觉特色，适合基础阅读。","sections":[{"heading":"Mountains and Lake Ohrid","headingZh":"Mountains and Lake Ohrid","en":"North Macedonia is a landlocked Balkan country with many mountains. Lake Ohrid is one of its best-known natural and cultural places.","zh":"北马其顿是巴尔干内陆国家，山地很多。奥赫里德湖是最著名的自然与文化地点之一。","imagePages":["Lake Ohrid","Geography of North Macedonia"],"caption":"Mountains and Lake Ohrid"},{"heading":"Old Towns","headingZh":"Old Towns","en":"Stone churches, Ottoman-era buildings, bazaars, and narrow streets show different layers of Balkan history.","zh":"石教堂、奥斯曼时期建筑、集市和窄街展现巴尔干历史的不同层次。","imagePages":["Ohrid","Old Bazaar, Skopje"],"caption":"Old Towns"},{"heading":"Vevcani Carnival","headingZh":"Vevcani Carnival","en":"The Vevcani Carnival takes place in January. People wear masks and costumes, often using humor to comment on daily life and public events.","zh":"维夫查尼狂欢节在一月举行。人们会戴面具和穿特殊服装，也常用幽默方式评论日常生活与公共事件。","imagePages":["Vevčani Carnival","Vevčani"],"caption":"Vevcani Carnival"},{"heading":"Embroidery and Ajvar","headingZh":"Embroidery and Ajvar","en":"Traditional embroidery uses bright geometric patterns. Ajvar, made mainly from roasted red peppers, is a popular food in the region.","zh":"传统刺绣常使用鲜艳的几何图案。阿伊瓦尔主要由烤红椒制成，是当地很受欢迎的食物。","imagePages":["Macedonian embroidery","Ajvar"],"caption":"Embroidery and Ajvar"}]},"B1":{"title":"North Macedonia — Culture, History, and Everyday Life","titleZh":"North Macedonia——B1 深入版","summary":"A fuller country profile with geography, history, architecture, living traditions, festivals, crafts, and social life.","summaryZh":"更完整介绍地理、历史、建筑、活态传统、节庆、手工艺与社会生活。","sections":[{"heading":"An Ancient Lake","headingZh":"古老的湖","en":"Lake Ohrid is one of the country’s best-known natural places. It is very old, very deep, and surrounded by mountains, towns, churches, and clear water.","zh":"奥赫里德湖是这个国家最有名的自然景观之一。它非常古老、很深，周围有山脉、城镇、教堂和清澈湖水。","imagePages":["Lake Ohrid","Ohrid"],"caption":"Lake Ohrid"},{"heading":"Red Peppers and Ajvar","headingZh":"红椒与阿伊瓦酱","en":"Red peppers are an important autumn food. Families may roast and peel many peppers to make ajvar, a thick red spread that is eaten with bread and other foods.","zh":"红椒是重要的秋季食物。家庭有时会烤很多红椒并去皮，再做成浓稠的红色阿伊瓦酱，搭配面包和其他食物食用。","imagePages":["Ajvar","Capsicum annuum"],"caption":"Ajvar made from red peppers"},{"heading":"Silver Crafts","headingZh":"银饰工艺","en":"Traditional silver filigree uses very thin metal wires to create detailed jewelry and decorative objects. This type of craft can still be seen in old market areas and souvenir workshops.","zh":"传统银丝工艺使用非常细的金属线制作精细首饰和装饰品。这类工艺至今仍能在旧市场区和纪念品工坊看到。","imagePages":["Filigree","Old Bazaar, Skopje"],"caption":"Fine silver filigree work"},{"heading":"Lake Ohrid as Cultural Landscape","headingZh":"Lake Ohrid as Cultural Landscape","en":"Lake Ohrid is both a natural and cultural landscape. Medieval churches, old houses, fishing traditions, and mountain views surround one of Europe’s oldest lakes. The area demonstrates how a natural feature can shape settlement, religion, food, and tourism at the same time.","zh":"奥赫里德湖同时是自然与文化地景。中世纪教堂、老房子、捕鱼传统和山景环绕着欧洲最古老的湖泊之一。这个地区说明一个自然地理要素可以同时影响聚落、宗教、饮食和旅游。","imagePages":["Lake Ohrid","Ohrid"],"caption":"Lake Ohrid as Cultural Landscape"},{"heading":"Vevcani Carnival and Satire","headingZh":"Vevcani Carnival and Satire","en":"The Vevcani Carnival is famous for homemade masks and costumes that can be funny, strange, or deliberately shocking. Participants often use satire to comment on politics, popular culture, and local events. Because costumes change each year, the tradition stays old in form but very current in content.","zh":"维夫查尼狂欢节以自制面具和服装闻名，造型可以滑稽、奇怪，甚至刻意夸张。参加者常透过讽刺评论政治、流行文化和地方事件。因为服装每年变化，这项传统在形式上很古老，内容却非常贴近当下。","imagePages":["Vevčani Carnival","Vevčani"],"caption":"Vevcani Carnival and Satire"},{"heading":"Embroidery, Filigree, and Food","headingZh":"Embroidery, Filigree, and Food","en":"Traditional clothing often uses dense embroidery with geometric or floral designs. Metal filigree work appears in jewelry, while roasted red pepper dishes such as ajvar connect household cooking with autumn preservation. These crafts and foods make seasonal and regional knowledge visible in everyday objects.","zh":"传统服装常有密集的几何或花卉刺绣。金属银丝工艺常用于首饰，而阿伊瓦尔等烤红椒料理则把家庭烹饪与秋季保存食物联系起来。这些手工艺与食物把季节性和地区性知识具体呈现在日常物品中。","imagePages":["Macedonian embroidery","Ajvar"],"caption":"Embroidery, Filigree, and Food"}]}}},{"slug":"kosovo","name":"Kosovo","region":"Europe","flag":"xk","mapId":"383","readOrder":14,"summary":"Stone bridges, silver filigree, and layered flija are three concrete ways to remember Kosovo.","summaryZh":"石桥、银丝工艺与层层烤制的弗利亚，是认识科索沃的三个具体记忆点。","facts":{"Capital":"Pristina","Languages":"Albanian and Serbian","Craft":"Silver filigree","Food":"Flija"},"versions":{"A1":{"title":"Kosovo — Easy Country Guide","titleZh":"Kosovo——A1 基础版","summary":"Short sentences, essential facts, culture, festivals, and visual clues for easier reading.","summaryZh":"使用较短句子介绍地理、文化、节庆与视觉特色，适合基础阅读。","sections":[{"heading":"Mountains and Plains","headingZh":"Mountains and Plains","en":"Kosovo has mountain ranges around fertile plains and valleys. Towns are linked by roads through a compact inland landscape.","zh":"科索沃的肥沃平原和山谷周围分布着山脉。城镇通过内陆地景中的道路彼此连接。","imagePages":["Geography of Kosovo","Rugova Canyon"],"caption":"Mountains and Plains"},{"heading":"Prizren","headingZh":"Prizren","en":"Prizren is known for stone bridges, old religious buildings, hillside streets, and a historic center beside a river.","zh":"普里兹伦以石桥、古老宗教建筑、山坡街道和河边历史中心闻名。","imagePages":["Prizren","Stone Bridge, Prizren"],"caption":"Prizren"},{"heading":"DokuFest","headingZh":"DokuFest","en":"DokuFest is an international documentary and short-film festival held in Prizren. Screenings and events use cinemas and public spaces around the old town.","zh":"DokuFest 是在普里兹伦举行的国际纪录片与短片节。放映和活动会使用电影院以及老城区的公共空间。","imagePages":["DokuFest","Prizren"],"caption":"DokuFest"},{"heading":"Filigree and Food","headingZh":"Filigree and Food","en":"Silver filigree is a traditional craft made from very thin metal wire. Flija, a layered baked dish, is also connected with family gatherings and hospitality.","zh":"银丝工艺会使用非常细的金属线制作传统饰品。层叠烤制的 Flija 也常与家庭聚会和待客有关。","imagePages":["Filigree","Flija"],"caption":"Filigree and Food"}]},"B1":{"title":"Kosovo — Culture, History, and Everyday Life","titleZh":"Kosovo——B1 深入版","summary":"A fuller country profile with geography, history, architecture, living traditions, festivals, crafts, and social life.","summaryZh":"更完整介绍地理、历史、建筑、活态传统、节庆、手工艺与社会生活。","sections":[{"heading":"Stone Bridges and Old Streets","headingZh":"石桥与老街","en":"Historic towns in Kosovo have old stone bridges, narrow streets, mosques, churches, and market areas. These places show the region’s long connection with Balkan and Ottoman history.","zh":"科索沃的一些历史城镇有古老石桥、狭窄街道、清真寺、教堂和市场区。这些地方展现了当地与巴尔干及奥斯曼历史的长期联系。","imagePages":["Prizren","Stone Bridge, Prizren"],"caption":"Historic Prizren and its stone bridge"},{"heading":"Silver Filigree","headingZh":"银丝工艺","en":"Silver filigree is made by shaping thin silver wires into detailed patterns. Small workshops continue this craft and produce jewelry, boxes, and decorative pieces.","zh":"银丝工艺是把细银线弯成精细图案。小型工坊至今仍延续这种技术，制作首饰、盒子和装饰品。","imagePages":["Filigree","Prizren"],"caption":"Traditional silver filigree"},{"heading":"Flija","headingZh":"弗利亚","en":"Flija is made from many thin layers of batter and cream. The layers are baked slowly, often for a family gathering, so making the dish can take several hours.","zh":"弗利亚由许多薄薄的面糊和奶油层组成。每一层都要慢慢烤，常用于家庭聚会，因此制作可能需要好几个小时。","imagePages":["Flia","Kosovan cuisine"],"caption":"Flija, a layered baked dish"},{"heading":"Prizren as a Cultural Crossroads","headingZh":"Prizren as a Cultural Crossroads","en":"Prizren’s old center contains a stone bridge, religious buildings from different traditions, market streets, and houses rising toward a fortress hill. The compact cityscape makes several layers of Balkan, Ottoman, and local history visible within a short walk.","zh":"普里兹伦老城有石桥、不同宗教传统的建筑、市场街道，以及沿山坡向堡垒延伸的房屋。紧凑城市景观让巴尔干、奥斯曼与地方历史的多个层次可以在短距离内被看见。","imagePages":["Prizren","Kaljaja (Prizren)"],"caption":"Prizren as a Cultural Crossroads"},{"heading":"DokuFest and Public Culture","headingZh":"DokuFest and Public Culture","en":"DokuFest has turned Prizren into an annual center for documentary and short film. Screenings appear in cinemas and open-air spaces, while workshops, music, and discussions fill the old town. The event shows how a historic city can also support a contemporary creative scene.","zh":"DokuFest 每年把普里兹伦变成纪录片与短片中心。放映会出现在电影院和露天空间，老城中也有工作坊、音乐与讨论活动。这个节庆说明历史城市也能同时支持当代创意文化。","imagePages":["DokuFest","Prizren"],"caption":"DokuFest and Public Culture"},{"heading":"Filigree and Shared Food","headingZh":"Filigree and Shared Food","en":"Prizren has a long reputation for metalworking and silver filigree, where very thin wires are twisted into complex patterns. Food such as flija is often made slowly in many layers, making preparation itself a social activity. Craft and cooking both reward patience and repeated skilled movements.","zh":"普里兹伦长期以金属加工和银丝工艺闻名，极细金属线会被扭转成复杂图案。Flija 等食物则会一层一层慢慢烤制，让准备过程本身成为社交活动。手工艺与烹饪都需要耐心和反复熟练动作。","imagePages":["Filigree","Flija"],"caption":"Filigree and Shared Food"}]}}},{"slug":"montenegro","name":"Montenegro","region":"Europe","flag":"me","mapId":"499","readOrder":15,"summary":"Stone coastal towns, one-string gusle music, and smoked ham form a distinctive Montenegro article.","summaryZh":"石造海岸城镇、单弦古斯莱音乐与烟熏火腿，构成黑山很鲜明的介绍。","facts":{"Capital":"Podgorica","Language":"Montenegrin","Coast":"Adriatic Sea","Tradition":"Gusle and smoked ham"},"versions":{"A1":{"title":"Montenegro — Easy Country Guide","titleZh":"Montenegro——A1 基础版","summary":"Short sentences, essential facts, culture, festivals, and visual clues for easier reading.","summaryZh":"使用较短句子介绍地理、文化、节庆与视觉特色，适合基础阅读。","sections":[{"heading":"Mountains and Adriatic","headingZh":"Mountains and Adriatic","en":"Montenegro has steep mountains and a short Adriatic coast. The Bay of Kotor has dramatic mountains rising close to the sea.","zh":"黑山有陡峭山脉和一段亚得里亚海海岸。科托尔湾的高山几乎贴近海面。","imagePages":["Bay of Kotor","Durmitor"],"caption":"Mountains and Adriatic"},{"heading":"Stone Towns","headingZh":"Stone Towns","en":"Kotor and other old coastal towns have stone walls, squares, churches, and narrow streets shaped by Mediterranean trade.","zh":"科托尔等沿海古城有石墙、广场、教堂和窄街，受到地中海贸易历史影响。","imagePages":["Kotor","Old Town of Kotor"],"caption":"Stone Towns"},{"heading":"Kotor Carnival","headingZh":"Kotor Carnival","en":"Kotor holds a carnival with masks, music, costumes, and street events. The tradition reflects the city’s long Adriatic cultural connections.","zh":"科托尔会举行有面具、音乐、服装和街头活动的狂欢节。这项传统反映城市长期的亚得里亚海文化联系。","imagePages":["Kotor Carnival","Kotor"],"caption":"Kotor Carnival"},{"heading":"Njeguši Food and Gusle","headingZh":"Njeguši Food and Gusle","en":"Mountain villages are known for smoked ham and cheese. The gusle, a one-string bowed instrument, is part of traditional storytelling music in the wider region.","zh":"山区村庄以烟熏火腿和奶酪闻名。古斯莱是一种单弦拉奏乐器，也是这一地区传统叙事音乐的一部分。","imagePages":["Njeguški pršut","Gusle"],"caption":"Njeguši Food and Gusle"}]},"B1":{"title":"Montenegro — Culture, History, and Everyday Life","titleZh":"Montenegro——B1 深入版","summary":"A fuller country profile with geography, history, architecture, living traditions, festivals, crafts, and social life.","summaryZh":"更完整介绍地理、历史、建筑、活态传统、节庆、手工艺与社会生活。","sections":[{"heading":"Stone Towns by the Sea","headingZh":"海边石城","en":"On the Adriatic coast, old towns use pale stone walls, narrow lanes, small squares, and red roofs. Kotor is surrounded by mountains and a deep bay, giving the town a dramatic setting.","zh":"在亚得里亚海岸，一些老城有浅色石墙、狭窄巷道、小广场和红色屋顶。科托尔被高山和深湾包围，形成很有戏剧感的景色。","imagePages":["Kotor","Bay of Kotor"],"caption":"Kotor and the Bay of Kotor"},{"heading":"One-String Gusle Music","headingZh":"单弦古斯莱音乐","en":"The gusle is a traditional one-string instrument. A singer may play it while telling long stories about history, families, battles, and local heroes.","zh":"古斯莱是一种传统单弦乐器。歌者会一边演奏，一边讲述关于历史、家族、战争和地方英雄的长故事。","imagePages":["Gusle","Serbian epic poetry"],"caption":"The one-string gusle"},{"heading":"Smoked Ham","headingZh":"烟熏火腿","en":"In mountain villages, pork can be salted, smoked, and dried in cool air. This smoked ham is often served in thin slices with cheese and bread.","zh":"在山村里，猪肉会经过盐腌、烟熏，再利用凉爽空气风干。这种烟熏火腿常切成薄片，和奶酪、面包一起吃。","imagePages":["Njeguški pršut","Njeguši"],"caption":"Traditional smoked ham"},{"heading":"Bay of Kotor and Maritime Culture","headingZh":"Bay of Kotor and Maritime Culture","en":"The Bay of Kotor looks almost like a mountain lake even though it opens to the Adriatic Sea. Steep slopes, fortified towns, churches, and old merchant houses show the region’s long maritime connections. The landscape explains why local identity combines both mountain and coastal traditions.","zh":"科托尔湾虽然通向亚得里亚海，却看起来很像被高山包围的湖泊。陡坡、城墙城镇、教堂和旧商人住宅显示这里长期的海洋联系。这个地景说明地方认同为什么同时具有山地与沿海传统。","imagePages":["Bay of Kotor","Kotor"],"caption":"Bay of Kotor and Maritime Culture"},{"heading":"Carnival and Boka Traditions","headingZh":"Carnival and Boka Traditions","en":"Kotor’s carnival traditions bring masks, music, public performances, and satirical humor into the streets. Coastal communities also preserve maritime customs connected with the historic Boka region. The result is a cultural style quite different from the inland mountain areas.","zh":"科托尔的狂欢节传统把面具、音乐、公共表演和讽刺幽默带到街头。沿海社区也保存与历史博卡地区有关的海洋习俗。因此沿海文化风格与内陆山区非常不同。","imagePages":["Kotor Carnival","Boka Kotorska"],"caption":"Carnival and Boka Traditions"},{"heading":"Mountain Food and Storytelling","headingZh":"Mountain Food and Storytelling","en":"Dry mountain climates helped create foods that could be stored, such as smoked ham and aged cheese from the Njeguši area. Traditional gusle performance uses a one-string instrument to accompany sung or spoken epic stories. Food preservation and oral storytelling both reflect older mountain life where resources and memory had to last.","zh":"干燥山区气候促成可长期保存的食物，例如涅古什地区的烟熏火腿和熟成奶酪。传统古斯莱表演会用单弦乐器伴奏史诗歌唱或讲述。食物保存和口述叙事都反映过去山区生活中资源与记忆需要长久延续的特点。","imagePages":["Njeguški pršut","Gusle"],"caption":"Mountain Food and Storytelling"}]}}},{"slug":"romania","name":"Romania","region":"Europe","flag":"ro","mapId":"642","readOrder":16,"summary":"Latin-language roots, Carpathian village life, and painted Orthodox churches make Romania easy to recognize.","summaryZh":"拉丁语言根源、喀尔巴阡山村生活与彩绘东正教教堂，让罗马尼亚很容易被记住。","facts":{"Capital":"Bucharest","Language":"Romanian","Landscape":"Carpathian Mountains","Distinctive":"Painted churches"},"versions":{"A1":{"title":"Romania — Easy Country Guide","titleZh":"Romania——A1 基础版","summary":"Short sentences, essential facts, culture, festivals, and visual clues for easier reading.","summaryZh":"使用较短句子介绍地理、文化、节庆与视觉特色，适合基础阅读。","sections":[{"heading":"Carpathians and Danube","headingZh":"Carpathians and Danube","en":"Romania includes the Carpathian Mountains, broad plains, and the lower Danube. The Danube Delta forms a large wetland near the Black Sea.","zh":"罗马尼亚拥有喀尔巴阡山脉、广阔平原和多瑙河下游。多瑙河三角洲在黑海附近形成大型湿地。","imagePages":["Carpathian Mountains","Danube Delta"],"caption":"Carpathians and Danube"},{"heading":"Painted Churches","headingZh":"Painted Churches","en":"Some churches and monasteries in northern Romania are famous for wall paintings that cover both inside and outside surfaces.","zh":"罗马尼亚北部的一些教堂和修道院以壁画闻名，壁画会覆盖建筑内外墙面。","imagePages":["Painted churches of Moldavia","Voroneț Monastery"],"caption":"Painted Churches"},{"heading":"Mărțișor","headingZh":"Mărțișor","en":"On March 1, people give red-and-white strings or small charms called Mărțișor. They welcome spring and are often worn on clothing.","zh":"三月一日，人们会赠送红白线或小饰物“马尔齐绍尔”。它象征迎接春天，常会别在衣服上。","imagePages":["Mărțișor","Mărțișor"],"caption":"Mărțișor"},{"heading":"Village Crafts","headingZh":"Village Crafts","en":"Wood carving, woven cloth, pottery, and embroidered clothing remain visible in rural festivals and museums.","zh":"木雕、编织布料、陶器和刺绣服装在乡村节庆与博物馆中仍然常见。","imagePages":["Romanian folk art","Traditional Romanian clothing"],"caption":"Village Crafts"}]},"B1":{"title":"Romania — Culture, History, and Everyday Life","titleZh":"Romania——B1 深入版","summary":"A fuller country profile with geography, history, architecture, living traditions, festivals, crafts, and social life.","summaryZh":"更完整介绍地理、历史、建筑、活态传统、节庆、手工艺与社会生活。","sections":[{"heading":"A Latin Language in Eastern Europe","headingZh":"东欧的拉丁语言","en":"Romanian is a Romance language, so many of its roots are connected with Latin. This makes Romania linguistically different from many neighboring countries that mainly use Slavic languages.","zh":"罗马尼亚语是一种罗曼语，因此许多词源与拉丁语有关。这让罗马尼亚在语言上与许多主要使用斯拉夫语言的邻国不同。","imagePages":["Romanian language","Romance languages"],"caption":"Romanian and its Latin roots"},{"heading":"Carpathian Mountain Villages","headingZh":"喀尔巴阡山村","en":"In parts of the Carpathians, traditional village life has included sheep, hay making, milk foods, wooden houses, and hand-made crafts. Mountain landscapes strongly shape local work and seasonal life.","zh":"在喀尔巴阡山的一些地区，传统村庄生活包括养羊、晒干草、制作乳制品、木屋和手工艺。高山地景强烈影响当地工作和季节生活。","imagePages":["Carpathian Mountains","Romanian village"],"caption":"Traditional life in the Carpathians"},{"heading":"Painted Churches","headingZh":"彩绘教堂","en":"In northern Romania, some Orthodox churches have large Bible scenes painted across much of their outside walls. Many are around five hundred years old, and this style is unusual in Europe.","zh":"在罗马尼亚北部，一些东正教教堂的外墙大面积画着圣经故事。许多建筑已有大约五百年历史，这种风格在欧洲很特别。","imagePages":["Painted churches of Moldavia","Voroneț Monastery"],"caption":"Painted Orthodox church walls"},{"heading":"Mărțișor and the First Day of Spring","headingZh":"Mărțișor and the First Day of Spring","en":"On March 1, red-and-white Mărțișor strings or charms appear on clothing, gifts, and market stalls. The two colors are commonly associated with renewal and the change from winter to spring. The custom links personal gift-giving with a much wider seasonal tradition shared across parts of southeastern Europe.","zh":"三月一日，红白色马尔齐绍尔线饰会出现在衣服、礼物和市场摊位上。两种颜色常与更新以及冬天转入春天联系在一起。这项习俗把个人赠礼与东南欧更广泛的季节传统连接起来。","imagePages":["Mărțișor","Mărțișor"],"caption":"Mărțișor and the First Day of Spring"},{"heading":"Painted Monasteries and Wooden Architecture","headingZh":"Painted Monasteries and Wooden Architecture","en":"Northern Romania is known for monasteries whose exterior walls are covered with religious paintings. Elsewhere, traditional wooden churches and carved gates show how timber became a major artistic material. Architecture therefore changes with region, religion, climate, and available resources.","zh":"罗马尼亚北部以外墙覆盖宗教绘画的修道院闻名。其他地区则有传统木教堂和雕刻大门，显示木材如何成为重要艺术材料。因此建筑会随着地区、宗教、气候和可用资源而变化。","imagePages":["Painted churches of Moldavia","Wooden churches of Maramureș"],"caption":"Painted Monasteries and Wooden Architecture"},{"heading":"Village Textiles and Seasonal Work","headingZh":"Village Textiles and Seasonal Work","en":"Woven cloth, embroidered shirts, carpets, and decorated household textiles remain important symbols of rural culture. Their patterns often identify a region or community. Many festivals present these objects together with music, dance, and agricultural traditions, turning practical rural knowledge into public cultural display.","zh":"编织布料、刺绣衬衫、地毯和家庭装饰织物仍是乡村文化的重要象征，图案常能辨认地区或社区。许多节庆会把这些物品与音乐、舞蹈和农业传统一起呈现，让实际乡村知识转化成公共文化展示。","imagePages":["Romanian folk art","Traditional Romanian clothing"],"caption":"Village Textiles and Seasonal Work"}]}}},{"slug":"serbia","name":"Serbia","region":"Europe","flag":"rs","mapId":"688","readOrder":17,"summary":"A family saint day, reversible wool carpets, and circle dance are three distinctive Serbian traditions.","summaryZh":"家庭守护圣人日、双面羊毛地毯与圆圈舞，是塞尔维亚三个很有特色的传统。","facts":{"Capital":"Belgrade","Language":"Serbian","Tradition":"Slava and Kolo","Craft":"Pirot carpets"},"versions":{"A1":{"title":"Serbia — Easy Country Guide","titleZh":"Serbia——A1 基础版","summary":"Short sentences, essential facts, culture, festivals, and visual clues for easier reading.","summaryZh":"使用较短句子介绍地理、文化、节庆与视觉特色，适合基础阅读。","sections":[{"heading":"Rivers and Belgrade","headingZh":"Rivers and Belgrade","en":"The Danube and Sava rivers meet in Belgrade. The city grew around a fortress above this important river meeting point.","zh":"多瑙河和萨瓦河在贝尔格莱德汇合。城市围绕着河流交汇处上方的堡垒发展起来。","imagePages":["Belgrade Fortress","Danube"],"caption":"Rivers and Belgrade"},{"heading":"Orthodox Heritage","headingZh":"Orthodox Heritage","en":"Serbia has many Orthodox churches and monasteries with icons, frescoes, and stone architecture.","zh":"塞尔维亚有许多东正教教堂和修道院，里面常有圣像、壁画和石造建筑。","imagePages":["Serbian Orthodox Church","Studenica Monastery"],"caption":"Orthodox Heritage"},{"heading":"Slava","headingZh":"Slava","en":"Slava is a family tradition that honors a household’s patron saint. Relatives and guests gather for food, candles, bread, and prayer.","zh":"斯拉瓦是一种纪念家庭守护圣人的传统。亲友会聚在一起分享食物、点蜡烛、吃面包并祈祷。","imagePages":["Slava (tradition)","Slava"],"caption":"Slava"},{"heading":"Brass and Kolo","headingZh":"Brass and Kolo","en":"Brass bands are popular at celebrations and festivals. Kolo is a circle dance in which people join hands and move together.","zh":"铜管乐队在庆典和节日中很受欢迎。科洛是一种圆圈舞，人们牵手一起移动。","imagePages":["Guča Trumpet Festival","Kolo (dance)"],"caption":"Brass and Kolo"}]},"B1":{"title":"Serbia — Culture, History, and Everyday Life","titleZh":"Serbia——B1 深入版","summary":"A fuller country profile with geography, history, architecture, living traditions, festivals, crafts, and social life.","summaryZh":"更完整介绍地理、历史、建筑、活态传统、节庆、手工艺与社会生活。","sections":[{"heading":"Slava: A Family Saint Day","headingZh":"斯拉瓦：家庭圣人日","en":"Many Serbian Orthodox families celebrate a special family saint day called Slava. Relatives and friends gather for food, candles, bread, and family traditions that can pass from one generation to the next.","zh":"许多塞尔维亚东正教家庭会庆祝叫做斯拉瓦的家庭守护圣人日。亲友会一起吃饭、点蜡烛、分享面包，并把家庭传统一代一代传下去。","imagePages":["Slava (tradition)","Serbian Orthodox Church"],"caption":"A Serbian Slava celebration"},{"heading":"Two-Sided Pirot Carpets","headingZh":"双面皮罗特地毯","en":"Pirot carpets are hand-woven wool carpets with strong geometric designs. They are made so carefully that both sides can be used, which makes the craft easy to recognize.","zh":"皮罗特地毯是手工编织的羊毛地毯，有鲜明的几何图案。它们制作得很细致，两面都可以使用，因此这种工艺很容易辨认。","imagePages":["Pirot carpet","Pirot"],"caption":"Pirot wool carpet patterns"},{"heading":"Kolo Circle Dance","headingZh":"科洛圆圈舞","en":"Kolo is a traditional group dance. People hold hands or stand shoulder to shoulder and move together in a line or circle while folk music plays.","zh":"科洛是一种传统集体舞。人们牵手或肩并肩站着，随着民间音乐排成一列或围成圆圈一起移动。","imagePages":["Kolo (dance)","Serbian folk dance"],"caption":"Kolo circle dancing"},{"heading":"Slava as Family Heritage","headingZh":"Slava as Family Heritage","en":"Slava is a distinctive Serbian Orthodox family tradition centered on a household patron saint. A family may inherit the same saint’s day across generations. Ritual bread, a candle, food, prayer, and hospitality make the home itself the main ceremonial space.","zh":"斯拉瓦是塞尔维亚东正教家庭很有特色的传统，围绕一个家庭守护圣人进行。同一个圣人的纪念日可能在家族中代代继承。仪式面包、蜡烛、食物、祈祷和待客让家庭住宅本身成为主要仪式空间。","imagePages":["Slava (tradition)","Slava"],"caption":"Slava as Family Heritage"},{"heading":"Brass Music and Guča","headingZh":"Brass Music and Guča","en":"The town of Guča is famous for a large brass-band festival. Trumpets and other brass instruments play fast dance music, while crowds fill streets and temporary stages. The event reflects the strong place of brass ensembles in Serbian celebrations, weddings, and public festivals.","zh":"古查以大型铜管乐节闻名。小号等铜管乐器演奏快速舞曲，街道和临时舞台挤满观众。这个活动反映铜管乐队在塞尔维亚庆典、婚礼与公共节庆中的重要地位。","imagePages":["Guča Trumpet Festival","Serbian brass"],"caption":"Brass Music and Guča"},{"heading":"Rivers, Fortresses, and Kolo","headingZh":"Rivers, Fortresses, and Kolo","en":"Belgrade’s fortress overlooks the meeting point of the Sava and Danube, showing why rivers mattered for trade and defense. Kolo circle dancing creates a different kind of social space: people move together in linked lines or circles, often during celebrations. One tradition is built in stone; the other exists through collective movement.","zh":"贝尔格莱德堡垒俯瞰萨瓦河和多瑙河交汇处，说明河流过去对贸易与防御的重要性。科洛圆圈舞则创造另一种社交空间：人们在庆典中牵手组成线或圆一起移动。一个传统建立在石头上，另一个传统存在于集体动作中。","imagePages":["Belgrade Fortress","Kolo (dance)"],"caption":"Rivers, Fortresses, and Kolo"}]}}},{"slug":"bosnia-and-herzegovina","name":"Bosnia and Herzegovina","region":"Europe","flag":"ba","mapId":"070","readOrder":18,"summary":"A famous stone bridge, strong coffee ritual, and medieval tombstones make this Balkan country memorable.","summaryZh":"著名石桥、浓厚咖啡仪式与中世纪墓碑，让这个巴尔干国家很有记忆点。","facts":{"Capital":"Sarajevo","Languages":"Bosnian, Croatian, Serbian","Landmark":"Mostar Old Bridge","Heritage":"Stećci tombstones"},"versions":{"A1":{"title":"Bosnia and Herzegovina — Easy Country Guide","titleZh":"Bosnia and Herzegovina——A1 基础版","summary":"Short sentences, essential facts, culture, festivals, and visual clues for easier reading.","summaryZh":"使用较短句子介绍地理、文化、节庆与视觉特色，适合基础阅读。","sections":[{"heading":"Mountains and Rivers","headingZh":"Mountains and Rivers","en":"Bosnia and Herzegovina has mountains, green river valleys, and historic towns. The Neretva River runs through Mostar.","zh":"波斯尼亚和黑塞哥维那有山脉、绿色河谷和历史城镇。内雷特瓦河流经莫斯塔尔。","imagePages":["Neretva","Geography of Bosnia and Herzegovina"],"caption":"Mountains and Rivers"},{"heading":"Old Bridge","headingZh":"Old Bridge","en":"The stone Old Bridge in Mostar connects two sides of the old town. It has become one of the country’s strongest visual symbols.","zh":"莫斯塔尔的石造古桥连接老城两岸，已经成为这个国家最鲜明的视觉象征之一。","imagePages":["Stari Most","Mostar"],"caption":"Old Bridge"},{"heading":"Sarajevo Film Festival","headingZh":"Sarajevo Film Festival","en":"The Sarajevo Film Festival brings films, audiences, and guests into the capital each year. It grew from difficult wartime conditions into a major cultural event.","zh":"萨拉热窝电影节每年把电影、观众和来宾带到首都。它从战争时期的困难环境中发展成重要文化活动。","imagePages":["Sarajevo Film Festival","Sarajevo"],"caption":"Sarajevo Film Festival"},{"heading":"Coffee and Sevdalinka","headingZh":"Coffee and Sevdalinka","en":"Bosnian coffee is often served slowly in a small metal pot and shared with conversation. Sevdalinka is a traditional song style known for emotional melodies.","zh":"波斯尼亚咖啡常用小金属壶慢慢冲泡，并伴随聊天一起享用。塞夫达林卡是一种以深情旋律闻名的传统歌曲风格。","imagePages":["Bosnian coffee","Sevdalinka"],"caption":"Coffee and Sevdalinka"}]},"B1":{"title":"Bosnia and Herzegovina — Culture, History, and Everyday Life","titleZh":"Bosnia and Herzegovina——B1 深入版","summary":"A fuller country profile with geography, history, architecture, living traditions, festivals, crafts, and social life.","summaryZh":"更完整介绍地理、历史、建筑、活态传统、节庆、手工艺与社会生活。","sections":[{"heading":"The Stone Bridge of Mostar","headingZh":"莫斯塔尔石桥","en":"Mostar is known for a high stone bridge that crosses the Neretva River. The bridge connects two sides of the old town and has become one of the country’s clearest visual symbols.","zh":"莫斯塔尔以一座跨越内雷特瓦河的高石桥闻名。这座桥连接老城两侧，已经成为这个国家最清楚的视觉象征之一。","imagePages":["Stari Most","Mostar"],"caption":"The Old Bridge in Mostar"},{"heading":"Bosnian Coffee","headingZh":"波斯尼亚咖啡","en":"Bosnian coffee is often prepared in a small metal pot called a džezva and served slowly with small cups. Drinking it can be a social moment for conversation rather than only a quick drink.","zh":"波斯尼亚咖啡常用一种叫杰兹瓦的小金属壶煮制，再用小杯慢慢喝。喝咖啡常是一段聊天和社交时间，而不只是快速喝一杯饮料。","imagePages":["Bosnian coffee","Džezva"],"caption":"Bosnian coffee served in a metal pot"},{"heading":"Medieval Tombstones","headingZh":"中世纪墓碑","en":"Across the countryside are medieval stone tombstones called stećci. Many are carved with shapes such as people, animals, stars, crosses, or simple geometric designs.","zh":"在乡村各地可以看到叫做斯特奇的中世纪石墓碑。许多墓碑刻有人物、动物、星星、十字架或简单几何图案。","imagePages":["Stećak","Radimlja"],"caption":"Medieval stećci tombstones"},{"heading":"Mostar Bridge and Shared Urban Space","headingZh":"Mostar Bridge and Shared Urban Space","en":"The Old Bridge of Mostar crosses the Neretva and connects parts of a compact historic center. Stone buildings, narrow streets, religious sites, and market areas reveal the city’s long Ottoman and Mediterranean connections. The bridge is therefore both an engineering structure and a cultural symbol of connection.","zh":"莫斯塔尔古桥跨越内雷特瓦河，连接紧凑历史中心的不同部分。石造建筑、窄街、宗教场所和市场区域显示城市长期的奥斯曼与地中海联系。因此这座桥既是工程结构，也是“连接”的文化象征。","imagePages":["Stari Most","Mostar"],"caption":"Mostar Bridge and Shared Urban Space"},{"heading":"Sevdalinka and Bosnian Coffee","headingZh":"Sevdalinka and Bosnian Coffee","en":"Sevdalinka is an urban song tradition associated with emotional melodies and poetic themes of love, distance, and longing. Bosnian coffee, served from a small metal pot, creates another slow social ritual around conversation. Music and coffee both value time, attention, and atmosphere rather than speed.","zh":"塞夫达林卡是一种城市歌曲传统，以深情旋律和爱情、距离、思念等诗性主题闻名。用小金属壶盛装的波斯尼亚咖啡则创造另一种缓慢社交仪式。音乐与咖啡都强调时间、专注和气氛，而不是速度。","imagePages":["Sevdalinka","Bosnian coffee"],"caption":"Sevdalinka and Bosnian Coffee"},{"heading":"Sarajevo Film Festival","headingZh":"Sarajevo Film Festival","en":"The Sarajevo Film Festival began during the 1990s siege of the city and later became a major regional film event. Today it brings screenings, filmmakers, audiences, and public discussion into Sarajevo each summer. Its history gives the festival a meaning that goes beyond entertainment alone.","zh":"萨拉热窝电影节在一九九〇年代城市围困期间开始，后来发展成重要地区电影活动。今天每年夏天都会把放映、电影工作者、观众和公共讨论带进萨拉热窝。它的历史让这个节庆拥有超越娱乐本身的意义。","imagePages":["Sarajevo Film Festival","Sarajevo"],"caption":"Sarajevo Film Festival"}]}}},{"slug":"hungary","name":"Hungary","region":"Europe","flag":"hu","mapId":"348","readOrder":19,"summary":"A non-Slavic language, thermal-bath culture, and paprika make Hungary stand out in Central Europe.","summaryZh":"一种不同于周围许多语言的语言、温泉浴文化与红椒粉，让匈牙利在中欧很突出。","facts":{"Capital":"Budapest","Language":"Hungarian","River":"Danube","Distinctive":"Thermal baths and paprika"},"versions":{"A1":{"title":"Hungary — Easy Country Guide","titleZh":"Hungary——A1 基础版","summary":"Short sentences, essential facts, culture, festivals, and visual clues for easier reading.","summaryZh":"使用较短句子介绍地理、文化、节庆与视觉特色，适合基础阅读。","sections":[{"heading":"Danube and Plains","headingZh":"Danube and Plains","en":"The Danube divides Budapest into two historic sides. Outside the capital, large plains stretch across much of the country.","zh":"多瑙河把布达佩斯分成历史上的两侧。首都之外，广阔平原延伸在国家许多地区。","imagePages":["Danube in Budapest","Great Hungarian Plain"],"caption":"Danube and Plains"},{"heading":"Thermal Baths","headingZh":"Thermal Baths","en":"Hungary has many hot springs. Budapest is famous for large public bath buildings where people relax in warm mineral water.","zh":"匈牙利有许多温泉。布达佩斯以大型公共浴场闻名，人们会在温暖矿泉水中放松。","imagePages":["Széchenyi thermal bath","Thermal baths in Budapest"],"caption":"Thermal Baths"},{"heading":"Busójárás","headingZh":"Busójárás","en":"Busójárás is a winter festival in Mohács. People wear carved masks, fur costumes, and bells to symbolically drive winter away.","zh":"布绍亚拉什是莫哈奇的冬季节庆。人们戴雕刻面具、穿毛皮服装并挂铃铛，象征赶走冬天。","imagePages":["Busójárás","Mohács"],"caption":"Busójárás"},{"heading":"Folk Patterns and Paprika","headingZh":"Folk Patterns and Paprika","en":"Hungarian folk art uses colorful embroidery and painted flowers. Paprika is also strongly connected with local cooking.","zh":"匈牙利民间艺术常使用彩色刺绣和花卉彩绘。红椒粉也与当地烹饪有很深联系。","imagePages":["Matyó embroidery","Paprika"],"caption":"Folk Patterns and Paprika"}]},"B1":{"title":"Hungary — Culture, History, and Everyday Life","titleZh":"Hungary——B1 深入版","summary":"A fuller country profile with geography, history, architecture, living traditions, festivals, crafts, and social life.","summaryZh":"更完整介绍地理、历史、建筑、活态传统、节庆、手工艺与社会生活。","sections":[{"heading":"A Unique Language","headingZh":"独特的语言","en":"Hungarian belongs to the Uralic language family and is very different from most neighboring Slavic and Germanic languages. Its grammar and vocabulary give the country a clear linguistic identity.","zh":"匈牙利语属于乌拉尔语系，与周围大多数斯拉夫语和日耳曼语很不同。它的语法和词汇让这个国家拥有很鲜明的语言特色。","imagePages":["Hungarian language","Uralic languages"],"caption":"The Hungarian language"},{"heading":"Thermal Baths","headingZh":"温泉浴文化","en":"Budapest and other parts of Hungary have many natural hot springs. Large public bath buildings are places for warm pools, relaxation, exercise, and social time.","zh":"布达佩斯和匈牙利其他地区有许多天然温泉。大型公共浴场是泡温水、放松、运动和社交的地方。","imagePages":["Széchenyi thermal bath","Thermal bath"],"caption":"Thermal bath culture in Budapest"},{"heading":"Paprika","headingZh":"红椒粉","en":"Paprika is a red spice made from dried peppers. It is used in many Hungarian dishes and can be mild or hot, giving soups and stews a deep red color.","zh":"红椒粉是由干燥红椒制成的红色香料。它用于许多匈牙利料理，可以不辣也可以很辣，并让汤和炖菜呈现深红色。","imagePages":["Paprika","Hungarian cuisine"],"caption":"Hungarian paprika"},{"heading":"Busójárás and Winter Masks","headingZh":"Busójárás and Winter Masks","en":"In Mohács, the Busójárás festival uses carved wooden masks, fur costumes, horns, bells, and noisy street processions. The dramatic appearance is connected with the symbolic end of winter. Modern celebrations include folk music, dancing, crafts, and large public gatherings.","zh":"莫哈奇的布绍亚拉什节会使用木雕面具、毛皮服装、号角、铃铛和喧闹街头游行。夸张造型与象征冬天结束有关。现代庆祝还包括民间音乐、舞蹈、手工艺和大型公共聚会。","imagePages":["Busójárás","Mohács"],"caption":"Busójárás and Winter Masks"},{"heading":"Thermal Bath Culture","headingZh":"Thermal Bath Culture","en":"Budapest’s bath culture combines geology, architecture, health traditions, and social life. Hot mineral water reaches the surface through numerous springs, while large bath complexes provide indoor and outdoor pools. People may visit for exercise, relaxation, conversation, or simply a long afternoon in warm water.","zh":"布达佩斯浴场文化结合地质、建筑、健康传统与社交生活。许多温泉让热矿泉水涌出地表，大型浴场则提供室内外水池。人们可能为了运动、放松、聊天，或只是花一个下午泡在温水里而前往。","imagePages":["Széchenyi thermal bath","Gellért Baths"],"caption":"Thermal Bath Culture"},{"heading":"Embroidery, Paprika, and Regional Identity","headingZh":"Embroidery, Paprika, and Regional Identity","en":"Matyó embroidery is known for dense, colorful floral patterns. Paprika, meanwhile, became one of the most recognizable flavors and colors in Hungarian cooking. Both show how a local product or design can grow into a national cultural symbol while still keeping strong regional roots.","zh":"马特约刺绣以密集鲜艳花卉图案闻名。红椒粉则成为匈牙利料理最有辨识度的味道与颜色之一。两者都说明地方产品或设计如何发展成国家文化象征，同时仍保留强烈地方根源。","imagePages":["Matyó embroidery","Paprika"],"caption":"Embroidery, Paprika, and Regional Identity"}]}}},{"slug":"austria","name":"Austria","region":"Europe","flag":"at","mapId":"040","readOrder":20,"summary":"Imperial history, classical music, Alpine landscapes, and Heuriger wine taverns define the Austria article.","summaryZh":"帝国历史、古典音乐、阿尔卑斯地景与霍伊里格葡萄酒小酒馆，是奥地利文章的核心。","facts":{"Capital":"Vienna","Language":"German","Landscape":"Alps and Danube valley","Tradition":"Heuriger wine taverns"},"versions":{"A1":{"title":"Austria — Easy Country Guide","titleZh":"Austria——A1 基础版","summary":"Short sentences, essential facts, culture, festivals, and visual clues for easier reading.","summaryZh":"使用较短句子介绍地理、文化、节庆与视觉特色，适合基础阅读。","sections":[{"heading":"Alps and Danube","headingZh":"Alps and Danube","en":"Austria is shaped by the Alps in the west and the Danube in the east. Mountain valleys, lakes, and historic cities create different regional landscapes.","zh":"奥地利西部受阿尔卑斯山影响，东部则有多瑙河。山谷、湖泊和历史城市形成不同地区景观。","imagePages":["Austrian Alps","Danube in Austria"],"caption":"Alps and Danube"},{"heading":"Coffeehouse Culture","headingZh":"Coffeehouse Culture","en":"Viennese coffeehouses are places to drink coffee, read, talk, and stay for a long time. They became important spaces for urban social life.","zh":"维也纳咖啡馆是喝咖啡、阅读、聊天并停留很久的地方，也成为城市社交生活的重要空间。","imagePages":["Viennese coffee house","Café Central"],"caption":"Coffeehouse Culture"},{"heading":"Ball Season","headingZh":"Ball Season","en":"During winter, Vienna holds many formal balls. People wear evening clothes and dance in historic halls.","zh":"冬季时，维也纳会举行许多正式舞会。人们穿晚礼服，在历史大厅中跳舞。","imagePages":["Viennese ball","Vienna Opera Ball"],"caption":"Ball Season"},{"heading":"Music and Alpine Traditions","headingZh":"Music and Alpine Traditions","en":"Classical music remains visible in concert halls and festivals. In mountain regions, folk music, decorated clothing, and seasonal cattle traditions also continue.","zh":"古典音乐在音乐厅和节庆中仍然很常见。山区也保留民间音乐、装饰性服饰和季节性赶牛传统。","imagePages":["Music of Austria","Almabtrieb"],"caption":"Music and Alpine Traditions"}]},"B1":{"title":"Austria — Culture, History, and Everyday Life","titleZh":"Austria——B1 深入版","summary":"A fuller country profile with geography, history, architecture, living traditions, festivals, crafts, and social life.","summaryZh":"更完整介绍地理、历史、建筑、活态传统、节庆、手工艺与社会生活。","sections":[{"heading":"An Old Imperial Center","headingZh":"旧帝国中心","en":"For centuries, Vienna was an important center of a large European empire. Palaces, government buildings, formal gardens, and grand streets still show this imperial history.","zh":"几个世纪以来，维也纳一直是一个大型欧洲帝国的重要中心。宫殿、政府建筑、正式花园和宽阔街道至今仍能看见这段帝国历史。","imagePages":["Habsburg monarchy","Hofburg"],"caption":"Imperial architecture in Vienna"},{"heading":"Classical Music","headingZh":"古典音乐","en":"Austria has a strong classical-music tradition. Concert halls, opera houses, music schools, and orchestras are still an important part of cultural life, especially in Vienna and Salzburg.","zh":"奥地利有很深的古典音乐传统。音乐厅、歌剧院、音乐学校和乐团至今仍是文化生活的重要部分，特别是在维也纳和萨尔茨堡。","imagePages":["Vienna State Opera","Classical music"],"caption":"Austria’s classical-music tradition"},{"heading":"Heuriger Wine Taverns","headingZh":"霍伊里格葡萄酒小酒馆","en":"Around Vienna and other wine regions, a Heuriger is a traditional place where local new wine is served with simple food. These taverns often have gardens and a relaxed social atmosphere.","zh":"在维也纳周边和其他葡萄酒地区，霍伊里格是一种提供当地新酒和简单食物的传统小酒馆。这些地方常有花园和轻松的社交气氛。","imagePages":["Heuriger","Vienna wine"],"caption":"A traditional Heuriger"},{"heading":"Viennese Coffeehouse Culture","headingZh":"Viennese Coffeehouse Culture","en":"The traditional Viennese coffeehouse is designed for lingering rather than quick service. Newspapers, small tables, cakes, and repeated cups of coffee created spaces where people could read, write, talk, and observe city life. The social meaning comes from the permission to stay.","zh":"传统维也纳咖啡馆的设计重点不是快速服务，而是让人长时间停留。报纸、小桌、蛋糕和一杯又一杯咖啡形成可以阅读、写作、聊天和观察城市生活的空间。它的社交意义来自“可以留下来很久”这件事。","imagePages":["Viennese coffee house","Café Central"],"caption":"Viennese Coffeehouse Culture"},{"heading":"Ball Season and Formal Dance","headingZh":"Ball Season and Formal Dance","en":"Vienna’s winter ball season includes events in historic halls, hotels, and cultural institutions. Formal clothing, opening dances, orchestras, and carefully organized programs create a ritualized social world. Although the atmosphere looks traditional, many balls are active contemporary events rather than museum performances.","zh":"维也纳冬季舞会季包含在历史大厅、饭店和文化机构举行的活动。正式服装、开场舞、乐团和精心安排的节目创造仪式化社交世界。虽然气氛看起来传统，许多舞会其实是活跃的现代活动，并不是博物馆表演。","imagePages":["Viennese ball","Vienna Opera Ball"],"caption":"Ball Season and Formal Dance"},{"heading":"Alpine Seasonal Traditions","headingZh":"Alpine Seasonal Traditions","en":"In mountain regions, livestock may spend summer on high pastures and return to villages in autumn. Some communities celebrate the return with decorated cattle, flowers, bells, and local gatherings. These events reveal the older agricultural calendar that still sits beneath modern tourism and urban life.","zh":"山区牲畜可能在高山牧场度过夏天，秋季再回到村庄。有些社区会用装饰牛只、花、铃铛和地方聚会庆祝回归。这些活动显露现代旅游与都市生活之下仍然存在的传统农业季节节奏。","imagePages":["Almabtrieb","Austrian Alps"],"caption":"Alpine Seasonal Traditions"}]}}},{"slug":"slovenia","name":"Slovenia","region":"Europe","flag":"si","mapId":"705","readOrder":21,"summary":"Beekeeping, wooden hayracks, and potica rolled cake create a very distinctive Slovenia article.","summaryZh":"养蜂、木制干草架与波提察卷蛋糕，构成斯洛文尼亚很有特色的文章。","facts":{"Capital":"Ljubljana","Language":"Slovene","Landscape":"Alps, forests, karst","Tradition":"Beekeeping"},"versions":{"A1":{"title":"Slovenia — Easy Country Guide","titleZh":"Slovenia——A1 基础版","summary":"Short sentences, essential facts, culture, festivals, and visual clues for easier reading.","summaryZh":"使用较短句子介绍地理、文化、节庆与视觉特色，适合基础阅读。","sections":[{"heading":"Alps, Karst, and Sea","headingZh":"Alps, Karst, and Sea","en":"Slovenia has Alpine mountains, forests, karst caves, rivers, and a short Adriatic coast. Many landscapes are close together.","zh":"斯洛文尼亚有阿尔卑斯山、森林、喀斯特洞穴、河流和一小段亚得里亚海海岸，多种地景彼此很接近。","imagePages":["Lake Bled","Škocjan Caves"],"caption":"Alps, Karst, and Sea"},{"heading":"Beekeeping","headingZh":"Beekeeping","en":"Beekeeping is a strong Slovenian tradition. Painted beehive panels and the Carniolan honey bee are well-known symbols.","zh":"养蜂是斯洛文尼亚的重要传统。彩绘蜂箱板和卡尼鄂拉蜜蜂都是知名文化象征。","imagePages":["Slovenian beekeeping","Carniolan honey bee"],"caption":"Beekeeping"},{"heading":"Kurentovanje","headingZh":"Kurentovanje","en":"Kurentovanje is a carnival tradition around Ptuj. Kurent performers wear sheepskin, bells, and large masks to chase away winter.","zh":"库伦托瓦涅是普图伊一带的狂欢节传统。库伦特表演者穿羊皮、挂铃铛并戴大面具，象征赶走冬天。","imagePages":["Kurentovanje","Kurent"],"caption":"Kurentovanje"},{"heading":"Hayracks and Potica","headingZh":"Hayracks and Potica","en":"Traditional wooden hayracks are a distinctive feature of the countryside. Potica is a rolled festive cake with different fillings.","zh":"传统木制干草架是乡村很有特色的景观。波蒂察是一种卷起烘烤的节庆蛋糕，可以有不同馅料。","imagePages":["Hayrack","Potica"],"caption":"Hayracks and Potica"}]},"B1":{"title":"Slovenia — Culture, History, and Everyday Life","titleZh":"Slovenia——B1 深入版","summary":"A fuller country profile with geography, history, architecture, living traditions, festivals, crafts, and social life.","summaryZh":"更完整介绍地理、历史、建筑、活态传统、节庆、手工艺与社会生活。","sections":[{"heading":"Beekeeping Culture","headingZh":"养蜂文化","en":"Beekeeping has a long tradition in Slovenia. Painted beehive panels, local honey, and the Carniolan honey bee are strongly connected with rural culture and environmental education.","zh":"养蜂在斯洛文尼亚有很长的传统。彩绘蜂箱板、当地蜂蜜和卡尼鄂拉蜜蜂，都与乡村文化和环境教育紧密相关。","imagePages":["Carniolan honey bee","Beekeeping in Slovenia"],"caption":"Slovenian beekeeping culture"},{"heading":"Wooden Hayracks","headingZh":"木制干草架","en":"Traditional wooden hayracks stand in fields and are used to dry hay or store farm products. Their special shape is one of the most recognizable parts of the Slovenian countryside.","zh":"传统木制干草架立在田野中，用来晒干草或存放农产品。它们特殊的形状，是斯洛文尼亚乡村最容易辨认的景象之一。","imagePages":["Hayrack","Toplar hayrack"],"caption":"Traditional Slovenian hayracks"},{"heading":"Potica","headingZh":"波提察卷蛋糕","en":"Potica is a rolled cake filled with ingredients such as walnuts, poppy seeds, or other sweet fillings. It is often prepared for holidays and family celebrations.","zh":"波提察是一种卷蛋糕，里面可以加入核桃、罂粟籽或其他甜馅。它常在节日和家庭庆祝时制作。","imagePages":["Potica","Slovenian cuisine"],"caption":"Potica rolled cake"},{"heading":"Beekeeping as National Culture","headingZh":"Beekeeping as National Culture","en":"Slovenia treats beekeeping as more than food production. Painted hive panels, specialist knowledge, local honey, and the Carniolan honey bee all carry cultural meaning. Beekeeping also links rural tradition with modern environmental awareness, making it an unusually visible part of national identity.","zh":"斯洛文尼亚把养蜂视为不只是食品生产。彩绘蜂箱板、专业知识、地方蜂蜜和卡尼鄂拉蜜蜂都具有文化意义。养蜂也把乡村传统与现代环境意识连接起来，因此成为非常显眼的国家认同元素。","imagePages":["Slovenian beekeeping","Carniolan honey bee"],"caption":"Beekeeping as National Culture"},{"heading":"Kurentovanje and the End of Winter","headingZh":"Kurentovanje and the End of Winter","en":"Around Ptuj, Kurent performers wear shaggy sheepskin outfits, large bells, and horned or feathered masks. Their noisy movement is traditionally associated with driving winter away and encouraging fertility. The festival turns old seasonal symbolism into a large contemporary carnival.","zh":"普图伊一带的库伦特表演者会穿毛茸茸羊皮服、挂大型铃铛并戴有角或羽毛面具。喧闹动作传统上与赶走冬天、促进丰收有关。这个节庆把古老季节象征转化成大型现代狂欢活动。","imagePages":["Kurentovanje","Kurent"],"caption":"Kurentovanje and the End of Winter"},{"heading":"Hayracks, Karst, and Rural Design","headingZh":"Hayracks, Karst, and Rural Design","en":"Slovenia’s double hayracks are distinctive wooden structures used to dry and store hay. Karst regions add another visual language of caves, limestone, and disappearing rivers. Together these features show how practical rural design and unusual geology can shape a country’s cultural landscape.","zh":"斯洛文尼亚的双层干草架是用于晾晒和储存干草的独特木结构。喀斯特地区则增加洞穴、石灰岩和地下河等另一套视觉语言。这些特色说明实际乡村设计与特殊地质都能塑造国家文化地景。","imagePages":["Hayrack","Škocjan Caves"],"caption":"Hayracks, Karst, and Rural Design"}]}}},{"slug":"croatia","name":"Croatia","region":"Europe","flag":"hr","mapId":"191","readOrder":22,"summary":"The necktie, klapa singing, and red-heart licitar cookies are memorable Croatian cultural symbols.","summaryZh":"领带、克拉帕合唱与红心利奇塔尔饼，是很有记忆点的克罗地亚文化符号。","facts":{"Capital":"Zagreb","Language":"Croatian","Coast":"Adriatic Sea","Distinctive":"Necktie, klapa, licitar"},"versions":{"A1":{"title":"Croatia — Easy Country Guide","titleZh":"Croatia——A1 基础版","summary":"Short sentences, essential facts, culture, festivals, and visual clues for easier reading.","summaryZh":"使用较短句子介绍地理、文化、节庆与视觉特色，适合基础阅读。","sections":[{"heading":"Adriatic Coast","headingZh":"Adriatic Coast","en":"Croatia has a long Adriatic coast with many islands. Stone towns, harbors, and clear water shape the coastal region.","zh":"克罗地亚有很长的亚得里亚海海岸和许多岛屿。石造城镇、港口和清澈海水塑造沿海地区。","imagePages":["Dubrovnik","Dalmatian coast"],"caption":"Adriatic Coast"},{"heading":"Plitvice Lakes","headingZh":"Plitvice Lakes","en":"Plitvice Lakes are known for connected lakes, waterfalls, and forest paths. The water changes color with light and minerals.","zh":"十六湖以相连湖泊、瀑布和森林步道闻名。湖水会因光线和矿物质呈现不同颜色。","imagePages":["Plitvice Lakes National Park","Plitvice Lakes"],"caption":"Plitvice Lakes"},{"heading":"Sinjska Alka","headingZh":"Sinjska Alka","en":"Sinjska Alka is a traditional horse competition. Riders try to hit a small metal ring with a lance while moving at speed.","zh":"辛伊阿尔卡是一种传统马术比赛。骑手快速前进时，要用长矛击中一个小金属环。","imagePages":["Sinjska alka","Sinj"],"caption":"Sinjska Alka"},{"heading":"Klapa and Lace","headingZh":"Klapa and Lace","en":"Klapa is a traditional style of group singing from the coast. Croatian lace-making also has strong local traditions in several towns and islands.","zh":"克拉帕是沿海地区的传统合唱形式。克罗地亚多个城镇与岛屿也有深厚的蕾丝制作传统。","imagePages":["Klapa","Croatian lacemaking"],"caption":"Klapa and Lace"}]},"B1":{"title":"Croatia — Culture, History, and Everyday Life","titleZh":"Croatia——B1 深入版","summary":"A fuller country profile with geography, history, architecture, living traditions, festivals, crafts, and social life.","summaryZh":"更完整介绍地理、历史、建筑、活态传统、节庆、手工艺与社会生活。","sections":[{"heading":"The Necktie Connection","headingZh":"领带的来源联系","en":"The modern necktie is often connected with Croatian soldiers who wore cloth around the neck in seventeenth-century Europe. The style became fashionable in France and later developed into the tie used today.","zh":"现代领带常与十七世纪欧洲的克罗地亚士兵有关，他们会在脖子上系布。这种样式后来在法国流行，并逐渐发展成今天的领带。","imagePages":["Cravat (early)","Necktie"],"caption":"The historical cravat"},{"heading":"Klapa Singing","headingZh":"克拉帕合唱","en":"Klapa is a traditional style of group singing from the Adriatic coast. Several voices sing closely together, often without many instruments, creating a rich and warm sound.","zh":"克拉帕是亚得里亚海岸的传统合唱形式。几个人的声音紧密配合，常常没有太多乐器，形成浓厚而温暖的声音。","imagePages":["Klapa","Dalmatia"],"caption":"Traditional klapa singing"},{"heading":"Red Heart Licitar","headingZh":"红心利奇塔尔","en":"Licitar are brightly decorated honey-dough cookies, often made in a red heart shape. They can be gifts, decorations, or festival souvenirs rather than only everyday food.","zh":"利奇塔尔是一种颜色鲜艳、用蜂蜜面团制作的装饰饼，常做成红色心形。它们可以是礼物、装饰或节庆纪念品，而不只是日常食物。","imagePages":["Licitar","Croatian cuisine"],"caption":"Red heart-shaped licitar"},{"heading":"Adriatic Stone Towns","headingZh":"Adriatic Stone Towns","en":"Croatia’s Adriatic coast contains fortified towns, harbors, islands, and pale limestone architecture shaped by centuries of maritime trade. Dubrovnik is especially known for its walls and dense old city, while other coastal communities developed around fishing, ship travel, and regional markets. The coast therefore gives Croatian culture a strong Mediterranean dimension that differs from the inland plains and mountains.","zh":"克罗地亚亚得里亚海沿岸有城墙城镇、港口、岛屿和浅色石灰岩建筑，这些景观受到数百年海上贸易影响。杜布罗夫尼克尤其以城墙和密集老城闻名，其他沿海社区则围绕捕鱼、航运和地区市场发展。因此海岸赋予克罗地亚文化很强的地中海特色，与内陆平原和山区不同。","imagePages":["Dubrovnik","Dalmatian coast"],"caption":"Adriatic Stone Towns"},{"heading":"Sinjska Alka","headingZh":"Sinjska Alka","en":"The Sinjska Alka is a historic equestrian competition held in Sinj. Riders gallop along a track and try to strike a small hanging metal ring with a lance. The event combines horse skill, ceremonial clothing, local history, and a strong sense of town identity.","zh":"辛伊阿尔卡是在辛伊举行的历史马术竞赛。骑手沿赛道疾驰，并尝试用长矛击中悬挂的小金属环。这个活动结合骑术、仪式服装、地方历史和强烈城镇认同。","imagePages":["Sinjska alka","Sinj"],"caption":"Sinjska Alka"},{"heading":"Lace, Stone, and Coastal Craft","headingZh":"Lace, Stone, and Coastal Craft","en":"Different Croatian regions developed distinctive lace traditions, while Adriatic towns use pale stone in walls, streets, and churches. Island and coastal craft traditions often grew from limited local materials and long maritime connections. The result is a visual culture strongly tied to place.","zh":"克罗地亚不同地区发展出独特蕾丝传统，亚得里亚海城镇则大量使用浅色石材铺设城墙、街道和教堂。岛屿与沿海手工传统常从有限地方材料和长期海洋联系中发展，因此视觉文化与地点有很强关系。","imagePages":["Croatian lacemaking","Dubrovnik"],"caption":"Lace, Stone, and Coastal Craft"}]}}},{"slug":"ukraine","name":"Ukraine","region":"Europe","flag":"ua","mapId":"804","readOrder":23,"summary":"Black soil, the Dnipro River, embroidered shirts, and wax-decorated spring eggs are key themes.","summaryZh":"黑土地、第聂伯河、刺绣衬衫与蜡染春季彩蛋，是乌克兰的重要主题。","facts":{"Capital":"Kyiv","Language":"Ukrainian","River":"Dnipro","Landscape":"Plains and rich black soil"},"versions":{"A1":{"title":"Ukraine — Easy Country Guide","titleZh":"Ukraine——A1 基础版","summary":"Short sentences, essential facts, culture, festivals, and visual clues for easier reading.","summaryZh":"使用较短句子介绍地理、文化、节庆与视觉特色，适合基础阅读。","sections":[{"heading":"Dnipro River","headingZh":"Dnipro River","en":"The Dnipro is one of Ukraine’s most important rivers. It crosses the country from north to south and has shaped cities, transport, and farming.","zh":"第聂伯河是乌克兰最重要的河流之一，从北向南流经全国，深刻影响城市、交通和农业。","imagePages":["Dnieper","Geography of Ukraine"],"caption":"Dnipro River"},{"heading":"Black Soil and Fields","headingZh":"Black Soil and Fields","en":"Large areas of Ukraine have very fertile black soil. Wheat, sunflowers, and other crops are important parts of the landscape.","zh":"乌克兰大片地区拥有肥沃黑土。小麦、向日葵等作物是常见地景的一部分。","imagePages":["Chernozem","Sunflower fields in Ukraine"],"caption":"Black Soil and Fields"},{"heading":"Pysanka","headingZh":"Pysanka","en":"Pysanka are eggs decorated with wax-resist patterns, especially around Easter. Colors and symbols can carry traditional meanings.","zh":"皮桑卡是使用蜡染方式装饰的彩蛋，尤其常见于复活节前后。颜色和图案常具有传统象征意义。","imagePages":["Pysanka","Ukrainian Easter egg"],"caption":"Pysanka"},{"heading":"Embroidery and Bandura","headingZh":"Embroidery and Bandura","en":"Vyshyvanka shirts use regional embroidery patterns. The bandura is a plucked string instrument strongly connected with Ukrainian musical tradition.","zh":"维什万卡衬衫使用地区性刺绣图案。班杜拉是一种拨弦乐器，与乌克兰音乐传统密切相关。","imagePages":["Vyshyvanka","Bandura"],"caption":"Embroidery and Bandura"}]},"B1":{"title":"Ukraine — Culture, History, and Everyday Life","titleZh":"Ukraine——B1 深入版","summary":"A fuller country profile with geography, history, architecture, living traditions, festivals, crafts, and social life.","summaryZh":"更完整介绍地理、历史、建筑、活态传统、节庆、手工艺与社会生活。","sections":[{"heading":"Flat Land and Black Soil","headingZh":"平原与黑土地","en":"Much of Ukraine is made of broad plains with rich black soil. This land is well suited to crops such as wheat, corn, and sunflowers, so farming has long been important.","zh":"乌克兰大部分地区是广阔平原，并拥有肥沃的黑土地。这种土地适合种植小麦、玉米和向日葵，因此农业长期很重要。","imagePages":["Chernozem","Agriculture in Ukraine"],"caption":"Ukraine’s rich black soil"},{"heading":"The Dnipro River","headingZh":"第聂伯河","en":"The Dnipro River runs through a large part of Ukraine and passes through the capital, Kyiv. It has been important for transport, settlement, water, and trade for many centuries.","zh":"第聂伯河流经乌克兰很大一部分地区，并经过首都基辅。几个世纪以来，它一直对交通、聚落、水资源和贸易很重要。","imagePages":["Dnipro","Kyiv"],"caption":"The Dnipro River"},{"heading":"Embroidery and Spring Eggs","headingZh":"刺绣与春季彩蛋","en":"Traditional embroidered shirts use colorful geometric or plant patterns. In spring, people also decorate eggs with wax and colored dyes, a craft that can be passed through families for generations.","zh":"传统刺绣衬衫使用彩色几何或植物图案。春天时，人们也会用蜡和彩色染料装饰鸡蛋，这种工艺可以在家庭中代代传承。","imagePages":["Vyshyvanka","Pysanka"],"caption":"Ukrainian embroidery and pysanka eggs"},{"heading":"Pysanka and Symbolic Pattern","headingZh":"Pysanka and Symbolic Pattern","en":"Pysanka decoration uses a wax-resist method: wax protects parts of the shell while different colors are added in stages. Geometric shapes, plants, animals, and Christian symbols can all appear. The process turns a small egg into a carefully planned surface of layered meaning.","zh":"皮桑卡装饰使用蜡染法：蜡会保护蛋壳部分区域，再分阶段加入不同颜色。几何形、植物、动物和基督教符号都可能出现。这个过程把小小的蛋变成具有多层意义的精心设计表面。","imagePages":["Pysanka","Ukrainian Easter egg"],"caption":"Pysanka and Symbolic Pattern"},{"heading":"Vyshyvanka and Regional Identity","headingZh":"Vyshyvanka and Regional Identity","en":"Vyshyvanka embroidery differs by region in color, stitch, and pattern. Shirts are worn on holidays, family occasions, and public cultural events, making textile design part of visible identity. The clothing demonstrates how a practical garment can also function as a map of local tradition.","zh":"维什万卡刺绣会因地区而在颜色、针法和图案上不同。衬衫会在节日、家庭场合和公共文化活动中穿着，让纺织设计成为可见认同的一部分。这种服装说明实用衣物也能像地方传统地图一样发挥作用。","imagePages":["Vyshyvanka","Ukrainian embroidery"],"caption":"Vyshyvanka and Regional Identity"},{"heading":"Dnipro, Black Soil, and Landscape","headingZh":"Dnipro, Black Soil, and Landscape","en":"The Dnipro River crosses major cities and broad agricultural regions, while fertile chernozem soil supports extensive farming. Sunflower and grain fields have become familiar visual symbols. Geography therefore connects natural resources, settlement, transport, and cultural imagery.","zh":"第聂伯河流经大型城市与广阔农业地区，肥沃黑土则支持大规模农业。向日葵和谷物田已经成为熟悉视觉象征。因此地理把自然资源、聚落、交通与文化意象连接起来。","imagePages":["Dnieper","Chernozem"],"caption":"Dnipro, Black Soil, and Landscape"}]}}},{"slug":"moldova","name":"Moldova","region":"Europe","flag":"md","mapId":"498","readOrder":24,"summary":"Vineyards, underground wine cellars, wall carpets, farmland, and two major rivers characterize Moldova.","summaryZh":"葡萄园、地下酒窖、墙上地毯、农田与两条重要河流，是摩尔多瓦的主要特色。","facts":{"Capital":"Chișinău","Language":"Romanian; Russian also used","Rivers":"Dniester and Prut","Landscape":"Low hills and farmland"},"versions":{"A1":{"title":"Moldova — Easy Country Guide","titleZh":"Moldova——A1 基础版","summary":"Short sentences, essential facts, culture, festivals, and visual clues for easier reading.","summaryZh":"使用较短句子介绍地理、文化、节庆与视觉特色，适合基础阅读。","sections":[{"heading":"Rivers and Vineyards","headingZh":"Rivers and Vineyards","en":"Moldova lies between the Prut and Dniester river systems. Rolling farmland and vineyards cover much of the countryside.","zh":"摩尔多瓦位于普鲁特河和德涅斯特河水系之间。起伏农田和葡萄园覆盖许多乡村地区。","imagePages":["Dniester","Vineyards in Moldova"],"caption":"Rivers and Vineyards"},{"heading":"Wine Cellars","headingZh":"Wine Cellars","en":"Wine-making has a long history in Moldova. Some wineries have very large underground tunnels used for storing bottles and barrels.","zh":"葡萄酒酿造在摩尔多瓦历史悠久。一些酒庄拥有大型地下隧道，用来储存酒瓶和木桶。","imagePages":["Mileștii Mici","Cricova (winery)"],"caption":"Wine Cellars"},{"heading":"Mărțișor","headingZh":"Mărțișor","en":"On March 1, people give red-and-white Mărțișor charms to welcome spring. They are worn for days or weeks and later may be tied to a tree.","zh":"三月一日，人们会互赠红白色马尔齐绍尔饰物迎接春天。人们会佩戴一段时间，之后也可能把它系在树上。","imagePages":["Mărțișor","Mărțișor"],"caption":"Mărțișor"},{"heading":"Carpets and Village Life","headingZh":"Carpets and Village Life","en":"Traditional carpets use geometric and plant patterns. In villages, gardens, fruit trees, wells, ovens, and family gatherings remain visible parts of local life.","zh":"传统地毯常使用几何和植物图案。乡村生活中，菜园、果树、水井、烤炉和家庭聚会仍然很常见。","imagePages":["Moldovan carpet","Village in Moldova"],"caption":"Carpets and Village Life"}]},"B1":{"title":"Moldova — Culture, History, and Everyday Life","titleZh":"Moldova——B1 深入版","summary":"A fuller country profile with geography, history, architecture, living traditions, festivals, crafts, and social life.","summaryZh":"更完整介绍地理、历史、建筑、活态传统、节庆、手工艺与社会生活。","sections":[{"heading":"Farmland Between Two Rivers","headingZh":"两条河之间的农田","en":"Moldova is in Eastern Europe between Romania and Ukraine. It has low hills and farmland, and the Dniester and Prut Rivers are important parts of its geography. Grapes, fruit, corn, and wheat are widely grown.","zh":"摩尔多瓦位于东欧，在罗马尼亚和乌克兰之间。这里有低矮丘陵和农田，第聂斯特河与普鲁特河是重要地理元素。葡萄、水果、玉米和小麦都很常见。","imagePages":["Geography of Moldova","Dniester"],"caption":"Moldova’s farmland and rivers"},{"heading":"Vineyards and Underground Cellars","headingZh":"葡萄园与地下酒窖","en":"Grape growing has a long history in Moldova. Some wine cellars extend through long underground tunnels, where bottles can be stored in cool and stable conditions.","zh":"种植葡萄在摩尔多瓦有很长的历史。一些酒窖延伸成很长的地下隧道，酒瓶可以在凉爽而稳定的环境中储存。","imagePages":["Cricova (winery)","Moldovan wine"],"caption":"Underground wine cellars"},{"heading":"Traditional Wall Carpets","headingZh":"传统墙上织毯","en":"Traditional wool carpets may show flowers, trees, birds, or geometric patterns. They can be placed on walls inside homes, adding color and showing craft traditions passed through families.","zh":"传统羊毛地毯可能画有花、树、鸟或几何图案。它们可以挂在家里的墙上，增加色彩，也展现家庭代代传承的手工艺。","imagePages":["Moldovan carpet","Culture of Moldova"],"caption":"Traditional woven wall carpets"},{"heading":"Mărțișor and Spring","headingZh":"Mărțișor and Spring","en":"On March 1, red-and-white Mărțișor charms appear in schools, streets, offices, and homes. People give them to friends and relatives, wear them for part of March, and may later tie them to a tree. The custom turns the seasonal change into a visible social ritual.","zh":"三月一日，红白色马尔齐绍尔饰物会出现在学校、街道、办公室和家庭。人们把它送给朋友与亲人，在三月佩戴一段时间，也可能之后系在树上。这项习俗把季节变化转化成可见的社会仪式。","imagePages":["Mărțișor","Mărțișor"],"caption":"Mărțișor and Spring"},{"heading":"Underground Wine Worlds","headingZh":"Underground Wine Worlds","en":"Moldova’s wine culture is unusually visible underground. Some wineries use long limestone tunnels as storage spaces, with roads, cellars, tasting rooms, and huge bottle collections below the surface. The physical scale of these cellars makes wine heritage feel almost architectural.","zh":"摩尔多瓦葡萄酒文化在地下特别明显。一些酒庄利用长距离石灰岩隧道储酒，地底有道路、酒窖、品酒室和庞大酒瓶收藏。这些酒窖的实体规模让葡萄酒传统几乎像一种地下建筑文化。","imagePages":["Mileștii Mici","Cricova (winery)"],"caption":"Underground Wine Worlds"},{"heading":"Carpets and Rural Hospitality","headingZh":"Carpets and Rural Hospitality","en":"Traditional carpets use stylized flowers, trees, birds, and geometric forms, often covering walls as well as floors. In rural guesthouses, gardens, fruit preserves, bread, wine, and long shared meals remain important ways of presenting local hospitality. Domestic space becomes a cultural display without needing a museum.","zh":"传统地毯会使用风格化花朵、树、鸟和几何图形，不只铺地，也常挂在墙上。乡村民宿中，菜园、果酱、面包、葡萄酒和长时间共享餐食仍是展现地方待客的重要方式。家庭空间本身就能成为文化展示，而不需要博物馆。","imagePages":["Moldovan carpet","Village in Moldova"],"caption":"Carpets and Rural Hospitality"}]}}},{"slug":"germany","name":"Germany","region":"Europe","flag":"de","mapId":"276","readOrder":25,"summary":"Four articles cover geography and federal regions, division and reunification, skilled industry, and everyday traditions.","summaryZh":"四篇文章分别介绍地理与联邦州、分裂与统一、技术产业，以及日常传统。","facts":{"Capital":"Berlin","Language":"German","States":"16","River":"Rhine"},"versions":{"A1":{"title":"Germany — Easy Country Guide","titleZh":"Germany——A1 基础版","summary":"Short sentences, essential facts, culture, festivals, and visual clues for easier reading.","summaryZh":"使用较短句子介绍地理、文化、节庆与视觉特色，适合基础阅读。","sections":[{"heading":"Regions and Rivers","headingZh":"Regions and Rivers","en":"Germany is in Central Europe and has 16 federal states. The Rhine, Elbe, and Danube are important rivers, and the landscape changes from northern plains to southern Alps.","zh":"德国位于中欧，由十六个联邦州组成。莱茵河、易北河和多瑙河都是重要河流，地景从北部平原一直变化到南部阿尔卑斯山。","imagePages":["Rhine","Geography of Germany"],"caption":"Regions and Rivers"},{"heading":"Bread Culture","headingZh":"Bread Culture","en":"Germany has a very wide variety of breads and baked goods. Different regions use rye, wheat, spelt, seeds, and local baking traditions.","zh":"德国拥有非常多种面包和烘焙食品。不同地区会使用黑麦、小麦、斯佩耳特小麦、种子以及地方烘焙传统。","imagePages":["German bread","Bakery"],"caption":"Bread Culture"},{"heading":"Christmas Markets","headingZh":"Christmas Markets","en":"In Advent, many towns open Christmas markets with lights, wooden stalls, food, crafts, and hot drinks. Historic town squares become busy evening meeting places.","zh":"降临节期间，许多城镇会举行圣诞市集，有灯饰、木摊、食物、手工艺和热饮。历史广场会成为热闹的夜间聚会地点。","imagePages":["Christmas market","Nuremberg Christkindlesmarkt"],"caption":"Christmas Markets"},{"heading":"Bauhaus and Clubs","headingZh":"Bauhaus and Clubs","en":"Bauhaus design influenced modern architecture and furniture. Local clubs for sport, music, gardening, and other hobbies are also an important part of community life.","zh":"包豪斯设计影响现代建筑与家具。运动、音乐、园艺等地方社团也是社区生活的重要组成部分。","imagePages":["Bauhaus","Verein"],"caption":"Bauhaus and Clubs"}]},"B1":{"title":"Germany — Culture, History, and Everyday Life","titleZh":"Germany——B1 深入版","summary":"A fuller country profile with geography, history, architecture, living traditions, festivals, crafts, and social life.","summaryZh":"更完整介绍地理、历史、建筑、活态传统、节庆、手工艺与社会生活。","sections":[{"heading":"Central Europe and Nine Neighbors","headingZh":"中欧与九个邻国","en":"Germany is in the center of Europe and has nine neighboring countries. The north is flatter and closer to the North Sea and Baltic Sea, while the south rises toward the Alps.","zh":"德国位于欧洲中部，与九个国家接壤。北部地势较平，靠近北海和波罗的海；南部则逐渐升高，接近阿尔卑斯山。","imagePages":["Germany","Geography of Germany"],"caption":"Germany in Central Europe"},{"heading":"The Rhine River","headingZh":"莱茵河","en":"The Rhine River has been important for trade for hundreds of years. Ships carry goods past cities, vineyards, castles, and industrial areas, linking Germany with other parts of Western Europe.","zh":"莱茵河几百年来一直对贸易很重要。船只载着货物经过城市、葡萄园、城堡和工业区，把德国与西欧其他地区连接起来。","imagePages":["Rhine","Rhine Gorge"],"caption":"The Rhine River and its trade route"},{"heading":"A Modern Federal State","headingZh":"现代联邦国家","en":"Modern Germany became a federal state in 1871. During the following decades, the country changed quickly through industry, cities, war, and political conflict.","zh":"现代德国在1871年成为一个联邦国家。接下来的几十年里，这个国家经历工业化、城市发展、战争与政治冲突，变化很快。","imagePages":["German Empire","History of Germany"],"caption":"Germany after 1871"},{"heading":"Germany Was Divided","headingZh":"德国被分裂","en":"After the Second World War, Germany was divided. Two German states were created in 1949, one in the west and one in the east, with different political and economic systems.","zh":"第二次世界大战后，德国被分裂。1949年出现两个德国国家，一个在西部，一个在东部，拥有不同的政治和经济制度。","imagePages":["History of Germany (1945–1990)","Allied-occupied Germany"],"caption":"Postwar division"},{"heading":"Machines, Cars, and Equipment","headingZh":"机器、汽车与设备","en":"Germany has a long history of making machines, cars, tools, chemicals, and factory equipment. Manufacturing is spread across many regions rather than being limited to one city.","zh":"德国有很长的机器、汽车、工具、化学品和工厂设备制造历史。制造业分布在许多地区，而不是只集中在一座城市。","imagePages":["Economy of Germany","Automotive industry in Germany"],"caption":"German manufacturing"},{"heading":"Skilled Work","headingZh":"技术型工作","en":"Many German companies depend on skilled workers who understand machines, metal, electronics, design, or production systems. Precision and reliable technical training are important in these jobs.","zh":"许多德国公司依靠熟悉机器、金属、电子、设计或生产系统的技术工人。精确度和可靠的技术训练在这些工作中很重要。","imagePages":["German engineering","Machine industry"],"caption":"Skilled technical work"},{"heading":"Christmas Markets and Advent","headingZh":"Christmas Markets and Advent","en":"From late November through Advent, many German towns set up Christmas markets in historic squares. Wooden stalls sell seasonal food, crafts, decorations, and hot drinks beneath lights and church towers. The markets are not identical: regional foods, local handicrafts, and the character of each old town give them different identities.","zh":"从十一月底到降临节期间，德国许多城镇会在历史广场设置圣诞市集。木摊在灯饰和教堂塔楼下出售季节食物、手工艺、装饰品和热饮。不同市集并不完全相同，各地食物、地方手工艺和老城风貌都会形成不同特色。","imagePages":["Christmas market","Nuremberg Christkindlesmarkt"],"caption":"Christmas Markets and Advent"},{"heading":"Bread as Regional Culture","headingZh":"Bread as Regional Culture","en":"Germany’s bread tradition includes thousands of breads and baked goods, with strong regional variation. Rye, wheat, spelt, seeds, sourdough methods, pretzels, dark loaves, and festive cakes all appear in different places. A neighborhood bakery therefore offers a practical lesson in regional history, agriculture, and everyday food culture.","zh":"德国面包传统包含数以千计的面包和烘焙食品，而且地区差异很大。黑麦、小麦、斯佩耳特小麦、种子、酸种方法、椒盐卷饼、深色面包和节庆蛋糕会在不同地方出现。社区面包店因此能让人从日常饮食理解地方历史与农业。","imagePages":["German bread","Bakery"],"caption":"Bread as Regional Culture"},{"heading":"Bauhaus, Industry, and Skilled Work","headingZh":"Bauhaus, Industry, and Skilled Work","en":"Germany’s modern cultural image includes both design and technical production. Bauhaus education linked art, craft, architecture, and industrial methods, while the vocational training system still connects classroom learning with practical work inside companies. Design and skilled labor are therefore two sides of a broader culture that values applied knowledge.","zh":"德国现代文化形象同时包含设计与技术生产。包豪斯教育把艺术、手工艺、建筑和工业方法连接起来，而职业教育制度至今仍把课堂学习与公司实际工作结合。设计与技术劳动因此是同一种“应用知识文化”的两个面向。","imagePages":["Bauhaus","Vocational education in Germany"],"caption":"Bauhaus, Industry, and Skilled Work"}]}}},{"slug":"switzerland","name":"Switzerland","region":"Europe","flag":"ch","mapId":"756","readOrder":26,"summary":"Four articles cover Alpine geography and languages, neutrality and voting, rail and skilled work, and everyday mountain-food traditions.","summaryZh":"四篇文章介绍阿尔卑斯地理与语言、中立与投票、铁路和技术工作，以及山地饮食传统。","facts":{"Capital":"Bern","Languages":"German, French, Italian, Romansh","Cantons":"26","Landscape":"Alps, plateau, Jura"},"versions":{"A1":{"title":"Switzerland — Easy Country Guide","titleZh":"Switzerland——A1 基础版","summary":"Short sentences, essential facts, culture, festivals, and visual clues for easier reading.","summaryZh":"使用较短句子介绍地理、文化、节庆与视觉特色，适合基础阅读。","sections":[{"heading":"Alps and Lakes","headingZh":"Alps and Lakes","en":"Switzerland has high Alps, valleys, and many lakes. Trains, tunnels, and mountain roads connect towns across difficult terrain.","zh":"瑞士有高耸阿尔卑斯山、山谷和许多湖泊。铁路、隧道和山路把崎岖地形中的城镇连接起来。","imagePages":["Swiss Alps","Lake Lucerne"],"caption":"Alps and Lakes"},{"heading":"Four Languages","headingZh":"Four Languages","en":"Switzerland has four national languages: German, French, Italian, and Romansh. Different language regions have their own local traditions.","zh":"瑞士有四种国家语言：德语、法语、意大利语和罗曼什语。不同语言地区拥有各自地方传统。","imagePages":["Languages of Switzerland","Romansh language"],"caption":"Four Languages"},{"heading":"Fasnacht","headingZh":"Fasnacht","en":"Several Swiss cities hold Fasnacht carnival traditions. Masks, drums, lanterns, costumes, and parades fill the streets before Lent.","zh":"瑞士一些城市会举行法斯纳赫特狂欢节。大斋期前，街上会出现面具、鼓、灯笼、服装和游行。","imagePages":["Carnival of Basel","Fasnacht"],"caption":"Fasnacht"},{"heading":"Watches and Alpine Farms","headingZh":"Watches and Alpine Farms","en":"Swiss watchmaking is known for precision and skilled mechanical work. In summer, cattle are often moved to high Alpine pastures, where cheese-making is part of farm life.","zh":"瑞士制表业以精密和熟练机械工艺闻名。夏天时，牛常被带到高山牧场，制奶酪也是山地农场生活的一部分。","imagePages":["Watchmaking in Switzerland","Alpine transhumance"],"caption":"Watches and Alpine Farms"}]},"B1":{"title":"Switzerland — Culture, History, and Everyday Life","titleZh":"Switzerland——B1 深入版","summary":"A fuller country profile with geography, history, architecture, living traditions, festivals, crafts, and social life.","summaryZh":"更完整介绍地理、历史、建筑、活态传统、节庆、手工艺与社会生活。","sections":[{"heading":"Alps, Plateau, and Jura","headingZh":"阿尔卑斯山、中部高原与汝拉山","en":"Switzerland has three main landscape areas: the Alps, the central plateau, and the Jura Mountains. Most large cities and much of the population are on the central plateau.","zh":"瑞士有三个主要地形区：阿尔卑斯山、中部高原和汝拉山。大多数大城市和许多人口都位于中部高原。","imagePages":["Geography of Switzerland","Swiss Alps"],"caption":"Switzerland’s major landscape regions"},{"heading":"Four National Languages","headingZh":"四种国家语言","en":"Switzerland has four national languages: German, French, Italian, and Romansh. Different parts of the country mainly use different languages in schools, media, and daily life.","zh":"瑞士有四种国家语言：德语、法语、意大利语和罗曼什语。不同地区在学校、媒体和日常生活中主要使用不同语言。","imagePages":["Languages of Switzerland","Linguistic geography of Switzerland"],"caption":"Switzerland’s language regions"},{"heading":"The Federal State of 1848","headingZh":"1848年的联邦国家","en":"Modern Switzerland became a federal state in 1848. The new system joined the cantons under a national constitution while still leaving them significant local power.","zh":"现代瑞士在1848年成为联邦国家。新的制度用国家宪法把各州连接起来，同时仍保留很大的地方权力。","imagePages":["Federal Constitution of the Swiss Confederation","History of Switzerland since 1848"],"caption":"The Swiss federal system"},{"heading":"Neutrality","headingZh":"中立政策","en":"Swiss neutrality was internationally recognized in 1815. It means Switzerland normally avoids taking part in wars between other states, although the country still has armed forces and takes part in international diplomacy.","zh":"瑞士的中立地位在1815年获得国际承认。这意味着瑞士通常避免参加其他国家之间的战争，但这个国家仍然拥有军队，也参与国际外交。","imagePages":["Swiss neutrality","Congress of Vienna"],"caption":"Swiss neutrality"},{"heading":"A 57-Kilometer Rail Tunnel","headingZh":"57公里铁路隧道","en":"The Gotthard Base Tunnel opened in 2016 and is about 57 kilometers long. It runs deep under the Alps and allows trains to cross the mountain region on a much flatter route.","zh":"圣哥达基线隧道在2016年开通，全长约57公里。它深入阿尔卑斯山下方，让火车可以沿更平缓的路线穿越山区。","imagePages":["Gotthard Base Tunnel","Gotthard railway"],"caption":"The Gotthard Base Tunnel"},{"heading":"Railways and Freight","headingZh":"铁路与货运","en":"Switzerland has a dense rail network that connects cities, small towns, and mountain areas. Freight trains also move goods through the Alps between northern and southern Europe.","zh":"瑞士拥有密集的铁路网络，连接城市、小镇和山区。货运列车也会穿越阿尔卑斯山，在欧洲南北之间运输商品。","imagePages":["Swiss Federal Railways","Rail transport in Switzerland"],"caption":"Swiss railway network"},{"heading":"Fasnacht and Urban Carnival","headingZh":"Fasnacht and Urban Carnival","en":"Basel’s Fasnacht begins in darkness before dawn with lanterns, drums, and piccolo music. Costumed groups move through the streets according to their own themes, often using satire. Other Swiss cities have different carnival traditions, showing that the country’s festivals can vary strongly by region.","zh":"巴塞尔法斯纳赫特在黎明前的黑暗中开始，街上会出现灯笼、鼓声和短笛音乐。化装队伍依照自己的主题移动，也常带有讽刺内容。其他瑞士城市还有不同狂欢传统，显示节庆会因地区而有很大差异。","imagePages":["Carnival of Basel","Fasnacht"],"caption":"Fasnacht and Urban Carnival"},{"heading":"Alpine Transhumance","headingZh":"Alpine Transhumance","en":"In summer, cattle may move from valley farms to high Alpine pastures, where fresh grass supports milk and cheese production. Autumn returns can become local celebrations with decorated animals and large bells. The practice makes seasonal movement, agriculture, landscape, and sound part of one cultural tradition.","zh":"夏季时，牛会从山谷农场移动到高山牧场，以新鲜牧草支持牛奶和奶酪生产。秋季回到村庄时，有些地方会用装饰牛只和大型牛铃庆祝。这项传统把季节移动、农业、地景与声音结合成同一种文化。","imagePages":["Alpine transhumance","Cowbell"],"caption":"Alpine Transhumance"},{"heading":"Watchmaking and Precision Craft","headingZh":"Watchmaking and Precision Craft","en":"Swiss watchmaking developed in regions where small workshops specialized in precise mechanical parts. Over time, craftsmanship, design, engineering, and luxury branding became closely linked. The industry is useful for understanding how a small-scale craft tradition can become a major part of a modern national image.","zh":"瑞士制表业在一些地区发展，当地小型工坊专门制作精密机械零件。随着时间过去，手工技艺、设计、工程与奢侈品牌紧密连接。这个产业很适合理解一种小规模手工传统如何发展成现代国家形象的重要部分。","imagePages":["Watchmaking in Switzerland","Swiss watch"],"caption":"Watchmaking and Precision Craft"}]}}},{"slug":"france","name":"France","region":"Europe","flag":"fr","mapId":"250","readOrder":27,"summary":"Four articles cover geography and rivers, revolution and republic, art and café culture, and simple food traditions.","summaryZh":"四篇文章介绍地理与河流、革命与共和国、艺术与咖啡馆文化，以及简单饮食传统。","facts":{"Capital":"Paris","Language":"French","Currency":"Euro","Major rivers":"Seine, Loire, Rhône, Garonne"},"versions":{"A1":{"title":"France — Easy Country Guide","titleZh":"France——A1 基础版","summary":"Short sentences, essential facts, culture, festivals, and visual clues for easier reading.","summaryZh":"使用较短句子介绍地理、文化、节庆与视觉特色，适合基础阅读。","sections":[{"heading":"Rivers and Regions","headingZh":"Rivers and Regions","en":"France reaches both the Atlantic Ocean and the Mediterranean Sea. The Seine, Loire, Rhône, and Garonne are major rivers, and regional landscapes are very different.","zh":"法国同时面向大西洋和地中海。塞纳河、卢瓦尔河、罗讷河和加龙河都是重要河流，各地区地景差异很大。","imagePages":["Loire","Geography of France"],"caption":"Rivers and Regions"},{"heading":"Markets and Café Life","headingZh":"Markets and Café Life","en":"Outdoor markets sell fruit, cheese, bread, flowers, seafood, and other local products. Cafés are places to talk, read, work, or watch city life.","zh":"户外市场会卖水果、奶酪、面包、花、海鲜和其他地方产品。咖啡馆是聊天、阅读、工作或观察城市生活的地方。","imagePages":["Market in France","Café culture"],"caption":"Markets and Café Life"},{"heading":"Fête de la Musique","headingZh":"Fête de la Musique","en":"On June 21, towns and cities hold the Fête de la Musique. Professional and amateur musicians perform in streets, squares, bars, and public spaces.","zh":"六月二十一日，法国各地会举办音乐节。专业与业余音乐人会在街道、广场、酒吧和公共空间表演。","imagePages":["Fête de la Musique","Street music"],"caption":"Fête de la Musique"},{"heading":"Architecture and Art","headingZh":"Architecture and Art","en":"France has Roman remains, Gothic cathedrals, châteaux, museums, and modern design. Art and architecture are visible across both large cities and smaller towns.","zh":"法国有罗马遗迹、哥特式大教堂、城堡、博物馆和现代设计。艺术与建筑在大城市和小城镇中都很容易看到。","imagePages":["Gothic architecture in France","Louvre"],"caption":"Architecture and Art"}]},"B1":{"title":"France — Culture, History, and Everyday Life","titleZh":"France——B1 深入版","summary":"A fuller country profile with geography, history, architecture, living traditions, festivals, crafts, and social life.","summaryZh":"更完整介绍地理、历史、建筑、活态传统、节庆、手工艺与社会生活。","sections":[{"heading":"Western Europe and Two Seas","headingZh":"西欧与两片海","en":"France is in Western Europe. Its mainland reaches the Atlantic Ocean and the Mediterranean Sea, so coastal landscapes and climates are very different from north to south.","zh":"法国位于西欧。法国本土同时面向大西洋和地中海，因此从北到南，海岸景观与气候差异很大。","imagePages":["Geography of France","Metropolitan France"],"caption":"France between the Atlantic and Mediterranean"},{"heading":"Great Rivers","headingZh":"重要河流","en":"Several major rivers cross France. The Seine passes through Paris, the Loire flows through a long valley with farms and castles, and the Rhône carries water south toward the Mediterranean.","zh":"法国有几条重要河流。塞纳河经过巴黎，卢瓦尔河流经一条拥有农田和城堡的长河谷，罗讷河则向南流入地中海。","imagePages":["Seine","Loire","Rhône"],"caption":"Major rivers of France"},{"heading":"Kings and Monarchy","headingZh":"国王与君主制","en":"For many centuries, France was ruled by kings. Royal power, taxes, wars, and social differences shaped the country before the late eighteenth century.","zh":"几个世纪以来，法国由国王统治。在十八世纪末以前，王权、税收、战争和社会差异深刻影响这个国家。","imagePages":["Kingdom of France","Palace of Versailles"],"caption":"France under the monarchy"},{"heading":"The Revolution of 1789","headingZh":"1789年革命","en":"In 1789, the French Revolution began during a serious political and financial crisis. Old privileges were challenged, and new ideas about citizenship and rights changed France and influenced other countries.","zh":"1789年，法国在严重的政治与财政危机中爆发革命。旧特权受到挑战，而关于公民与权利的新思想改变了法国，也影响了其他国家。","imagePages":["French Revolution","Storming of the Bastille"],"caption":"The French Revolution"},{"heading":"Art and Museums","headingZh":"艺术与博物馆","en":"France has a long connection with painting, sculpture, architecture, and design. Large museums and art schools collect older works while also supporting new artistic ideas.","zh":"法国与绘画、雕塑、建筑和设计有很长的联系。大型博物馆和艺术学校收藏旧作品，也支持新的艺术思想。","imagePages":["Louvre","Art in France"],"caption":"Museums and art in France"},{"heading":"Fashion","headingZh":"时尚","en":"Paris became an important center for fashion, clothing design, and luxury goods. Fashion houses, workshops, and seasonal shows connect creative design with international business.","zh":"巴黎成为时尚、服装设计和奢侈品的重要中心。时装品牌、工坊和季节性时装秀把创意设计与国际商业连接起来。","imagePages":["Paris Fashion Week","French fashion"],"caption":"Fashion in Paris"},{"heading":"Fête de la Musique","headingZh":"Fête de la Musique","en":"Every June 21, the Fête de la Musique turns streets, squares, parks, cafés, and public buildings into performance spaces. Amateur and professional musicians can appear side by side, and many concerts are free. The festival changes the normal use of urban space by making music part of everyday movement through the city.","zh":"每年六月二十一日，法国音乐节会把街道、广场、公园、咖啡馆和公共建筑变成表演空间。业余与专业音乐人可以并排演出，许多音乐会免费。这个节庆改变城市空间平常的使用方式，让音乐直接进入人们日常移动路线。","imagePages":["Fête de la Musique","Street performance"],"caption":"Fête de la Musique"},{"heading":"Markets, Cafés, and Regional Rhythm","headingZh":"Markets, Cafés, and Regional Rhythm","en":"French daily culture is strongly regional, so markets can reveal local geography through what they sell: seafood near coasts, cheeses in dairy areas, olives and herbs in the Mediterranean south, or apples and butter in the northwest. Cafés offer a different social rhythm built around sitting, watching, and conversation.","zh":"法国日常文化很有地区性，因此市场会透过商品直接反映地理：海岸附近有海鲜、乳业地区有奶酪、地中海南部有橄榄和香草、西北部则常见苹果和奶油。咖啡馆则创造另一种围绕坐着、观察和聊天形成的社会节奏。","imagePages":["Market in France","Café culture"],"caption":"Markets, Cafés, and Regional Rhythm"},{"heading":"Architecture as a Timeline","headingZh":"Architecture as a Timeline","en":"French architecture can be read almost like a historical timeline. Roman remains, Romanesque churches, Gothic cathedrals, Renaissance châteaux, grand urban boulevards, industrial structures, and modern museums all appear across the country. Because these layers remain in daily use, history is encountered while commuting, shopping, studying, or simply walking through a town.","zh":"法国建筑几乎可以像历史时间轴一样阅读。罗马遗迹、罗曼式教堂、哥特大教堂、文艺复兴城堡、大型城市林荫道、工业结构和现代博物馆都分布全国。因为这些历史层次至今仍在日常使用，人们在通勤、购物、学习或散步时就会遇见历史。","imagePages":["Gothic architecture in France","Château de Chambord"],"caption":"Architecture as a Timeline"}]}}},{"slug":"italy","name":"Italy","region":"Europe","flag":"it","mapId":"380","readOrder":28,"summary":"Alps, ancient cities, Renaissance art, regional traditions, and lively public squares shape Italy.","summaryZh":"阿尔卑斯山、古城、文艺复兴艺术、地区传统与热闹公共广场共同塑造了意大利。","facts":{"Capital":"Rome","Language":"Italian","Currency":"Euro","Landscape":"Alps, Po Valley, Apennines"},"versions":{"A1":{"title":"Italy — Easy Country Guide","titleZh":"意大利——A1 基础版","summary":"A simple introduction to Italy’s land, art, festivals, and daily culture.","summaryZh":"用简单句介绍意大利的地理、艺术、节庆与日常文化。","sections":[{"heading":"Mountains and a Long Peninsula","headingZh":"高山与狭长半岛","en":"Italy is in southern Europe. The Alps are in the north, and the Apennine Mountains run down the long peninsula. The country also has many islands.","zh":"意大利位于欧洲南部。北部是阿尔卑斯山，亚平宁山脉沿着狭长半岛向南延伸。这个国家也有许多岛屿。","imagePages":["Geography of Italy","Apennine Mountains"],"caption":"Italy’s mountains and peninsula"},{"heading":"Old Cities and Art","headingZh":"古城与艺术","en":"Rome, Florence, Venice, and many other cities have old churches, squares, bridges, and museums. Italy is famous for art from the Roman period and the Renaissance.","zh":"罗马、佛罗伦萨、威尼斯和许多其他城市都有古老教堂、广场、桥梁和博物馆。意大利以罗马时代和文艺复兴时期的艺术闻名。","imagePages":["Florence Cathedral","Renaissance art"],"caption":"Historic cities and Renaissance art"},{"heading":"Venice Carnival","headingZh":"威尼斯嘉年华","en":"The Venice Carnival is known for beautiful masks and costumes. During the festival, streets and squares become stages for parades, music, and performances.","zh":"威尼斯嘉年华以精美面具和服装闻名。节庆期间，街道和广场会变成游行、音乐与表演的舞台。","imagePages":["Carnival of Venice","Venetian mask"],"caption":"Masks at the Venice Carnival"},{"heading":"Piazzas and Evening Walks","headingZh":"广场与傍晚散步","en":"Many Italian towns have a central piazza. People meet there, drink coffee, talk, or take an evening walk called a passeggiata.","zh":"许多意大利城镇都有中心广场。人们会在那里见面、喝咖啡、聊天，或进行称为 passeggiata 的傍晚散步。","imagePages":["Piazza Navona","Passeggiata"],"caption":"Public squares and evening social life"}]},"B1":{"title":"Italy — Culture, Art, Festivals, and Regional Life","titleZh":"意大利——B1 深入版","summary":"A richer profile of Italy through geography, city history, Renaissance culture, literature, festivals, crafts, and everyday public life.","summaryZh":"从地理、城市历史、文艺复兴文化、文学、节庆、工艺与公共生活深入认识意大利。","sections":[{"heading":"Alps, Po Valley, and Apennines","headingZh":"阿尔卑斯山、波河平原与亚平宁山脉","en":"Italy’s geography changes sharply from north to south. The Alps form a high northern wall, the broad Po Valley is one of the country’s most important farming and industrial areas, and the Apennines run like a spine through the peninsula.","zh":"意大利的地理从北到南变化明显。阿尔卑斯山构成北部高墙，广阔的波河平原是重要农业与工业地区，而亚平宁山脉则像脊柱一样贯穿整个半岛。","imagePages":["Po Valley","Apennine Mountains","Italian Alps"],"caption":"Italy’s main physical regions"},{"heading":"Cities Built in Layers","headingZh":"层层累积的城市历史","en":"Italian cities often contain several historical periods in the same streets. Roman ruins may stand near medieval towers, Renaissance palaces, Baroque churches, and modern shops, making the city itself feel like a visible timeline.","zh":"意大利城市常在同一街区里保留多个历史时期。罗马遗迹旁可能出现中世纪高塔、文艺复兴宫殿、巴洛克教堂与现代商店，让整座城市像一条看得见的时间轴。","imagePages":["Roman Forum","Florence historic centre"],"caption":"Historical layers in Italian cities"},{"heading":"Renaissance Workshops and New Ideas","headingZh":"文艺复兴工坊与新思想","en":"During the Renaissance, cities such as Florence became centers of painting, sculpture, architecture, banking, and scholarship. Artists and craftspeople worked in workshops where techniques were taught, tested, and improved over generations.","zh":"文艺复兴时期，佛罗伦萨等城市成为绘画、雕塑、建筑、金融与学术中心。艺术家与工匠在工坊中工作，技法会经过教学、实验与世代改进。","imagePages":["Renaissance art","Florentine Renaissance"],"caption":"Renaissance art and workshop culture"},{"heading":"Dante and the Italian Literary Tradition","headingZh":"但丁与意大利文学传统","en":"One of Italy’s most influential writers was Dante Alighieri. His work helped give literary importance to the Tuscan form of Italian, which later influenced the development of standard Italian.","zh":"意大利最具影响力的作家之一是但丁·阿利吉耶里。他的作品提升了托斯卡纳语在文学中的地位，后来也影响标准意大利语的发展。","imagePages":["Dante Alighieri","Divine Comedy illustrated"],"caption":"Dante and the Italian literary tradition"},{"heading":"Venice Carnival and the Meaning of Masks","headingZh":"威尼斯嘉年华与面具文化","en":"The Venice Carnival grew from traditions of the Venetian Republic. Masks allowed people to hide social identity for a time, while today the festival fills canals, lanes, and squares with elaborate costumes, performances, and carefully crafted masks.","zh":"威尼斯嘉年华源自威尼斯共和国时期的传统。面具曾让人暂时隐藏社会身份；今天，运河、巷道和广场会出现华丽服装、表演与精工面具。","imagePages":["Carnival of Venice","Venetian mask"],"caption":"Masks and costumes in Venice"},{"heading":"Regional Identity Matters","headingZh":"地区认同非常重要","en":"Italy is politically one country, but local identity remains strong. Dialects, recipes, architecture, festivals, and even everyday habits can change greatly between regions such as Sicily, Tuscany, Veneto, Lombardy, and Sardinia.","zh":"意大利在政治上是一个国家，但地方认同仍然很强。西西里、托斯卡纳、威尼托、伦巴第和撒丁等地区，在方言、饮食、建筑、节庆甚至日常习惯上都可能差异很大。","imagePages":["Regions of Italy","Sicilian culture"],"caption":"Strong regional identities across Italy"},{"heading":"Craft, Design, and Made in Italy","headingZh":"工艺、设计与 Made in Italy","en":"Traditional craft and modern design often overlap in Italy. Leather work, glass, ceramics, furniture, fashion, and industrial design connect small workshops with global brands, especially in long-established regional production areas.","zh":"在意大利，传统工艺与现代设计经常相互交叠。皮革、玻璃、陶瓷、家具、时尚与工业设计，把小型工坊和国际品牌连接起来，尤其集中在一些历史悠久的生产地区。","imagePages":["Murano glass","Italian design"],"caption":"Craft traditions and modern design"},{"heading":"The Piazza as a Social Stage","headingZh":"作为社会舞台的广场","en":"The piazza is more than an open space. It may hold a market in the morning, cafés in the afternoon, children and families in the evening, and public celebrations at night. This repeated use makes public space an important part of Italian social life.","zh":"广场不只是开放空间。早上可能有市场，下午有咖啡馆，晚上有孩子与家庭，节庆时又会成为公共活动场地。这样的反复使用，使公共空间成为意大利社会生活的重要组成部分。","imagePages":["Piazza del Campo","Italian piazza"],"caption":"The piazza as everyday social space"}]}}},{"slug":"spain","name":"Spain","region":"Europe","flag":"es","mapId":"724","readOrder":29,"summary":"Regional cultures, layered architecture, flamenco, human towers, and a long festival calendar make Spain highly diverse.","summaryZh":"地区文化、多层次建筑、佛朗明哥、人塔与丰富节庆日历，让西班牙呈现高度多样性。","facts":{"Capital":"Madrid","Language":"Spanish; regional co-official languages","Currency":"Euro","Landscape":"Meseta, mountains, long coasts"},"versions":{"A1":{"title":"Spain — Easy Country Guide","titleZh":"西班牙——A1 基础版","summary":"A simple guide to Spain’s regions, architecture, music, and festivals.","summaryZh":"用简单句认识西班牙的地区、建筑、音乐与节庆。","sections":[{"heading":"A Country of Different Regions","headingZh":"多样地区组成的国家","en":"Spain is in southwestern Europe. It has high mountains, a large central plateau, long coasts, and islands. Different regions have their own traditions.","zh":"西班牙位于欧洲西南部。这里有高山、广大的中央高原、长海岸线和岛屿。不同地区拥有自己的传统。","imagePages":["Geography of Spain","Meseta Central"],"caption":"Spain’s varied landscapes"},{"heading":"Old and New Architecture","headingZh":"古老与现代建筑","en":"Spain has Roman buildings, medieval castles, Islamic palaces, Gothic churches, and modern architecture. Many cities show several cultures in the same place.","zh":"西班牙有罗马建筑、中世纪城堡、伊斯兰宫殿、哥特教堂和现代建筑。许多城市会在同一个地方呈现多种文化。","imagePages":["Alhambra","Spanish architecture"],"caption":"Layers of architecture in Spain"},{"heading":"Flamenco","headingZh":"佛朗明哥","en":"Flamenco combines singing, guitar, rhythm, and dance. It is especially connected with Andalusia in southern Spain.","zh":"佛朗明哥结合歌唱、吉他、节奏和舞蹈，尤其与西班牙南部的安达卢西亚地区密切相关。","imagePages":["Flamenco","Flamenco dance"],"caption":"Flamenco music and dance"},{"heading":"Castells — Human Towers","headingZh":"Castells——人塔","en":"In Catalonia, teams build tall human towers called castells. Many people work together at the base, and lighter climbers go higher.","zh":"在加泰罗尼亚，人们会组成称为 castells 的高大人塔。许多人在底部一起支撑，体重较轻的成员会继续往上爬。","imagePages":["Castell","Castells"],"caption":"Catalan human towers"}]},"B1":{"title":"Spain — Regions, Art, Festivals, and Shared Public Life","titleZh":"西班牙——B1 深入版","summary":"A deeper look at Spain’s regional identities, historical layers, architecture, literature, music, and distinctive festivals.","summaryZh":"深入认识西班牙的地区认同、历史层次、建筑、文学、音乐与特色节庆。","sections":[{"heading":"Plateau, Mountains, Coasts, and Islands","headingZh":"高原、山地、海岸与岛屿","en":"Much of central Spain sits on the Meseta, a broad elevated plateau. The Pyrenees rise along the border with France, while long Atlantic and Mediterranean coasts create very different climates, economies, and local cultures.","zh":"西班牙中部大部分位于广阔而较高的梅塞塔高原。比利牛斯山沿法国边境延伸，而大西洋与地中海的长海岸则形成不同的气候、经济与地方文化。","imagePages":["Meseta Central","Pyrenees","Costa Brava"],"caption":"Spain’s major landscapes"},{"heading":"A Country with Strong Regional Identities","headingZh":"强烈的地区认同","en":"Spanish is spoken across the country, but several regions also use languages such as Catalan, Galician, and Basque. Language, food, festivals, architecture, and political history all contribute to strong regional identities.","zh":"西班牙全国使用西班牙语，但一些地区也使用加泰罗尼亚语、加利西亚语和巴斯克语等语言。语言、饮食、节庆、建筑与政治历史共同形成强烈的地区认同。","imagePages":["Languages of Spain","Catalonia"],"caption":"Regional languages and identities"},{"heading":"Roman, Islamic, Jewish, and Christian Layers","headingZh":"罗马、伊斯兰、犹太与基督教历史层次","en":"Spain’s cities preserve traces of several major civilizations. Roman roads and aqueducts, Islamic palaces and courtyards, Jewish quarters, and Christian cathedrals can exist within the same urban landscape.","zh":"西班牙城市保存多个重要文明的痕迹。罗马道路与水道、伊斯兰宫殿与庭院、犹太街区和基督教大教堂，都可能出现在同一座城市里。","imagePages":["Alhambra","Roman aqueduct of Segovia","Jewish quarter of Córdoba"],"caption":"Layered cultural heritage"},{"heading":"Flamenco as Music, Voice, and Movement","headingZh":"作为音乐、歌声与动作的佛朗明哥","en":"Flamenco developed through a long mixture of cultural influences in southern Spain. Singing is central, while guitar, hand clapping, footwork, and dance create complex rhythm and emotional intensity.","zh":"佛朗明哥在西班牙南部多种文化长期交流中发展。歌唱处于核心位置，而吉他、拍手、脚步与舞蹈共同形成复杂节奏和强烈情感。","imagePages":["Flamenco","Flamenco guitar"],"caption":"Flamenco performance"},{"heading":"Cervantes and the Power of the Novel","headingZh":"塞万提斯与小说的力量","en":"Miguel de Cervantes is closely associated with the history of the modern novel. His writing used humor, changing viewpoints, and questions about reality, making Spanish literature influential far beyond the country.","zh":"米格尔·德·塞万提斯与现代小说发展史关系密切。他的作品使用幽默、多重视角与对现实的追问，使西班牙文学产生超越国界的影响。","imagePages":["Miguel de Cervantes","Don Quixote"],"caption":"Cervantes and Spanish literature"},{"heading":"Castells — Cooperation You Can See","headingZh":"Castells——看得见的合作","en":"Catalan castells are human towers often built in public squares during festivals. The large base supports several levels above it, and success depends on timing, trust, balance, and collective effort rather than one individual performer.","zh":"加泰罗尼亚 castells 人塔常在节庆期间于公共广场搭建。庞大的底层支撑上方多层成员，成功依赖时间配合、信任、平衡与集体合作，而不是某一个人的表演。","imagePages":["Castell","Castells"],"caption":"Human towers in Catalonia"},{"heading":"Las Fallas and Temporary Monumental Art","headingZh":"法雅节与短暂的大型艺术","en":"In Valencia, Las Fallas fills the city with huge sculptural figures built for the festival. The works are often humorous or satirical, and most are burned at the end, turning months of craft into a deliberately temporary public artwork.","zh":"在瓦伦西亚，法雅节会让城市出现大量为节庆制作的巨大雕塑。这些作品常带幽默或讽刺意味，大多数会在最后被焚烧，把数月工艺转化成刻意短暂存在的公共艺术。","imagePages":["Falles","Fallas of Valencia"],"caption":"Monumental festival sculptures in Valencia"},{"heading":"Plazas, Late Evenings, and Public Life","headingZh":"广场、较晚作息与公共生活","en":"Public life in many Spanish cities extends into plazas, terraces, markets, and neighborhood streets. Meal times are often later than in northern Europe, and social life can continue well into the evening, especially in warm seasons.","zh":"在许多西班牙城市，公共生活会延伸到广场、露天座位区、市场与社区街道。用餐时间常比北欧更晚，尤其在温暖季节，社交活动也常持续到较晚时段。","imagePages":["Plaza Mayor Madrid","Spanish plaza"],"caption":"Public life in Spanish plazas"}]}}},{"slug":"portugal","name":"Portugal","region":"Europe","flag":"pt","mapId":"620","readOrder":30,"summary":"Atlantic geography, azulejo tiles, fado, Manueline architecture, literature, and street festivals give Portugal a distinctive character.","summaryZh":"大西洋地理、花砖、法朵、曼努埃尔式建筑、文学与街头节庆共同形成葡萄牙鲜明特色。","facts":{"Capital":"Lisbon","Language":"Portuguese","Currency":"Euro","Major rivers":"Tagus, Douro"},"versions":{"A1":{"title":"Portugal — Easy Country Guide","titleZh":"葡萄牙——A1 基础版","summary":"A simple guide to Portugal’s Atlantic coast, tiles, music, and festivals.","summaryZh":"用简单句认识葡萄牙的大西洋海岸、花砖、音乐与节庆。","sections":[{"heading":"Facing the Atlantic","headingZh":"面向大西洋","en":"Portugal is on the western side of the Iberian Peninsula. The Atlantic Ocean has strongly influenced fishing, trade, travel, and coastal life.","zh":"葡萄牙位于伊比利亚半岛西侧。大西洋长期影响这里的渔业、贸易、旅行与沿海生活。","imagePages":["Geography of Portugal","Atlantic coast of Portugal"],"caption":"Portugal and the Atlantic"},{"heading":"Azulejo Tiles","headingZh":"Azulejo 花砖","en":"Colorful ceramic tiles called azulejos cover many walls, churches, stations, and houses. Some show patterns, while others tell stories with pictures.","zh":"称为 azulejos 的彩色陶瓷花砖覆盖许多墙面、教堂、车站和住宅。有些使用图案，有些则用图像讲故事。","imagePages":["Azulejo","São Bento railway station"],"caption":"Portuguese azulejo tiles"},{"heading":"Fado","headingZh":"法朵","en":"Fado is a Portuguese music style known for expressive singing and guitar. The songs often speak about love, daily life, loss, and longing.","zh":"法朵是葡萄牙的一种音乐风格，以富有情感的歌声和吉他闻名。歌曲常谈到爱情、日常生活、失去与思念。","imagePages":["Fado","Portuguese guitar"],"caption":"Fado and Portuguese guitar"},{"heading":"São João in Porto","headingZh":"波尔图圣若昂节","en":"On the night of June 23, Porto celebrates São João with music, dancing, food, and fireworks. Many people spend the night outside in the streets.","zh":"六月二十三日晚上，波尔图会以音乐、舞蹈、食物与烟火庆祝圣若昂节。许多人整晚都在街上参加活动。","imagePages":["Festa de São João do Porto","São João Festival"],"caption":"São João celebrations in Porto"}]},"B1":{"title":"Portugal — Atlantic Culture, Tiles, Music, and Festival Life","titleZh":"葡萄牙——B1 深入版","summary":"A deeper portrait of Portugal through the Atlantic, architecture, azulejos, fado, literature, exploration history, and neighborhood festivals.","summaryZh":"从大西洋、建筑、花砖、法朵、文学、航海历史与社区节庆深入认识葡萄牙。","sections":[{"heading":"Atlantic Geography and Two Great Rivers","headingZh":"大西洋地理与两条重要河流","en":"Portugal occupies the western edge of the Iberian Peninsula. The Tagus reaches the Atlantic at Lisbon, while the Douro flows through northern wine country before reaching Porto. Ocean and river routes have shaped settlement, trade, and cultural contact.","zh":"葡萄牙位于伊比利亚半岛西缘。塔霍河在里斯本流入大西洋，多罗河则流经北部葡萄酒产区后抵达波尔图。海洋与河流路线长期塑造聚落、贸易与文化交流。","imagePages":["Tagus","Douro","Geography of Portugal"],"caption":"Portugal’s Atlantic and river geography"},{"heading":"The Sea and the Age of Expansion","headingZh":"海洋与海外扩张时代","en":"From the fifteenth century, Portuguese voyages connected Atlantic Europe with Africa, Asia, and the Americas. These expeditions expanded trade and knowledge, but they were also tied to conquest, slavery, and colonial rule, leaving a complicated global legacy.","zh":"从十五世纪起，葡萄牙航海把大西洋欧洲与非洲、亚洲和美洲连接起来。这些航行扩大贸易与知识交流，但也与征服、奴隶贸易和殖民统治相连，因此留下复杂的全球遗产。","imagePages":["Portuguese discoveries","Portuguese Empire"],"caption":"Portugal’s maritime expansion"},{"heading":"Manueline Architecture","headingZh":"曼努埃尔式建筑","en":"Manueline architecture developed around the period of Portugal’s maritime expansion. Stone decoration often includes ropes, plants, crosses, shields, and other symbols linked to navigation and royal power.","zh":"曼努埃尔式建筑形成于葡萄牙海上扩张时期。石雕装饰常出现绳索、植物、十字架、盾徽以及与航海和王权相关的象征。","imagePages":["Manueline","Jerónimos Monastery"],"caption":"Manueline architectural detail"},{"heading":"Azulejos as Architecture and Storytelling","headingZh":"作为建筑与叙事的花砖","en":"Azulejos became one of Portugal’s most recognizable decorative traditions. From geometric patterns to large blue-and-white scenes, tiles can cover façades, church interiors, stairways, fountains, and railway stations, turning ordinary surfaces into visual narratives.","zh":"Azulejos 花砖成为葡萄牙最具辨识度的装饰传统之一。从几何图案到大型蓝白场景，花砖会覆盖建筑外墙、教堂内部、楼梯、喷泉与火车站，把普通表面变成视觉叙事。","imagePages":["Azulejo","São Bento railway station"],"caption":"Azulejos as visual storytelling"},{"heading":"Fado, Voice, and Saudade","headingZh":"法朵、歌声与 Saudade","en":"Fado centers on expressive singing supported by Portuguese guitar and classical guitar. Its themes often include urban life, separation, memory, and saudade—a difficult-to-translate feeling of longing, absence, and emotional attachment.","zh":"法朵以富有表现力的歌声为中心，并由葡萄牙吉他和古典吉他伴奏。主题常包括城市生活、离别、记忆与 saudade——一种很难直接翻译、结合思念、缺席感与情感依恋的感觉。","imagePages":["Fado","Portuguese guitar"],"caption":"Fado performance and Portuguese guitar"},{"heading":"Camões, Pessoa, and a Strong Literary Culture","headingZh":"卡蒙斯、佩索阿与文学传统","en":"Luís de Camões became a central figure of Portuguese Renaissance literature, while Fernando Pessoa later became known for writing through several invented literary identities. Together they show how Portuguese literature moved from epic national storytelling toward modern questions of identity and self.","zh":"路易斯·德·卡蒙斯是葡萄牙文艺复兴文学的重要人物，而费尔南多·佩索阿后来以多个虚构文学身份写作闻名。他们共同展现葡萄牙文学如何从民族史诗叙事发展到现代身份与自我问题。","imagePages":["Luís de Camões","Fernando Pessoa"],"caption":"Portuguese literary traditions"},{"heading":"São João — A City Turns into a Festival","headingZh":"圣若昂节——整座城市变成庆典","en":"On the night of June 23, Porto’s São João celebration fills streets with music, dancing, food, and fireworks. The event has both Christian and older seasonal associations, and its importance comes from the way entire neighborhoods take part in the same public celebration.","zh":"六月二十三日晚上，波尔图圣若昂节让街道充满音乐、舞蹈、食物与烟火。这个节庆同时具有基督教与较古老季节传统的联系，而它最特别之处在于整片社区共同参与同一个公共庆典。","imagePages":["Festa de São João do Porto","São João Festival"],"caption":"São João street celebrations"},{"heading":"Cafés, Squares, and Tiled Streets","headingZh":"咖啡馆、广场与花砖街景","en":"Everyday Portuguese urban life often unfolds in small cafés, tiled streets, neighborhood shops, markets, and public squares. Older architectural surfaces remain part of daily routines, so historical design is often encountered while simply walking to work, shopping, or meeting friends.","zh":"葡萄牙城市日常生活常发生在小咖啡馆、花砖街道、社区商店、市场和公共广场。较古老的建筑表面仍属于日常环境，因此人们在上班、购物或见朋友时就会自然接触历史设计。","imagePages":["Lisbon street","Calçada portuguesa"],"caption":"Everyday urban life in Portugal"}]}}},{"slug":"netherlands","name":"Netherlands","region":"Europe","flag":"nl","mapId":"528","readOrder":31,"summary":"Low land, canal houses, tulips, King’s Day, direct communication, and cycling shape Dutch culture.","summaryZh":"低地、运河屋、郁金香、国王节、直接沟通与自行车文化共同塑造荷兰特色。","facts":{"Capital":"Amsterdam","Language":"Dutch","Currency":"Euro","Landscape":"Lowlands, polders, North Sea coast"},"versions":{"A1":{"title":"The Netherlands – Tulips, Canals, Bikes, and King’s Day","titleZh":"荷兰——郁金香、运河、自行车和国王节","summary":"A simple introduction to Dutch land, canal houses, King’s Day, food, and cycling.","summaryZh":"用简单英文认识荷兰的低地、运河屋、国王节、食物与自行车文化。","sections":[{"heading":"Low Land and Tulips","headingZh":"低地与郁金香","en":"The Netherlands is in northwestern Europe beside the North Sea. Much of the land is very flat, and some places are below sea level. Dikes and other water-control systems help protect the land. In spring, large fields of tulips and other flowers bring bright colors to the countryside.","zh":"荷兰位于欧洲西北部，靠近北海。这里大部分土地非常平坦，有些地区甚至低于海平面。堤坝和其他水利系统帮助保护土地。春天时，大片郁金香和其他花田让乡间出现鲜艳的色彩。","imagePages":["Tulip fields Netherlands","Polder","Netherlands landscape"],"caption":"Dutch lowlands and spring tulip fields"},{"heading":"Canal Houses","headingZh":"运河屋","en":"In old Dutch cities, many houses beside canals are tall and narrow. Land in the city was limited, so houses were often built upward. Large windows bring light into the rooms, and some old houses have hooks near the roof. These hooks can help lift furniture through upper windows.","zh":"在荷兰的老城市里，许多运河旁的房子又高又窄。城市土地有限，所以房屋常向上发展。大窗户可以让室内更明亮，一些老房子的屋顶附近还有铁钩，可以把家具吊到楼上的窗户。","imagePages":["Canal houses Amsterdam","Amsterdam canal house hook"],"caption":"Tall narrow canal houses and roof hooks"},{"heading":"King’s Day","headingZh":"国王节","en":"King’s Day is a national celebration in late April. Many people wear orange, and streets, squares, canals, and boats become busy with music and parties. Flea markets are also common. Orange is closely connected with the Dutch royal family.","zh":"国王节是在四月底举行的全国性庆典。许多人会穿橙色衣服，街道、广场、运河和船上都会出现音乐与庆祝活动。跳蚤市场也很常见。橙色与荷兰王室有密切关系。","imagePages":["King's Day Netherlands","King's Day Amsterdam canal"],"caption":"Orange clothing, boats, and street celebrations on King’s Day"},{"heading":"Stroopwafel","headingZh":"糖浆华夫饼","en":"A stroopwafel is made from two thin waffle cookies with sweet syrup between them. People often eat it with coffee or tea. It is sold in supermarkets, cafés, and street markets.","zh":"糖浆华夫饼由两片薄薄的华夫饼夹着甜糖浆制成。人们常配咖啡或茶一起吃，在超市、咖啡馆和街头市场都可以买到。","imagePages":["Stroopwafel","Stroopwafel market"],"caption":"A Dutch stroopwafel with syrup between two thin waffles"},{"heading":"Cycling","headingZh":"自行车文化","en":"Bicycles are part of everyday life in the Netherlands. Many cities have separate bike paths, bicycle parking areas, and traffic lights for cyclists. People ride to school, work, shops, and train stations.","zh":"自行车是荷兰日常生活的一部分。许多城市都有独立自行车道、自行车停车区和自行车专用红绿灯。人们会骑车上学、上班、购物或前往火车站。","imagePages":["Cycling in the Netherlands","Bicycle parking Netherlands"],"caption":"Everyday cycling infrastructure in the Netherlands"}]},"A2":{"title":"The Netherlands – Low Land, Tulips, Canal Houses, and Dutch Culture","titleZh":"荷兰——低地、郁金香、运河屋和荷兰文化","summary":"An A2 guide to the Netherlands through water, architecture, celebrations, communication, food, and cycling.","summaryZh":"从水利、建筑、节庆、沟通方式、食物与自行车文化认识荷兰。","sections":[{"heading":"Low Land, Water, and Flowers","headingZh":"低地、水利与花田","en":"The Netherlands is a low and flat country beside the North Sea. Some areas are below sea level, so water management has shaped the country for centuries. Dikes, pumps, canals, and polders help people control water and create usable land. In spring, flower-growing areas become famous for long fields of tulips, hyacinths, and daffodils.","zh":"荷兰是一个靠近北海、地势低平的国家。有些地区低于海平面，因此数百年来水利管理一直深刻影响这个国家。堤坝、水泵、运河和围垦地帮助人们控制水并创造可使用的土地。春天时，花卉产区会出现大片郁金香、风信子与水仙花田。","imagePages":["Dutch water management","Tulip fields Netherlands","Polder"],"caption":"Water management and Dutch flower fields"},{"heading":"Why Canal Houses Are Tall and Narrow","headingZh":"为什么运河屋又高又窄","en":"Historic canal houses are one of the most recognizable sights in cities such as Amsterdam. Many were built on narrow pieces of land, so they rise several floors instead of spreading sideways. Their large windows bring in light. Hooks near the roof were traditionally used to lift furniture and goods because narrow stairs made moving large objects difficult.","zh":"历史悠久的运河屋是阿姆斯特丹等城市最容易辨认的景观之一。许多房屋建在狭窄土地上，所以不是向左右扩展，而是盖成好几层。大窗户让室内有更多光线。屋顶附近的铁钩过去常用来吊家具与货物，因为狭窄楼梯很难搬运大型物品。","imagePages":["Amsterdam canal houses","Canal house hoist hook"],"caption":"Narrow canal houses and their traditional lifting hooks"},{"heading":"King’s Day and the Color Orange","headingZh":"国王节与橙色","en":"On King’s Day, many Dutch towns and cities turn orange. People wear orange clothes, listen to music, visit street markets, and celebrate on boats and public squares. The color comes from the House of Orange, the Dutch royal family. The day mixes a royal celebration with a large public street festival.","zh":"国王节当天，荷兰许多城镇都会变成橙色。人们穿橙色衣服、听音乐、逛街头市集，并在船上和公共广场庆祝。橙色来自荷兰王室的奥兰治家族。这个节日把王室庆典与大型街头活动结合在一起。","imagePages":["King's Day Netherlands","King's Day Amsterdam"],"caption":"King’s Day crowds dressed in orange"},{"heading":"Direct Communication","headingZh":"直接沟通","en":"Dutch people are often described as direct speakers. In many situations, saying clearly that you agree or disagree is considered normal and practical. This can sound strong to people from cultures that prefer more indirect language, but the intention is often clarity rather than rudeness.","zh":"荷兰人常被形容为说话直接。在许多情况下，清楚表达同意或不同意被视为正常而实用的沟通方式。对习惯较间接表达的人来说，这种说法可能听起来比较强硬，但目的通常是清楚，而不是无礼。","imagePages":["Dutch people conversation","Cafe Netherlands"],"caption":"Clear and direct everyday communication"},{"heading":"Stroopwafel","headingZh":"糖浆华夫饼","en":"Stroopwafels are made from two thin waffle layers with a sweet syrup filling. Fresh ones can be warm and soft in the center, while packaged versions are easy to find in shops. A common way to enjoy one is with coffee or tea.","zh":"糖浆华夫饼由两层薄华夫饼夹着甜糖浆制成。现做的通常温热，中间比较柔软；包装版本则很容易在商店买到。许多人会配咖啡或茶一起享用。","imagePages":["Stroopwafel","Fresh stroopwafel"],"caption":"Two thin waffles with a syrup filling"},{"heading":"Cycling as Daily Transport","headingZh":"作为日常交通的自行车","en":"Cycling is not only a sport in the Netherlands. It is a normal way to travel to school, work, shops, and train stations. Separate bicycle paths, parking facilities, signs, and traffic lights make cycling part of the transport system itself.","zh":"在荷兰，骑自行车不只是一种运动，也是上学、上班、购物和前往火车站的日常交通方式。独立自行车道、停车设施、标志与红绿灯，让自行车直接成为交通系统的一部分。","imagePages":["Cycling in the Netherlands","Dutch bicycle path"],"caption":"Cycling as part of the Dutch transport system"}]},"B1":{"title":"The Netherlands – Low Land, Tulips, Canal Houses, and Dutch Culture","titleZh":"荷兰——低地、郁金香、运河屋和荷兰文化","summary":"A B1 cultural profile linking geography, urban design, King’s Day, communication, food, and cycling.","summaryZh":"从地理、城市设计、国王节、沟通方式、饮食与自行车文化深入认识荷兰。","sections":[{"heading":"Living with Water","headingZh":"与水共存","en":"The Netherlands is famous for its low, flat landscape beside the North Sea, and parts of the country lie below sea level. This geography has made water management a long-term part of Dutch society. Dikes, drainage systems, canals, pumps, and polders have helped protect settlements and create land for farming and cities. The same low landscape also supports large flower-growing regions, where tulip fields become especially colorful in spring.","zh":"荷兰以靠近北海的低平地形闻名，部分地区位于海平面以下。这种地理条件让水利管理长期成为荷兰社会的一部分。堤坝、排水系统、运河、水泵与围垦地帮助保护聚落，并创造农业和城市用地。同样的低平地形也形成大型花卉产区，春天时郁金香花田尤其鲜艳。","imagePages":["Dutch water management","Polder Netherlands","Tulip fields Netherlands"],"caption":"Low land, water management, and tulip fields"},{"heading":"Canal Houses and Urban Space","headingZh":"运河屋与城市空间","en":"In historic Dutch cities, canal houses are often unusually tall and narrow. Building plots beside the canals were limited, so owners used vertical space instead of wide ground plans. Large windows allowed daylight into deep rooms, while hooks fixed near the roof could lift furniture or goods through upper windows. These practical solutions became a distinctive part of the streetscape.","zh":"在荷兰历史城市里，运河屋常常特别高而狭窄。运河旁的建筑土地有限，因此屋主会利用垂直空间，而不是把房屋盖得很宽。大窗户让光线进入较深的室内，屋顶附近的铁钩则可以把家具或货物吊进楼上的窗户。这些实用设计后来成为非常有辨识度的街景。","imagePages":["Canal houses Amsterdam","Amsterdam canal house hook"],"caption":"Tall canal houses with large windows and roof hooks"},{"heading":"King’s Day and Orange Streets","headingZh":"国王节与橙色街道","en":"King’s Day is one of the most visible public celebrations in the Netherlands. People wear orange, street markets appear, music fills squares, and decorated boats move through city canals. Orange is connected with the Dutch royal House of Orange. The celebration is therefore both a national royal holiday and a large public festival in which ordinary streets and waterways become social spaces.","zh":"国王节是荷兰最醒目的公共庆典之一。人们穿上橙色服装，街头出现市集，广场播放音乐，装饰过的船只穿梭城市运河。橙色与荷兰王室的奥兰治家族有关。因此，这个节日既是全国性的王室庆典，也是大型公共节庆，让普通街道和水道变成社交空间。","imagePages":["King's Day Netherlands","King's Day canal boats"],"caption":"King’s Day on streets, squares, and canals"},{"heading":"A Culture of Direct Speech","headingZh":"直接表达的沟通文化","en":"Dutch communication is often described as direct. In meetings, classrooms, workplaces, and friendships, people may state agreement, disagreement, or criticism more openly than in cultures where indirect language is preferred. Directness does not automatically mean hostility. It is often connected with the idea that clear information saves time and makes expectations easier to understand.","zh":"荷兰的沟通方式常被形容为直接。在会议、课堂、工作场所与朋友之间，人们可能比偏好间接表达的文化更公开地说出同意、不同意或批评。直接并不一定代表不友善，它常与一种观念有关：清楚的信息可以节省时间，也让彼此更容易理解期待。","imagePages":["Meeting Netherlands","Dutch cafe conversation"],"caption":"Direct communication in everyday Dutch social life"},{"heading":"Stroopwafel and Everyday Food Culture","headingZh":"糖浆华夫饼与日常饮食","en":"A stroopwafel consists of two thin waffle layers with a caramel-like syrup filling. It began as a local food and is now sold widely in bakeries, markets, supermarkets, and cafés. Fresh stroopwafels are often served warm, while packaged ones are commonly eaten with coffee or tea. Their simple form has become one of the most recognizable Dutch snacks.","zh":"糖浆华夫饼由两层薄华夫饼夹着类似焦糖的糖浆组成。它最初是一种地方食品，现在在面包店、市场、超市与咖啡馆都很常见。现做版本常趁热食用，包装版本则常配咖啡或茶。它简单的形式已经成为最容易辨认的荷兰点心之一。","imagePages":["Stroopwafel","Stroopwafel market"],"caption":"A fresh Dutch stroopwafel"},{"heading":"Cycling as Infrastructure, Not Just Exercise","headingZh":"自行车是基础设施，不只是运动","en":"The Netherlands is strongly associated with cycling because bicycles are built into everyday transport. Protected bike lanes, bicycle traffic lights, large parking facilities, and links with train stations make short and medium-distance trips convenient without a car. Children, office workers, students, and older adults all use bicycles. This normality is what makes Dutch cycling culture different from places where cycling is mainly treated as recreation.","zh":"荷兰与自行车文化关系密切，因为自行车已经被纳入日常交通系统。受保护的自行车道、自行车红绿灯、大型停车设施，以及与火车站的连接，使人们不必开车也能方便完成短中距离移动。儿童、上班族、学生与年长者都会骑车。正是这种日常性，让荷兰自行车文化不同于只把骑车当作休闲运动的地方。","imagePages":["Cycling in the Netherlands","Bicycle parking Utrecht"],"caption":"Cycling infrastructure used by people of many ages"}]}}},{"slug":"belgium","name":"Belgium","region":"Europe","flag":"be","mapId":"056","readOrder":32,"summary":"Three official languages, medieval cities, chocolate, distinctive beer glasses, waffles, and comics give Belgium a layered culture.","summaryZh":"三种官方语言、中世纪城市、巧克力、特色啤酒杯、华夫饼与漫画共同构成比利时多层次文化。","facts":{"Capital":"Brussels","Languages":"Dutch, French, German","Currency":"Euro","Structure":"Federal state with communities and regions"},"versions":{"A1":{"title":"Belgium – Languages, Chocolate, Waffles, and Comics","titleZh":"比利时——语言、巧克力、华夫饼和漫画","summary":"A simple introduction to Belgium through languages, chocolate, waffles, and comic culture.","summaryZh":"用简单英文从语言、巧克力、华夫饼与漫画文化认识比利时。","sections":[{"heading":"Three Languages","headingZh":"三种语言","en":"Belgium has three official languages: Dutch, French, and German. Dutch is mainly spoken in the north, French in the south, and German in a small area in the east. Brussels uses both Dutch and French officially.","zh":"比利时有三种官方语言：荷兰语、法语和德语。荷兰语主要使用在北部，法语主要使用在南部，德语则使用在东部的一小片地区。布鲁塞尔官方使用荷兰语和法语。","imagePages":["Languages of Belgium","Brussels"],"caption":"Belgium’s Dutch-, French-, and German-speaking communities"},{"heading":"Belgian Chocolate","headingZh":"比利时巧克力","en":"Belgium is famous for chocolate. Chocolate shops sell pralines, truffles, bars, and many small handmade pieces. In some cities, visitors can watch chocolatiers make and decorate them.","zh":"比利时以巧克力闻名。巧克力店会卖夹心巧克力、松露巧克力、巧克力块和许多手工小巧克力。在一些城市，游客还能看到巧克力师制作与装饰巧克力。","imagePages":["Belgian chocolate","Belgian pralines"],"caption":"Belgian pralines and handmade chocolate"},{"heading":"Belgian Waffles","headingZh":"比利时华夫饼","en":"Belgium has different kinds of waffles. Brussels waffles are usually light, rectangular, and crispy outside. Liège waffles are denser and sweeter because pieces of sugar melt and caramelize while they cook.","zh":"比利时有不同种类的华夫饼。布鲁塞尔华夫饼通常比较轻盈、呈长方形，外层酥脆。列日华夫饼则更扎实、更甜，因为烘烤时糖粒会融化并形成焦糖。","imagePages":["Brussels waffle","Liège waffle"],"caption":"Brussels and Liège styles of Belgian waffle"},{"heading":"Comic Culture","headingZh":"漫画文化","en":"Comics are an important part of Belgian popular culture. Comic characters and large wall paintings can be seen in Brussels and other cities. Comic museums and bookshops also show how strong this tradition is.","zh":"漫画是比利时流行文化的重要部分。在布鲁塞尔和其他城市里，可以看到漫画角色和大型漫画墙面彩绘。漫画博物馆与书店也显示这项传统有多深。","imagePages":["Belgian comics","Brussels Comic Book Route"],"caption":"Comic murals in Brussels"}]},"A2":{"title":"Belgium – Three Languages, Old Cities, Chocolate, Beer, and Comics","titleZh":"比利时——三种语言、古城、巧克力、啤酒和漫画","summary":"An A2 guide to Belgium’s multilingual society, old cities, chocolate, beer traditions, and comics.","summaryZh":"从多语言社会、古城、巧克力、啤酒传统与漫画认识比利时。","sections":[{"heading":"Three Official Languages","headingZh":"三种官方语言","en":"Belgium has three official languages: Dutch, French, and German. Language is closely connected with regions and communities. Flanders in the north is mainly Dutch-speaking, Wallonia in the south is mainly French-speaking, and a smaller German-speaking community lives in the east. Brussels is officially bilingual in Dutch and French.","zh":"比利时有三种官方语言：荷兰语、法语和德语。语言与地区和社群关系非常密切。北部佛兰德地区主要使用荷兰语，南部瓦隆地区主要使用法语，东部还有较小的德语社群。布鲁塞尔官方使用荷兰语与法语两种语言。","imagePages":["Languages of Belgium","Brussels bilingual signs"],"caption":"Belgium’s three official languages"},{"heading":"Old Cities and Squares","headingZh":"古城与广场","en":"Cities such as Bruges, Ghent, and Brussels have old squares, stone buildings, churches, canals, and narrow streets. Historic guild houses around public squares show how trade and city life developed over many centuries.","zh":"布鲁日、根特和布鲁塞尔等城市有古老广场、石造建筑、教堂、运河和狭窄街道。公共广场周围的历史行会建筑，显示贸易与城市生活如何经过数百年发展。","imagePages":["Bruges Market Square","Ghent historic centre","Grand-Place Brussels"],"caption":"Historic Belgian city squares and guild houses"},{"heading":"Chocolate and Pralines","headingZh":"巧克力与夹心巧克力","en":"Belgian chocolate is known for careful production and a wide variety of fillings and shapes. Pralines are especially popular: a chocolate shell can contain cream, nuts, caramel, or other fillings. Small chocolate shops are common in tourist areas and old city centers.","zh":"比利时巧克力以细致制作和多种内馅、形状闻名。夹心巧克力尤其受欢迎，巧克力外壳里可以放奶油、坚果、焦糖或其他馅料。在观光区与老城中心，小型巧克力店非常常见。","imagePages":["Belgian pralines","Belgian chocolate shop"],"caption":"Belgian pralines in a chocolate shop"},{"heading":"Beer and Special Glasses","headingZh":"啤酒与专用酒杯","en":"Belgium has a very wide range of beer styles. One unusual detail is that many beers are served in their own specially shaped glass. The glass may be designed to support the beer’s aroma, foam, or traditional presentation, so ordering different beers can also mean receiving very different glasses.","zh":"比利时有非常多样的啤酒风格。一个很特别的细节是，许多啤酒会使用自己专属形状的酒杯。酒杯可能为了香气、泡沫或传统呈现方式而设计，所以点不同啤酒时，也可能会拿到形状完全不同的杯子。","imagePages":["Belgian beer glass","Belgian beer"],"caption":"Different Belgian beers served in distinctive glasses"},{"heading":"Comics in the City","headingZh":"城市里的漫画","en":"Belgium has a long comic tradition. Brussels is especially known for comic murals painted on building walls. Museums, bookshops, and public art make comics visible outside the printed page and turn them into part of the urban landscape.","zh":"比利时有悠久的漫画传统。布鲁塞尔尤其以画在建筑墙面上的漫画壁画闻名。博物馆、书店与公共艺术让漫画不只存在于书页，也成为城市景观的一部分。","imagePages":["Brussels Comic Book Route","Belgian Comic Strip Center"],"caption":"Comic murals and comic culture in Brussels"}]},"B1":{"title":"Belgium – Three Languages, Medieval Cities, Chocolate, Beer, and Comics","titleZh":"比利时——三种语言、中世纪城市、巧克力、啤酒和漫画","summary":"A B1 profile of Belgium’s multilingual structure, medieval urban heritage, food traditions, beer glasses, and comic culture.","summaryZh":"从多语言结构、中世纪城市遗产、饮食传统、啤酒杯与漫画文化深入认识比利时。","sections":[{"heading":"A Country with Three Official Languages","headingZh":"拥有三种官方语言的国家","en":"Belgium has three official languages—Dutch, French, and German—and language is closely linked with the country’s political and cultural structure. Flanders is mainly Dutch-speaking, Wallonia is mainly French-speaking, and a smaller German-speaking community is located in the east. Brussels is officially bilingual in Dutch and French. This multilingual system helps explain why Belgian regional identity can be very strong.","zh":"比利时有三种官方语言——荷兰语、法语和德语，而语言与这个国家的政治和文化结构关系非常密切。佛兰德地区主要使用荷兰语，瓦隆地区主要使用法语，东部则有规模较小的德语社群。布鲁塞尔官方使用荷兰语和法语。这样的多语言制度，也能帮助理解为什么比利时的地区认同相当强。","imagePages":["Languages of Belgium","Brussels bilingual signs"],"caption":"Belgium’s three official language communities"},{"heading":"Medieval Cities and Public Squares","headingZh":"中世纪城市与公共广场","en":"Belgian cities preserve many layers of medieval and early modern urban life. Bruges is known for canals and brick buildings, Ghent for its towers and old waterfront, and Brussels for the Grand-Place surrounded by richly decorated guild houses. These squares were not only beautiful spaces; they were centers of trade, government, festivals, and public life.","zh":"比利时城市保存了许多中世纪与近代早期的城市层次。布鲁日以运河和砖造建筑闻名，根特有高塔与古老河岸，布鲁塞尔大广场则被装饰华丽的行会建筑包围。这些广场不只是漂亮的空间，也是贸易、政府、节庆与公共生活的中心。","imagePages":["Bruges historic centre","Ghent Graslei","Grand-Place Brussels"],"caption":"Medieval and early-modern city centers in Belgium"},{"heading":"Chocolate and the Praline Tradition","headingZh":"巧克力与夹心巧克力传统","en":"Belgian chocolate developed a strong reputation through specialist shops and confectionery traditions. Pralines use a chocolate shell around soft or flavored fillings, allowing chocolatiers to combine textures, nuts, creams, caramel, fruit, and spices. In old city districts, chocolate shops often present the product almost like small pieces of craftwork.","zh":"比利时巧克力透过专业巧克力店与糖果制作传统建立起很高的知名度。夹心巧克力利用巧克力外壳包住柔软或有香味的馅料，让巧克力师可以组合不同口感、坚果、奶油、焦糖、水果与香料。在老城区，巧克力店常把这些产品像小型工艺品一样展示。","imagePages":["Belgian pralines","Belgian chocolatier"],"caption":"Belgian pralines and specialist chocolate craft"},{"heading":"Beer Culture and the Glass That Goes with It","headingZh":"啤酒文化与专属酒杯","en":"Belgian beer culture is striking not only because of the number of styles but also because presentation matters. Many beers have a glass associated specifically with that brand or style. A wide bowl, narrow flute, heavy goblet, or other shape can affect aroma, foam, temperature, and visual presentation. As a result, the glass itself often becomes part of the drinking tradition.","zh":"比利时啤酒文化特别之处，不只在于风格数量众多，也在于呈现方式很受重视。许多啤酒都有与特定品牌或风格对应的专属酒杯。宽口杯、细长杯、厚重高脚杯或其他形状，都可能影响香气、泡沫、温度与视觉效果。因此，酒杯本身也常成为饮用传统的一部分。","imagePages":["Belgian beer glasses","Belgian beer glass"],"caption":"Different Belgian beer styles with their own glass shapes"},{"heading":"Waffles Are Not All the Same","headingZh":"华夫饼并不只有一种","en":"The phrase “Belgian waffle” hides important local differences. Brussels waffles are generally rectangular, light, and crisp, with deep pockets, while Liège waffles are denser, richer, and often contain pearl sugar that caramelizes during cooking. These differences show how one internationally famous food can contain several regional traditions.","zh":"“比利时华夫饼”这个名称其实隐藏了重要的地方差异。布鲁塞尔华夫饼通常是长方形、轻盈而酥脆，并有较深的格子；列日华夫饼则更扎实浓郁，常加入烘烤时会焦糖化的珍珠糖。这些差异说明，一种国际上很有名的食物内部也可能包含不同地区传统。","imagePages":["Brussels waffle","Liège waffle"],"caption":"Brussels and Liège waffles side by side"},{"heading":"Comics as Public Culture","headingZh":"作为公共文化的漫画","en":"Belgium has an unusually visible comic tradition. Famous comic series developed strong readerships, and Brussels later brought this culture into public space through large murals on building walls. Comic museums, specialist bookshops, and street art make illustrated storytelling part of the city experience rather than something found only inside books.","zh":"比利时拥有非常醒目的漫画传统。许多漫画系列拥有广泛读者，而布鲁塞尔后来更把这种文化带进公共空间，在建筑墙面绘制大型漫画壁画。漫画博物馆、专门书店与街头艺术，让图像叙事成为城市体验的一部分，而不只是存在于书本里。","imagePages":["Brussels Comic Book Route","Belgian comics"],"caption":"Large comic murals integrated into Brussels streets"}]}}},{"slug":"luxembourg","name":"Luxembourg","region":"Europe","flag":"lu","mapId":"442","readOrder":33,"summary":"Multilingual daily life, fortress streets, castles, free transport, and Schueberfouer give Luxembourg a distinctive character.","summaryZh":"多语言日常、堡垒街区、城堡、免费交通与舒伯福尔嘉年华构成卢森堡鲜明特色。","facts":{"Capital":"Luxembourg City","Languages":"Luxembourgish, French, German","Currency":"Euro","State form":"Grand Duchy"},"versions":{"A1":{"title":"Luxembourg – Languages, Castles, Free Transport, and Schueberfouer","titleZh":"卢森堡——语言、城堡、免费交通和舒伯福尔嘉年华","summary":"A simple introduction to Luxembourg through languages, old fortifications, castles, transport, and a famous annual fair.","summaryZh":"用简单英文从语言、古老防御工事、城堡、交通与年度嘉年华认识卢森堡。","sections":[{"heading":"Three Main Languages","headingZh":"三种主要语言","en":"Luxembourg uses Luxembourgish, French, and German in public life. Luxembourgish is the national language. Because many people also come from other countries, English and Portuguese are often heard too.","zh":"卢森堡在公共生活中使用卢森堡语、法语和德语。卢森堡语是国家语言。因为当地也有许多来自其他国家的人，所以英语和葡萄牙语也很常听到。","imagePages":["Luxembourg languages","Luxembourg City street"],"caption":"A multilingual everyday environment in Luxembourg"},{"heading":"Old Fortifications","headingZh":"古老防御工事","en":"Luxembourg City grew around a strong fortress. Today, visitors can still see old walls, cliffs, and underground tunnels called casemates. The old defensive structures stand beside modern streets and buildings.","zh":"卢森堡市围绕一座强大的堡垒发展起来。今天，游客仍能看到旧城墙、悬崖，以及称为炮台地道的地下通道。这些古老防御设施就位在现代街道和建筑旁边。","imagePages":["Bock Casemates","Luxembourg fortifications"],"caption":"The Bock cliffs, fortress walls, and casemates"},{"heading":"Castles","headingZh":"城堡","en":"Many castles stand in Luxembourg’s valleys and hills. Vianden Castle is one of the best known. Some castles are restored, while others remain partly in ruins. They show how important fortified buildings were in the region’s past.","zh":"卢森堡的山谷与丘陵中有许多城堡。维安登城堡是其中最著名的之一。有些城堡已经修复，有些则保留部分遗迹。它们显示防御性建筑在当地历史上曾经非常重要。","imagePages":["Vianden Castle","Bourscheid Castle"],"caption":"Castles in Luxembourg’s valleys and hills"},{"heading":"Free Public Transport","headingZh":"免费大众运输","en":"Public buses, trams, and most trains can be used free of charge inside Luxembourg. This makes it easy to move between towns and the capital without buying a normal ticket.","zh":"在卢森堡境内，公车、电车和大多数火车都可以免费搭乘。这让人们不需要购买一般车票，也能方便地在城镇和首都之间移动。","imagePages":["Luxembourg tram","Luxembourg railway"],"caption":"Free public transport in Luxembourg"},{"heading":"Schueberfouer","headingZh":"舒伯福尔嘉年华","en":"Schueberfouer is a large annual funfair in Luxembourg City. It has rides, games, food stands, lights, and crowds. The fair has a very long history and is still an important late-summer event.","zh":"舒伯福尔嘉年华是卢森堡市每年举行的大型游乐市集。现场有游乐设施、游戏、食物摊、灯光和人群。这项活动历史很长，至今仍是夏末的重要节庆。","imagePages":["Schueberfouer","Schueberfouer Luxembourg"],"caption":"Rides and lights at the Schueberfouer funfair"}]},"A2":{"title":"Luxembourg – Three Languages, Fortress Streets, Castles, and Free Transport","titleZh":"卢森堡——三种语言、堡垒街区、城堡和免费交通","summary":"An A2 guide to Luxembourg’s multilingual society, fortress history, castles, transport, and local festival culture.","summaryZh":"从多语言社会、堡垒历史、城堡、交通与地方节庆认识卢森堡。","sections":[{"heading":"A Multilingual Country","headingZh":"多语言国家","en":"Luxembourgish, French, and German all have important roles in Luxembourg. Luxembourgish is the national language, while French and German are widely used in administration, education, media, and everyday communication. Because a large part of the population has international backgrounds, several other languages are also common.","zh":"卢森堡语、法语和德语在卢森堡都扮演重要角色。卢森堡语是国家语言，而法语与德语广泛用于行政、教育、媒体和日常沟通。由于相当多人口具有国际背景，其他多种语言也很常见。","imagePages":["Luxembourg City street","Languages of Luxembourg"],"caption":"A multilingual public environment"},{"heading":"A City Built Around a Fortress","headingZh":"围绕堡垒发展的城市","en":"Luxembourg City developed on high cliffs above deep valleys. Its old fortress was once so strong that the city was called the “Gibraltar of the North.” Parts of the walls and the underground Bock Casemates can still be visited today. The old defensive landscape now mixes with homes, cafés, offices, bridges, and cultural buildings.","zh":"卢森堡市建在深谷上方的高地与悬崖上。过去的堡垒非常坚固，因此这座城市曾被称为“北方直布罗陀”。部分城墙和地下博克炮台地道今天仍可参观。旧防御地景如今与住宅、咖啡馆、办公室、桥梁和文化建筑混合在一起。","imagePages":["Bock Casemates","Luxembourg Old Town"],"caption":"Historic fortress structures inside modern Luxembourg City"},{"heading":"Castles in Valleys and Forests","headingZh":"山谷与森林中的城堡","en":"Outside the capital, castles appear across the country’s hills and valleys. Vianden Castle stands high above its town, while Bourscheid Castle looks over the Sûre Valley. Restored castles, ruins, walking paths, and medieval festivals keep this part of the country’s history visible.","zh":"离开首都后，卢森堡各地的丘陵与山谷里都能看到城堡。维安登城堡高高位于城镇上方，布尔沙伊德城堡则俯瞰叙尔河谷。修复后的城堡、遗迹、步道和中世纪节庆，让这部分历史继续出现在现代生活中。","imagePages":["Vianden Castle","Bourscheid Castle"],"caption":"Hilltop castles overlooking Luxembourg’s valleys"},{"heading":"Nationwide Free Public Transport","headingZh":"全国免费大众运输","en":"Luxembourg introduced free nationwide public transport for most buses, trams, and trains. Residents and visitors can move through the country without buying a normal second-class ticket. The policy is especially noticeable because the country has many cross-border workers and a busy capital region.","zh":"卢森堡实行全国性免费大众运输，大多数公车、电车与火车都不需要购买一般二等车票。居民和游客可以更方便地在国内移动。由于当地有许多跨境通勤者，而且首都地区交通繁忙，这项政策特别受到注意。","imagePages":["Luxembourg tram","Luxembourg public transport"],"caption":"Luxembourg’s free buses, trams, and trains"},{"heading":"Schueberfouer: A Long-Running Fair","headingZh":"舒伯福尔：历史悠久的嘉年华","en":"Every year, Luxembourg City hosts Schueberfouer, a large funfair with rides, games, food, and bright lights. Its history goes back many centuries, but today it feels like a modern public festival. Families, teenagers, friends, and visitors all use the fair as a shared late-summer social space.","zh":"每年，卢森堡市都会举行舒伯福尔大型嘉年华，有游乐设施、游戏、食物与明亮灯光。它的历史可以追溯到数百年前，但今天看起来仍像一个现代公共节庆。家庭、青少年、朋友和游客都会把这里当成夏末共享的社交空间。","imagePages":["Schueberfouer","Schueberfouer night"],"caption":"The Schueberfouer fair at night"}]},"B1":{"title":"Luxembourg – Multilingual Life, Fortresses, Castles, Free Transport, and Local Culture","titleZh":"卢森堡——多语言生活、堡垒、城堡、免费交通与地方文化","summary":"A B1 profile of Luxembourg through language, fortress geography, castles, mobility, and an old fair that remains part of modern city life.","summaryZh":"从语言、堡垒地理、城堡、交通与延续至今的古老嘉年华深入认识卢森堡。","sections":[{"heading":"Multilingualism in Everyday Life","headingZh":"日常生活中的多语言","en":"Luxembourg is unusual because several languages operate side by side in a very small geographic space without belonging to exactly the same social role. Luxembourgish is the national language, while French and German are important in law, administration, education, and media. International residents and cross-border workers add Portuguese, English, Italian, and many other languages to daily life. Changing language according to context is therefore a normal social skill.","zh":"卢森堡的特别之处，在于多个语言在非常集中的地理空间中并行使用，而且它们并不承担完全相同的社会角色。卢森堡语是国家语言，法语与德语则在法律、行政、教育与媒体中十分重要。国际居民与跨境工作者又把葡萄牙语、英语、意大利语和许多其他语言带进日常生活。因此，根据情境切换语言是一种很正常的社会能力。","imagePages":["Luxembourg City street","Languages of Luxembourg"],"caption":"Multilingual everyday life in Luxembourg"},{"heading":"Fortress Geography and the Old City","headingZh":"堡垒地形与老城","en":"Luxembourg City’s historical form is closely connected with its cliffs, gorges, and river valleys. A fortress developed around the Bock promontory and became one of Europe’s major defensive sites. The surviving casemates are tunnels and chambers cut into the rock. Today, the old walls, the Grund district below, high bridges, and modern neighborhoods create a cityscape where military geography and ordinary urban life remain visually connected.","zh":"卢森堡市的历史形态与悬崖、峡谷和河谷关系密切。博克高地周围曾发展出一座重要堡垒，并成为欧洲主要防御据点之一。现存的炮台地道是直接开凿在岩石中的隧道与空间。今天，旧城墙、下方的格伦德街区、高架桥和现代社区共同形成一种独特城市景观，让军事地理与普通城市生活仍然在视觉上相互连接。","imagePages":["Bock Casemates","Grund Luxembourg","Luxembourg fortifications"],"caption":"Fortress cliffs, casemates, and the Grund district"},{"heading":"Castles Beyond the Capital","headingZh":"首都之外的城堡","en":"Luxembourg’s castle landscape shows that political power was once spread across valleys, ridges, and local territories rather than concentrated only in the capital. Vianden Castle dominates a steep valley setting, while Bourscheid and Larochette occupy similarly strategic positions. Some sites survive as ruins and others have been restored for museums, concerts, exhibitions, or festivals, giving medieval structures new functions in modern cultural life.","zh":"卢森堡的城堡地景显示，过去政治权力并不只集中在首都，而是分布在山谷、山脊与不同地方领地。维安登城堡高高控制着陡峭山谷，布尔沙伊德和拉罗谢特城堡也占据类似的战略位置。有些遗址以废墟形式保存，有些则修复后用于博物馆、音乐会、展览或节庆，让中世纪建筑在现代文化生活中获得新的功能。","imagePages":["Vianden Castle","Bourscheid Castle","Larochette Castle"],"caption":"Fortified castles in Luxembourg’s valleys"},{"heading":"Free Public Transport as Everyday Infrastructure","headingZh":"作为日常基础设施的免费交通","en":"Luxembourg is widely known for making most nationwide public transport free at the point of use. Buses, trams, and second-class train travel can be used without a conventional ticket inside the country. The system does not remove every traffic problem, but it changes the everyday decision about whether public transport is worth the price. It is especially relevant in a country where many workers cross national borders each day.","zh":"卢森堡因全国大多数大众运输在使用时免费而广为人知。国内公车、电车和二等火车通常不需要一般车票。这项制度并不会消除所有交通问题，但它改变了人们每天判断“大众运输值不值得花钱”的方式。由于当地每天有许多工作者跨越国界通勤，这项制度尤其具有现实意义。","imagePages":["Luxembourg tram","Luxembourg railway station"],"caption":"Free nationwide public transport as everyday infrastructure"},{"heading":"Schueberfouer: An Old Fair in a Modern Capital","headingZh":"现代首都里的古老嘉年华","en":"Schueberfouer began in the fourteenth century as a fair and has continued in changing forms into the present. Today it combines large rides, games, food stands, lights, and crowded evening streets. Its long history does not make it feel like a museum event. Instead, it survives because each generation uses it as a contemporary place to meet friends, bring children, eat, and take part in a shared late-summer ritual.","zh":"舒伯福尔嘉年华起源于十四世纪的市集，并以不断变化的形式延续至今。现在的活动结合大型游乐设施、游戏、食物摊、灯光与拥挤的夜间人潮。悠久历史并没有让它变成博物馆式活动；相反，它能持续存在，是因为每一代人都把它当成现代社交场所，用来见朋友、带孩子出门、吃东西，并参加共同的夏末仪式。","imagePages":["Schueberfouer","Schueberfouer Luxembourg City"],"caption":"Schueberfouer as a living late-summer tradition"},{"heading":"A Grand Duchy with Strong International Connections","headingZh":"具有国际联系的大公国","en":"Luxembourg is the world’s only sovereign Grand Duchy. Its political identity is local, but its economy and daily population movements are strongly international. European institutions, finance, cross-border employment, and migration all bring people from different backgrounds into the same urban spaces. This makes the country’s multilingual character practical rather than decorative: language switching, international workplaces, and cross-border mobility are ordinary parts of daily life.","zh":"卢森堡是世界上唯一的主权大公国。它的政治身份具有地方特色，但经济与每日人口流动却高度国际化。欧洲机构、金融业、跨境就业与移民，把来自不同背景的人带进同一城市空间。这也让多语言特色不是表面的装饰，而是实际生活需要：语言切换、国际化职场与跨境移动都是普通日常的一部分。","imagePages":["Luxembourg City Kirchberg","Grand Ducal Palace Luxembourg"],"caption":"Modern international Luxembourg beside its historic institutions"}]}}},{"slug":"england","name":"England","region":"Europe","flag":"gb-eng","mapId":"826","mapPoint":[-1.45,52.75],"readOrder":34,"summary":"Rivers, old kingdoms, industry, football, tea, food, and pub culture shape the England reading set.","summaryZh":"河流、古老王国、工业、足球、茶、饮食与酒馆文化构成英格兰阅读主题。","facts":{"Capital":"London","Language":"English","Part of":"United Kingdom","River":"Thames"},"versions":{"A1":{"title":"England – London, Football, Tea, and Fish and Chips","titleZh":"英格兰——伦敦、足球、茶和炸鱼薯条","titlePinyin":"Yīnggélán — Lúndūn, Zúqiú, Chá hé Zháyú Shǔtiáo","degree":"程度：簡單｜A0–A1","summary":"Easy · source level A0–A1 · 4 illustrated sections.","summaryZh":"简单｜原稿程度 A0–A1｜4段配图阅读。","sections":[{"heading":"London and the Thames","en":"England is part of the United Kingdom. London is in England. The River Thames goes through London.","zh":"英格兰是英国的一部分。伦敦就在英格兰。泰晤士河从伦敦流过。","pinyin":"Yīnggélán shì Yīngguó de yí bùfen. Lúndūn jiù zài Yīnggélán. Tàiwùshì Hé cóng Lúndūn liúguò.","imagePages":["River Thames","London"],"caption":"London and the Thames"},{"heading":"Football","en":"Football is very popular in England. Many people have a favorite team. They watch games with family or friends.","zh":"足球在英格兰很受欢迎。很多人都有自己喜欢的球队。他们会跟家人或朋友一起看比赛。","pinyin":"Zúqiú zài Yīnggélán hěn shòu huānyíng. Hěn duō rén dōu yǒu zìjǐ xǐhuan de qiúduì. Tāmen huì gēn jiārén huò péngyou yìqǐ kàn bǐsài.","imagePages":["Football in England","Wembley Stadium"],"caption":"Football"},{"heading":"Tea","en":"Many English people like to drink tea. They may drink it in the morning or afternoon. Some people add milk.","zh":"很多英格兰人喜欢喝茶。他们可能早上喝，也可能下午喝。有些人会加牛奶。","pinyin":"Hěn duō Yīnggélán rén xǐhuan hē chá. Tāmen kěnéng zǎoshang hē, yě kěnéng xiàwǔ hē. Yǒuxiē rén huì jiā niúnǎi.","imagePages":["Tea in the United Kingdom","Tea (drink)"],"caption":"Tea"},{"heading":"Fish and Chips","en":"Fish and chips is a famous English food. It is fried fish with fried potatoes. People can buy it in many places.","zh":"炸鱼薯条是很有名的英格兰食物。就是炸鱼配炸薯条。很多地方都可以买到。","pinyin":"Zháyú shǔtiáo shì hěn yǒumíng de Yīnggélán shíwù. Jiùshì zháyú pèi zhá shǔtiáo. Hěn duō dìfang dōu kěyǐ mǎidào.","imagePages":["Fish and chips"],"caption":"Fish and Chips"}]},"A2":{"title":"England – Rivers, History, Factories, Football, and Pub Life","titleZh":"英格兰——河流、历史、工厂、足球和酒馆生活","titlePinyin":"Yīnggélán — Héliú, Lìshǐ, Gōngchǎng, Zúqiú hé Jiǔguǎn Shēnghuó","degree":"程度：中｜A1–A2","summary":"Standard · source level A1–A2 · 5 illustrated sections.","summaryZh":"中｜原稿程度 A1–A2｜5段配图阅读。","sections":[{"heading":"Rivers and Landscape","en":"England is the largest country in the United Kingdom. It has rivers, farms, hills, and many cities. The River Thames runs through London and has been important for travel and trade for a long time.","zh":"英格兰是英国最大的国家。这里有河流、农田、山地和很多城市。泰晤士河流过伦敦，很长时间以来都对交通和贸易很重要。","pinyin":"Yīnggélán shì Yīngguó zuì dà de guójiā. Zhèlǐ yǒu héliú, nóngtián, shāndì hé hěn duō chéngshì. Tàiwùshì Hé liúguò Lúndūn, hěn cháng shíjiān yǐlái dōu duì jiāotōng hé màoyì hěn zhòngyào.","imagePages":["River Thames","Geography of England"],"caption":"Rivers and Landscape"},{"heading":"From Kingdoms to Great Britain","en":"Long ago, England had several small kingdoms. Over time, they became one country. Later, England and Scotland joined together and became part of Great Britain.","zh":"很久以前，英格兰有几个小王国。后来，它们慢慢变成一个国家。再后来，英格兰和苏格兰联合，成为大不列颠的一部分。","pinyin":"Hěn jiǔ yǐqián, Yīnggélán yǒu jǐ ge xiǎo wángguó. Hòulái, tāmen mànmàn biàn chéng yí ge guójiā. Zài hòulái, Yīnggélán hé Sūgélán liánhé, chéngwéi Dàbùlièdiān de yí bùfen.","imagePages":["Kingdom of England","Acts of Union 1707"],"caption":"From Kingdoms to Great Britain"},{"heading":"Industrial Revolution","en":"England was very important during the Industrial Revolution. Many factories and machines appeared from the 1700s. More people moved to towns and worked in factories. Railways also helped cities grow.","zh":"在工业革命的时候，英格兰非常重要。从十八世纪开始，出现了很多工厂和机器。更多人搬到城市，在工厂工作。铁路也帮助很多城市发展。","pinyin":"Zài Gōngyè Gémìng de shíhou, Yīnggélán fēicháng zhòngyào. Cóng shíbā shìjì kāishǐ, chūxiàn le hěn duō gōngchǎng hé jīqì. Gèng duō rén bān dào chéngshì, zài gōngchǎng gōngzuò. Tiělù yě bāngzhù hěn duō chéngshì fāzhǎn.","imagePages":["Industrial Revolution","Manchester in the Industrial Revolution"],"caption":"Industrial Revolution"},{"heading":"Football","en":"Football is a big part of English life. Modern football rules developed in England in the 1800s. Today, many cities and towns have their own teams, and many people watch football every week.","zh":"足球是英格兰生活中很重要的一部分。现代足球规则在十九世纪的英格兰发展起来。今天，很多城市和小镇都有自己的球队，很多人每个星期都会看足球。","pinyin":"Zúqiú shì Yīnggélán shēnghuó zhōng hěn zhòngyào de yí bùfen. Xiàndài zúqiú guīzé zài shíjiǔ shìjì de Yīnggélán fāzhǎn qǐlái. Jīntiān, hěn duō chéngshì hé xiǎozhèn dōu yǒu zìjǐ de qiúduì, hěn duō rén měi ge xīngqī dōu huì kàn zúqiú.","imagePages":["The Football Association","Football in England"],"caption":"Football"},{"heading":"Pub Life and Food","en":"A traditional English pub is a place to eat, drink, and talk. Friends may watch sports or spend time together there. Traditional foods like fish and chips, pies, and Sunday roast are also common.","zh":"传统的英格兰酒馆是一个吃东西、喝东西和聊天的地方。朋友们也会在那里看体育比赛或一起休息。炸鱼薯条、肉派和星期日烤肉也是常见的传统食物。","pinyin":"Chuántǒng de Yīnggélán jiǔguǎn shì yí ge chī dōngxi, hē dōngxi hé liáotiān de dìfang. Péngyoumen yě huì zài nàlǐ kàn tǐyù bǐsài huò yìqǐ xiūxi. Zháyú shǔtiáo, ròupài hé Xīngqīrì kǎoròu yě shì chángjiàn de chuántǒng shíwù.","imagePages":["Pub","Sunday roast","Fish and chips"],"caption":"Pub Life and Food"}]},"B1":{"title":"England – Old Kingdoms, Industry, Football, and Pub Culture","titleZh":"英格兰——古老王国、工业、足球和酒馆文化","titlePinyin":"Yīnggélán — Gǔlǎo Wángguó, Gōngyè, Zúqiú hé Jiǔguǎn Wénhuà","degree":"程度：難｜A2–B1","summary":"Deep · source level A2–B1 · 6 illustrated sections.","summaryZh":"难｜原稿程度 A2–B1｜6段配图阅读。","sections":[{"heading":"Land and the Thames","en":"England is the largest of the four countries of the United Kingdom. It takes up most of the southern part of Great Britain. The land has rivers, farmland, hills, and long coastlines. The River Thames runs through London and has been important for trade and city life for hundreds of years.","zh":"英格兰是英国四个国家中最大的一个，主要位于大不列颠岛的南部。这里有河流、农田、山地和很长的海岸线。泰晤士河流过伦敦，几百年来一直对贸易和城市生活很重要。","pinyin":"Yīnggélán shì Yīngguó sì ge guójiā zhōng zuì dà de yí ge, zhǔyào wèiyú Dàbùlièdiān Dǎo de nánbù. Zhèlǐ yǒu héliú, nóngtián, shāndì hé hěn cháng de hǎi'ànxiàn. Tàiwùshì Hé liúguò Lúndūn, jǐ bǎi nián lái yìzhí duì màoyì hé chéngshì shēnghuó hěn zhòngyào.","imagePages":["River Thames","Geography of England"],"caption":"Land and the Thames"},{"heading":"Old Kingdoms and the 1707 Union","en":"England was once made up of several small kingdoms. Over time, these kingdoms became one country. In 1707, England and Scotland joined politically and formed Great Britain. Later, this became the main part of the United Kingdom we know today.","zh":"英格兰以前由几个小王国组成。后来，这些王国慢慢成为一个国家。1707年，英格兰和苏格兰在政治上联合，形成大不列颠。后来，这也成为今天英国的重要基础。","pinyin":"Yīnggélán yǐqián yóu jǐ ge xiǎo wángguó zǔchéng. Hòulái, zhèxiē wángguó mànmàn chéngwéi yí ge guójiā. Yī qī líng qī nián, Yīnggélán hé Sūgélán zài zhèngzhì shàng liánhé, xíngchéng Dàbùlièdiān. Hòulái, zhè yě chéngwéi jīntiān Yīngguó de zhòngyào jīchǔ.","imagePages":["Kingdom of England","Acts of Union 1707"],"caption":"Old Kingdoms and the 1707 Union"},{"heading":"Industrial Revolution","en":"England played a major part in the Industrial Revolution. From the 1700s, factories, coal mines, steam engines, and new machines changed how people worked. Cities in central and northern England grew quickly because many people left farms to work in factories. Railways later connected these industrial cities.","zh":"英格兰在工业革命中非常重要。从十八世纪开始，工厂、煤矿、蒸汽机和新机器改变了人们工作的方式。英格兰中部和北部的城市快速发展，因为很多人离开农场去工厂工作。后来，铁路把这些工业城市连接起来。","pinyin":"Yīnggélán zài Gōngyè Gémìng zhōng fēicháng zhòngyào. Cóng shíbā shìjì kāishǐ, gōngchǎng, méikuàng, zhēngqìjī hé xīn jīqì gǎibiàn le rénmen gōngzuò de fāngshì. Yīnggélán zhōngbù hé běibù de chéngshì kuàisù fāzhǎn, yīnwèi hěn duō rén líkāi nóngchǎng qù gōngchǎng gōngzuò. Hòulái, tiělù bǎ zhèxiē gōngyè chéngshì liánjiē qǐlái.","imagePages":["Industrial Revolution","Steam engine"],"caption":"Industrial Revolution"},{"heading":"Parliament and Law","en":"England also has a long history of Parliament and law. Over many centuries, the power of kings slowly became more limited, while Parliament became more important. Many ideas about courts, laws, and government that developed in England later influenced other countries.","zh":"英格兰也有很长的议会和法律历史。经过很多世纪，国王的权力慢慢受到更多限制，而议会变得越来越重要。很多关于法院、法律和政府的制度后来也影响了其他国家。","pinyin":"Yīnggélán yě yǒu hěn cháng de yìhuì hé fǎlǜ lìshǐ. Jīngguò hěn duō shìjì, guówáng de quánlì mànmàn shòudào gèng duō xiànzhì, ér yìhuì biàn de yuèláiyuè zhòngyào. Hěn duō guānyú fǎyuàn, fǎlǜ hé zhèngfǔ de zhìdù hòulái yě yǐngxiǎng le qítā guójiā.","imagePages":["Parliament of England","Palace of Westminster"],"caption":"Parliament and Law"},{"heading":"Modern Football","en":"Modern football developed strongly in England during the 1800s. Clubs and schools began using common rules, and organized competitions became popular. Today, football is still a major part of English life. Many towns have their own clubs, and match days can bring thousands of people to stadiums.","zh":"现代足球在十九世纪的英格兰快速发展。俱乐部和学校开始使用共同的比赛规则，正式比赛也越来越流行。今天，足球还是英格兰生活中很重要的一部分。很多城市都有自己的球队，比赛日会有成千上万的人去球场。","pinyin":"Xiàndài zúqiú zài shíjiǔ shìjì de Yīnggélán kuàisù fāzhǎn. Jùlèbù hé xuéxiào kāishǐ shǐyòng gòngtóng de bǐsài guīzé, zhèngshì bǐsài yě yuèláiyuè liúxíng. Jīntiān, zúqiú háishi Yīnggélán shēnghuó zhōng hěn zhòngyào de yí bùfen. Hěn duō chéngshì dōu yǒu zìjǐ de qiúduì, bǐsài rì huì yǒu chéngqiān shàngwàn de rén qù qiúchǎng.","imagePages":["The Football Association","Football in England"],"caption":"Modern Football"},{"heading":"Pub Culture and Traditional Food","en":"A traditional English pub is more than a place to drink. It is often a local meeting place where friends talk, eat, watch sports, or play simple games. Many old villages and towns have pubs that have been open for a very long time. Sunday roast, pies, and fish and chips are also common parts of traditional English food culture.","zh":"传统的英格兰酒馆不只是喝酒的地方。它常常也是当地人见面、聊天、吃东西、看体育比赛或玩简单游戏的地方。很多老村庄和城市都有开了很久的酒馆。星期日烤肉、肉派和炸鱼薯条也是传统英格兰饮食文化中常见的食物。","pinyin":"Chuántǒng de Yīnggélán jiǔguǎn bù zhǐ shì hējiǔ de dìfang. Tā chángcháng yě shì dāngdì rén jiànmiàn, liáotiān, chī dōngxi, kàn tǐyù bǐsài huò wán jiǎndān yóuxì de dìfang. Hěn duō lǎo cūnzhuāng hé chéngshì dōu yǒu kāi le hěn jiǔ de jiǔguǎn. Xīngqīrì kǎoròu, ròupài hé zháyú shǔtiáo yě shì chuántǒng Yīnggélán yǐnshí wénhuà zhōng chángjiàn de shíwù.","imagePages":["Pub","Sunday roast","Fish and chips"],"caption":"Pub Culture and Traditional Food"}]}}},{"slug":"scotland","name":"Scotland","region":"Europe","flag":"gb-sct","mapId":"826","mapPoint":[-4.2,56.45],"readOrder":35,"summary":"Highlands, clans, tartan, whisky, bagpipes, dance, and a distinct national identity shape Scotland.","summaryZh":"高地、氏族、格子布、威士忌、风笛、舞蹈与独特国家认同构成苏格兰主题。","facts":{"Capital":"Edinburgh","Languages":"English; Scots and Scottish Gaelic also used","Part of":"United Kingdom","Landscape":"Highlands, islands, lochs"},"versions":{"A1":{"title":"Scotland – Mountains, Kilts, Bagpipes, and Whisky","titleZh":"苏格兰——高山、格子裙、风笛和威士忌","titlePinyin":"Sūgélán — Gāoshān, Géziqún, Fēngdí hé Wēishìjì","degree":"程度：簡單｜A0–A1","summary":"Easy · source level A0–A1 · 4 illustrated sections.","summaryZh":"简单｜原稿程度 A0–A1｜4段配图阅读。","sections":[{"heading":"Mountains and the Highlands","en":"Scotland is in the north of Great Britain. It has many mountains, lakes, and green land. The Highlands are very famous.","zh":"苏格兰在大不列颠岛北边。这里有很多山、湖和绿色的地方。苏格兰高地很有名。","pinyin":"Sūgélán zài Dàbùlièdiān Dǎo běibiān. Zhèlǐ yǒu hěn duō shān, hú hé lǜsè de dìfang. Sūgélán Gāodì hěn yǒumíng.","imagePages":["Scottish Highlands","Glencoe, Scotland"],"caption":"Mountains and the Highlands"},{"heading":"Kilts and Tartan","en":"Traditional Scottish clothes include the kilt. It looks like a skirt and often has colorful squares. People may wear it on special days.","zh":"传统苏格兰衣服里有格子裙。它看起来像裙子，上面常有彩色格子。人们会在特别的日子穿。","pinyin":"Chuántǒng Sūgélán yīfu lǐ yǒu géziqún. Tā kàn qǐlái xiàng qúnzi, shàngmiàn cháng yǒu cǎisè gézi. Rénmen huì zài tèbié de rìzi chuān.","imagePages":["Kilt","Tartan"],"caption":"Kilts and Tartan"},{"heading":"Bagpipes","en":"Scotland is also famous for bagpipes. They are a traditional music instrument. You can hear them at festivals and special events.","zh":"苏格兰也以风笛闻名。它是一种传统乐器。在节日和特别活动里常可以听到。","pinyin":"Sūgélán yě yǐ fēngdí wénmíng. Tā shì yì zhǒng chuántǒng yuèqì. Zài jiérì hé tèbié huódòng lǐ cháng kěyǐ tīngdào.","imagePages":["Great Highland bagpipe"],"caption":"Bagpipes"},{"heading":"Scotch Whisky","en":"Scotland is famous for whisky too. It is made from grain and water. Different places make different kinds.","zh":"苏格兰的威士忌也很有名。它用谷物和水做。不同地方会做出不同的味道。","pinyin":"Sūgélán de wēishìjì yě hěn yǒumíng. Tā yòng gǔwù hé shuǐ zuò. Bùtóng dìfang huì zuò chū bùtóng de wèidào.","imagePages":["Scotch whisky"],"caption":"Scotch Whisky"}]},"A2":{"title":"Scotland – Highlands, Clans, Whisky, Music, and Its Own Culture","titleZh":"苏格兰——高地、氏族、威士忌、音乐和自己的文化","titlePinyin":"Sūgélán — Gāodì, Shìzú, Wēishìjì, Yīnyuè hé Zìjǐ de Wénhuà","degree":"程度：中｜A1–A2","summary":"Standard · source level A1–A2 · 5 illustrated sections.","summaryZh":"中｜原稿程度 A1–A2｜5段配图阅读。","sections":[{"heading":"Highlands and Landscape","en":"Scotland is in the north of Great Britain. It has many mountains, lakes, islands, and green land. The Highlands are famous for open land and beautiful natural views.","zh":"苏格兰在大不列颠岛北部。这里有很多山、湖、岛和绿色的土地。高地地区有很大的自然空间，也有很漂亮的风景。","pinyin":"Sūgélán zài Dàbùlièdiān Dǎo běibù. Zhèlǐ yǒu hěn duō shān, hú, dǎo hé lǜsè de tǔdì. Gāodì dìqū yǒu hěn dà de zìrán kōngjiān, yě yǒu hěn piàoliang de fēngjǐng.","imagePages":["Scottish Highlands","Glencoe, Scotland"],"caption":"Highlands and Landscape"},{"heading":"Clans and Tartan","en":"Long ago, Scotland had strong clan traditions. A clan was a large family group. Different clans had their own names, land, and history. The colorful checked cloth called tartan is also connected with this culture.","zh":"很久以前，苏格兰有很强的氏族传统。一个氏族就是一个很大的家族。不同氏族有自己的名字、土地和历史。彩色格子布也和这种文化有很深的关系。","pinyin":"Hěn jiǔ yǐqián, Sūgélán yǒu hěn qiáng de shìzú chuántǒng. Yí ge shìzú jiùshì yí ge hěn dà de jiāzú. Bùtóng shìzú yǒu zìjǐ de míngzi, tǔdì hé lìshǐ. Cǎisè gézibù yě hé zhè zhǒng wénhuà yǒu hěn shēn de guānxi.","imagePages":["Scottish clan","Tartan"],"caption":"Clans and Tartan"},{"heading":"Union and Scottish Institutions","en":"Scotland was once its own kingdom. In 1707, Scotland and England joined together. Today, Scotland is part of the United Kingdom, but it still has its own Parliament, school system, and legal system.","zh":"苏格兰以前是自己的王国。1707年，苏格兰和英格兰联合。今天，苏格兰是英国的一部分，但是它还是有自己的议会、学校制度和法律制度。","pinyin":"Sūgélán yǐqián shì zìjǐ de wángguó. Yī qī líng qī nián, Sūgélán hé Yīnggélán liánhé. Jīntiān, Sūgélán shì Yīngguó de yí bùfen, dànshì tā háishi yǒu zìjǐ de yìhuì, xuéxiào zhìdù hé fǎlǜ zhìdù.","imagePages":["Acts of Union 1707","Scottish Parliament"],"caption":"Union and Scottish Institutions"},{"heading":"Whisky","en":"Scotland is famous for whisky. It is made from grain and water and is kept in wooden barrels for years. Different parts of Scotland make whisky with different tastes.","zh":"苏格兰以威士忌闻名。它用谷物和水做成，再放在木桶里很多年。苏格兰不同地区做出来的威士忌，味道也不一样。","pinyin":"Sūgélán yǐ wēishìjì wénmíng. Tā yòng gǔwù hé shuǐ zuò chéng, zài fàng zài mùtǒng lǐ hěn duō nián. Sūgélán bùtóng dìqū zuò chūlái de wēishìjì, wèidào yě bù yíyàng.","imagePages":["Scotch whisky"],"caption":"Whisky"},{"heading":"Bagpipes, Kilts, and Group Dance","en":"Traditional Scottish culture also includes bagpipes, kilts, and group dancing. People may see these at festivals, weddings, and other special events. These traditions are still strong symbols of Scotland today.","zh":"传统苏格兰文化也有风笛、苏格兰裙和多人舞蹈。在节日、婚礼和其他特别活动中，人们常常可以看到这些东西。今天，它们还是很有代表性的苏格兰文化。","pinyin":"Chuántǒng Sūgélán wénhuà yě yǒu fēngdí, Sūgélán qún hé duōrén wǔdǎo. Zài jiérì, hūnlǐ hé qítā tèbié huódòng zhōng, rénmen chángcháng kěyǐ kàndào zhèxiē dōngxi. Jīntiān, tāmen háishi hěn yǒu dàibiǎoxìng de Sūgélán wénhuà.","imagePages":["Great Highland bagpipe","Scottish country dance","Kilt"],"caption":"Bagpipes, Kilts, and Group Dance"}]},"B1":{"title":"Scotland – Highlands, Clans, Whisky, Music, and a Different National Identity","titleZh":"苏格兰——高地、氏族、威士忌、音乐和独特的国家认同","titlePinyin":"Sūgélán — Gāodì, Shìzú, Wēishìjì, Yīnyuè hé Dútè de Guójiā Rèntóng","degree":"程度：難｜A2–B1","summary":"Deep · source level A2–B1 · 6 illustrated sections.","summaryZh":"难｜原稿程度 A2–B1｜6段配图阅读。","sections":[{"heading":"Highlands and Settlement","en":"Scotland is in the north of Great Britain. Much of the north and west is covered by mountains, valleys, lakes, and islands. The Highlands have fewer large cities and are known for open land and strong natural scenery. Many people live in the lower and more urban areas of the south and east.","zh":"苏格兰在大不列颠岛北部。北部和西部有很多山、山谷、湖和岛。高地地区的大城市比较少，有很多开阔的自然土地。大部分人口住在南部和东部比较低、城市比较多的地方。","pinyin":"Sūgélán zài Dàbùlièdiān Dǎo běibù. Běibù hé xībù yǒu hěn duō shān, shāngǔ, hú hé dǎo. Gāodì dìqū de dà chéngshì bǐjiào shǎo, yǒu hěn duō kāikuò de zìrán tǔdì. Dà bùfen rénkǒu zhù zài nánbù hé dōngbù bǐjiào dī, chéngshì bǐjiào duō de dìfang.","imagePages":["Scottish Highlands","Glencoe, Scotland"],"caption":"Highlands and Settlement"},{"heading":"Clan Traditions and Tartan","en":"For hundreds of years, Scottish society had strong clan traditions. A clan was a large group of families connected by family ties and local land. Different clans had their own history and leaders. Today, clan culture can still be seen in names, festivals, and tartan, the colorful checked cloth used in traditional clothing.","zh":"几百年来，苏格兰有很强的氏族传统。一个氏族通常是很多有家族关系、住在同一个地区的家庭。不同氏族有自己的历史和领袖。今天，从姓氏、节日和传统的格子布上，还是可以看到这种文化。","pinyin":"Jǐ bǎi nián lái, Sūgélán yǒu hěn qiáng de shìzú chuántǒng. Yí ge shìzú tōngcháng shì hěn duō yǒu jiāzú guānxi, zhù zài tóng yí ge dìqū de jiātíng. Bùtóng shìzú yǒu zìjǐ de lìshǐ hé lǐngxiù. Jīntiān, cóng xìngshì, jiérì hé chuántǒng de gézibù shàng, háishi kěyǐ kàndào zhè zhǒng wénhuà.","imagePages":["Scottish clan","Tartan"],"caption":"Clan Traditions and Tartan"},{"heading":"From Independent Kingdom to Union","en":"Scotland was once an independent kingdom. It had many wars and political struggles with England. In 1707, Scotland and England joined to form Great Britain. Scotland still kept some of its own systems, including its legal system and education system.","zh":"苏格兰以前是一个独立王国，和英格兰之间发生过很多战争和政治冲突。1707年，苏格兰和英格兰联合，组成大不列颠。可是苏格兰还是保留了一些自己的制度，包括法律和教育制度。","pinyin":"Sūgélán yǐqián shì yí ge dúlì wángguó, hé Yīnggélán zhījiān fāshēng guò hěn duō zhànzhēng hé zhèngzhì chōngtū. Yī qī líng qī nián, Sūgélán hé Yīnggélán liánhé, zǔchéng Dàbùlièdiān. Kěshì Sūgélán háishi bǎoliú le yìxiē zìjǐ de zhìdù, bāokuò fǎlǜ hé jiàoyù zhìdù.","imagePages":["Acts of Union 1707","Kingdom of Scotland"],"caption":"From Independent Kingdom to Union"},{"heading":"Whisky Regions and Production","en":"Scotland is famous for whisky. It is made from grain, water, and yeast, then kept in wooden barrels for several years. Different parts of Scotland produce whisky with different smells and tastes. Some are light and sweet, while others have a strong smoky taste.","zh":"苏格兰以威士忌闻名。威士忌用谷物、水和酵母做成，然后放在木桶里保存很多年。苏格兰不同地区做出来的威士忌味道也不一样。有些比较轻、比较甜，有些则有很强的烟熏味。","pinyin":"Sūgélán yǐ wēishìjì wénmíng. Wēishìjì yòng gǔwù, shuǐ hé jiàomǔ zuò chéng, ránhòu fàng zài mùtǒng lǐ bǎocún hěn duō nián. Sūgélán bùtóng dìqū zuò chūlái de wēishìjì wèidào yě bù yíyàng. Yǒuxiē bǐjiào qīng, bǐjiào tián, yǒuxiē zé yǒu hěn qiáng de yānxūn wèi.","imagePages":["Scotch whisky"],"caption":"Whisky Regions and Production"},{"heading":"Bagpipes and Group Dancing","en":"Traditional Scottish music often includes bagpipes and group dancing. At festivals and family events, people may dance together to fast music. Traditional gatherings can also include games, music, and people wearing kilts made from tartan cloth.","zh":"传统苏格兰音乐常会用到风笛，也有很多人一起跳舞的传统。在节日和家庭活动中，人们可能会跟着很快的音乐一起跳舞。一些传统活动也会有比赛、音乐，还有人穿格子布做的苏格兰裙。","pinyin":"Chuántǒng Sūgélán yīnyuè cháng huì yòngdào fēngdí, yě yǒu hěn duō rén yìqǐ tiàowǔ de chuántǒng. Zài jiérì hé jiātíng huódòng zhōng, rénmen kěnéng huì gēnzhe hěn kuài de yīnyuè yìqǐ tiàowǔ. Yìxiē chuántǒng huódòng yě huì yǒu bǐsài, yīnyuè, hái yǒu rén chuān gézibù zuò de Sūgélán qún.","imagePages":["Great Highland bagpipe","Scottish country dance","Highland games"],"caption":"Bagpipes and Group Dancing"},{"heading":"A Distinct National Identity","en":"Scotland also has a strong national identity. It has its own Parliament and controls areas such as health and education. Many people feel both Scottish and British, while others mainly identify as Scottish. This separate history, culture, and political system makes Scotland feel different from England even though both are part of the United Kingdom.","zh":"苏格兰也有很强的国家认同。它有自己的议会，可以管理医疗和教育等事情。很多人觉得自己既是苏格兰人也是英国人，也有人主要认为自己是苏格兰人。虽然苏格兰和英格兰都属于英国，但它们的历史、文化和制度还是很不一样。","pinyin":"Sūgélán yě yǒu hěn qiáng de guójiā rèntóng. Tā yǒu zìjǐ de yìhuì, kěyǐ guǎnlǐ yīliáo hé jiàoyù děng shìqing. Hěn duō rén juéde zìjǐ jì shì Sūgélán rén yě shì Yīngguó rén, yě yǒu rén zhǔyào rènwéi zìjǐ shì Sūgélán rén. Suīrán Sūgélán hé Yīnggélán dōu shǔyú Yīngguó, dàn tāmen de lìshǐ, wénhuà hé zhìdù háishi hěn bù yíyàng.","imagePages":["Scottish Parliament","Politics of Scotland"],"caption":"A Distinct National Identity"}]}}},{"slug":"wales","name":"Wales","region":"Europe","flag":"gb-wls","mapId":"826","mapPoint":[-3.55,52.35],"readOrder":36,"summary":"Mountains, Welsh language, castles, coal history, rugby, and singing make Wales distinctive.","summaryZh":"山地、威尔士语、城堡、煤矿历史、橄榄球与歌唱构成威尔士鲜明特色。","facts":{"Capital":"Cardiff","Languages":"Welsh and English","Part of":"United Kingdom","Landscape":"Mountains and long coastline"},"versions":{"A1":{"title":"Wales – Mountains, Welsh, Rugby, and Singing","titleZh":"威尔士——高山、威尔士语、橄榄球和唱歌","titlePinyin":"Wēi'ěrshì — Gāoshān, Wēi'ěrshìyǔ, Gǎnlǎnqiú hé Chànggē","degree":"程度：簡單｜A0–A1","summary":"Easy · source level A0–A1 · 4 illustrated sections.","summaryZh":"简单｜原稿程度 A0–A1｜4段配图阅读。","sections":[{"heading":"Mountains and Green Land","en":"Wales is in the west of Great Britain. It has many mountains and green fields.","zh":"威尔士在大不列颠岛西边。这里有很多山和绿色的地。","pinyin":"Wēi'ěrshì zài Dàbùlièdiān Dǎo xībiān. Zhèlǐ yǒu hěn duō shān hé lǜsè de dì.","imagePages":["Geography of Wales","Snowdonia"],"caption":"Mountains and Green Land"},{"heading":"Welsh Language","en":"Wales has its own language, Welsh. People can see Welsh and English on many road signs.","zh":"威尔士有自己的语言，叫威尔士语。很多路牌上都有威尔士语和英语。","pinyin":"Wēi'ěrshì yǒu zìjǐ de yǔyán, jiào Wēi'ěrshìyǔ. Hěn duō lùpái shàng dōu yǒu Wēi'ěrshìyǔ hé Yīngyǔ.","imagePages":["Welsh language","Road signs in Wales"],"caption":"Welsh Language"},{"heading":"Rugby","en":"Rugby is very popular in Wales. Many people like to watch big games.","zh":"橄榄球在威尔士很受欢迎。很多人喜欢看大比赛。","pinyin":"Gǎnlǎnqiú zài Wēi'ěrshì hěn shòu huānyíng. Hěn duō rén xǐhuan kàn dà bǐsài.","imagePages":["Rugby union in Wales","Wales national rugby union team"],"caption":"Rugby"},{"heading":"Singing","en":"People in Wales also like singing. Many groups sing together at festivals and special days.","zh":"威尔士人也很喜欢唱歌。很多人会在节日和特别的日子一起唱歌。","pinyin":"Wēi'ěrshì rén yě hěn xǐhuan chànggē. Hěn duō rén huì zài jiérì hé tèbié de rìzi yìqǐ chànggē.","imagePages":["National Eisteddfod of Wales","Welsh choirs"],"caption":"Singing"}]},"A2":{"title":"Wales – Mountains, Welsh, Castles, Rugby, and Music","titleZh":"威尔士——山地、威尔士语、城堡、橄榄球和音乐","titlePinyin":"Wēi'ěrshì — Shāndì, Wēi'ěrshìyǔ, Chéngbǎo, Gǎnlǎnqiú hé Yīnyuè","degree":"程度：中｜A1–A2","summary":"Standard · source level A1–A2 · 5 illustrated sections.","summaryZh":"中｜原稿程度 A1–A2｜5段配图阅读。","sections":[{"heading":"Mountains, Coast, and Sheep Farming","en":"Wales is in the west of Great Britain. It has many mountains, green hills, farms, and a long coastline. Sheep farming is also common in many country areas.","zh":"威尔士在大不列颠岛西部。这里有很多山、绿色山丘、农田和很长的海岸线。很多乡村地区也常常养羊。","pinyin":"Wēi'ěrshì zài Dàbùlièdiān Dǎo xībù. Zhèlǐ yǒu hěn duō shān, lǜsè shānqiū, nóngtián hé hěn cháng de hǎi'ànxiàn. Hěn duō xiāngcūn dìqū yě chángcháng yǎng yáng.","imagePages":["Geography of Wales","Sheep farming in Wales"],"caption":"Mountains, Coast, and Sheep Farming"},{"heading":"Welsh in Public Life","en":"Wales has its own language, Welsh. It is very different from English. Today, people can see Welsh and English on road signs, in schools, and in public places.","zh":"威尔士有自己的语言，叫威尔士语。它和英语很不一样。今天，在路牌、学校和公共场所都可以看到威尔士语和英语。","pinyin":"Wēi'ěrshì yǒu zìjǐ de yǔyán, jiào Wēi'ěrshìyǔ. Tā hé Yīngyǔ hěn bù yíyàng. Jīntiān, zài lùpái, xuéxiào hé gōnggòng chǎngsuǒ dōu kěyǐ kàndào Wēi'ěrshìyǔ hé Yīngyǔ.","imagePages":["Welsh language","Road signs in Wales"],"caption":"Welsh in Public Life"},{"heading":"Castles","en":"Wales is also famous for its castles. Many were built hundreds of years ago. Some castles are on hills or near the sea. Today, people can still visit many of them.","zh":"威尔士也以城堡闻名。很多城堡是几百年前建的。有些在山上，有些靠近海边。今天，很多城堡还可以进去参观。","pinyin":"Wēi'ěrshì yě yǐ chéngbǎo wénmíng. Hěn duō chéngbǎo shì jǐ bǎi nián qián jiàn de. Yǒuxiē zài shān shàng, yǒuxiē kàojìn hǎibiān. Jīntiān, hěn duō chéngbǎo hái kěyǐ jìnqù cānguān.","imagePages":["Castles in Wales","Caernarfon Castle"],"caption":"Castles"},{"heading":"Rugby","en":"Rugby is very popular in Wales. Many people watch the national team and wear red during big games. Rugby is an important part of local sports culture.","zh":"橄榄球在威尔士很受欢迎。很多人会看国家队比赛，大比赛的时候也会穿红色衣服。橄榄球是当地很重要的运动文化。","pinyin":"Gǎnlǎnqiú zài Wēi'ěrshì hěn shòu huānyíng. Hěn duō rén huì kàn guójiāduì bǐsài, dà bǐsài de shíhou yě huì chuān hóngsè yīfu. Gǎnlǎnqiú shì dāngdì hěn zhòngyào de yùndòng wénhuà.","imagePages":["Rugby union in Wales","Wales national rugby union team"],"caption":"Rugby"},{"heading":"Choirs and Singing","en":"Wales also has a strong singing tradition. Many towns have choirs, and people sing at festivals and special events. Music and singing are still an important part of Welsh culture.","zh":"威尔士也有很强的唱歌传统。很多城市都有合唱团，人们也会在节日和特别活动中唱歌。音乐和唱歌现在还是威尔士文化中很重要的一部分。","pinyin":"Wēi'ěrshì yě yǒu hěn qiáng de chànggē chuántǒng. Hěn duō chéngshì dōu yǒu héchàngtuán, rénmen yě huì zài jiérì hé tèbié huódòng zhōng chànggē. Yīnyuè hé chànggē xiànzài háishi Wēi'ěrshì wénhuà zhōng hěn zhòngyào de yí bùfen.","imagePages":["National Eisteddfod of Wales","Welsh choirs"],"caption":"Choirs and Singing"}]},"B1":{"title":"Wales – Mountains, Welsh Language, Castles, Coal, Rugby, and Music","titleZh":"威尔士——山地、威尔士语、城堡、煤矿、橄榄球和音乐","titlePinyin":"Wēi'ěrshì — Shāndì, Wēi'ěrshìyǔ, Chéngbǎo, Méikuàng, Gǎnlǎnqiú hé Yīnyuè","degree":"程度：難｜A2–B1","summary":"Deep · source level A2–B1 · 6 illustrated sections.","summaryZh":"难｜原稿程度 A2–B1｜6段配图阅读。","sections":[{"heading":"Mountain Landscape and Sheep Farming","en":"Wales is in the west of Great Britain. Much of the land is mountainous, and the country also has a long coastline. Many towns are small, and large areas are covered by green hills, farms, and valleys. Sheep farming has been important in many rural areas for a long time.","zh":"威尔士在大不列颠岛西部。这里有很多山，也有很长的海岸线。很多城镇都不大，还有大片绿色山地、农田和山谷。很长时间以来，养羊一直是很多乡村地区的重要工作。","pinyin":"Wēi'ěrshì zài Dàbùlièdiān Dǎo xībù. Zhèlǐ yǒu hěn duō shān, yě yǒu hěn cháng de hǎi'ànxiàn. Hěn duō chéngzhèn dōu bú dà, hái yǒu dàpiàn lǜsè shāndì, nóngtián hé shāngǔ. Hěn cháng shíjiān yǐlái, yǎng yáng yìzhí shì hěn duō xiāngcūn dìqū de zhòngyào gōngzuò.","imagePages":["Geography of Wales","Sheep farming in Wales"],"caption":"Mountain Landscape and Sheep Farming"},{"heading":"The Welsh Language","en":"Wales has its own language, Welsh. It is very different from English and has been spoken for more than a thousand years. Today, both Welsh and English are used in schools, government, road signs, and public life. In some parts of Wales, many people still use Welsh every day.","zh":"威尔士有自己的语言，叫威尔士语。它和英语很不一样，已经使用了一千多年。今天，学校、政府、路牌和公共生活中都会使用威尔士语和英语。在一些地区，很多人每天还是会说威尔士语。","pinyin":"Wēi'ěrshì yǒu zìjǐ de yǔyán, jiào Wēi'ěrshìyǔ. Tā hé Yīngyǔ hěn bù yíyàng, yǐjīng shǐyòng le yì qiān duō nián. Jīntiān, xuéxiào, zhèngfǔ, lùpái hé gōnggòng shēnghuó zhōng dōu huì shǐyòng Wēi'ěrshìyǔ hé Yīngyǔ. Zài yìxiē dìqū, hěn duō rén měitiān háishi huì shuō Wēi'ěrshìyǔ.","imagePages":["Welsh language","Road signs in Wales"],"caption":"The Welsh Language"},{"heading":"Hundreds of Castles","en":"Wales is also known for its many castles. Hundreds of castles were built there during the Middle Ages. Some were built by local rulers, while others were built by English kings to control the land. Today, many stone castles can still be seen across the country.","zh":"威尔士也以很多城堡闻名。中世纪时，这里建了几百座城堡。有些是当地统治者建的，也有一些是英格兰国王为了控制这个地区而建的。今天，在威尔士很多地方还是可以看到这些石头城堡。","pinyin":"Wēi'ěrshì yě yǐ hěn duō chéngbǎo wénmíng. Zhōngshìjì shí, zhèlǐ jiàn le jǐ bǎi zuò chéngbǎo. Yǒuxiē shì dāngdì tǒngzhìzhě jiàn de, yě yǒu yìxiē shì Yīnggélán guówáng wèile kòngzhì zhè ge dìqū ér jiàn de. Jīntiān, zài Wēi'ěrshì hěn duō dìfang háishi kěyǐ kàndào zhèxiē shítou chéngbǎo.","imagePages":["Castles in Wales","Caernarfon Castle"],"caption":"Hundreds of Castles"},{"heading":"Coal and the Industrial Revolution","en":"During the Industrial Revolution, coal became very important in southern Wales. Large mines opened, and many workers moved into the valleys. Welsh coal was sent to factories and ships in many parts of the world. Later, most coal mines closed, but old mining towns still show this part of Welsh history.","zh":"在工业革命时期，煤矿对威尔士南部非常重要。很多大型矿场开始工作，也有很多工人搬到山谷里的城镇。威尔士的煤被送到世界很多地方的工厂和船上。后来，大部分煤矿关闭了，但是很多老矿城还保留着这段历史。","pinyin":"Zài Gōngyè Gémìng shíqī, méikuàng duì Wēi'ěrshì nánbù fēicháng zhòngyào. Hěn duō dàxíng kuàngchǎng kāishǐ gōngzuò, yě yǒu hěn duō gōngrén bān dào shāngǔ lǐ de chéngzhèn. Wēi'ěrshì de méi bèi sòng dào shìjiè hěn duō dìfang de gōngchǎng hé chuán shàng. Hòulái, dà bùfen méikuàng guānbì le, dànshì hěn duō lǎo kuàngchéng hái bǎoliúzhe zhè duàn lìshǐ.","imagePages":["South Wales Coalfield","Big Pit National Coal Museum"],"caption":"Coal and the Industrial Revolution"},{"heading":"Rugby Culture","en":"Rugby is one of the most popular sports in Wales. International matches are important events, and many people wear red to support the national team. Rugby is especially strong in towns that once had mining and industrial communities.","zh":"橄榄球是威尔士最受欢迎的运动之一。国际比赛是很重要的活动，很多人会穿红色衣服支持国家队。橄榄球在以前有矿场和工业的城镇里特别受欢迎。","pinyin":"Gǎnlǎnqiú shì Wēi'ěrshì zuì shòu huānyíng de yùndòng zhī yī. Guójì bǐsài shì hěn zhòngyào de huódòng, hěn duō rén huì chuān hóngsè yīfu zhīchí guójiāduì. Gǎnlǎnqiú zài yǐqián yǒu kuàngchǎng hé gōngyè de chéngzhèn lǐ tèbié shòu huānyíng.","imagePages":["Rugby union in Wales","Wales national rugby union team"],"caption":"Rugby Culture"},{"heading":"Singing, Poetry, and Storytelling","en":"Wales also has a strong tradition of singing, poetry, and storytelling. Large cultural festivals bring people together to sing, perform music, and read poems. Choir singing is especially well known, and many towns have their own singing groups. This is why music and language are still closely connected with Welsh identity.","zh":"威尔士也有很强的唱歌、诗歌和讲故事传统。大型文化活动会让大家一起唱歌、表演音乐和读诗。合唱在威尔士特别有名，很多城市都有自己的合唱团。所以，音乐和语言到现在还是威尔士文化中很重要的一部分。","pinyin":"Wēi'ěrshì yě yǒu hěn qiáng de chànggē, shīgē hé jiǎng gùshi chuántǒng. Dàxíng wénhuà huódòng huì ràng dàjiā yìqǐ chànggē, biǎoyǎn yīnyuè hé dú shī. Héchàng zài Wēi'ěrshì tèbié yǒumíng, hěn duō chéngshì dōu yǒu zìjǐ de héchàngtuán. Suǒyǐ, yīnyuè hé yǔyán dào xiànzài háishi Wēi'ěrshì wénhuà zhōng hěn zhòngyào de yí bùfen.","imagePages":["National Eisteddfod of Wales","Welsh choirs"],"caption":"Singing, Poetry, and Storytelling"}]}}},{"slug":"northern-ireland","name":"Northern Ireland","region":"Europe","flag":"gb","mapId":"826","mapPoint":[-6.7,54.72],"readOrder":37,"summary":"Coastal geology, two identities, shipbuilding, the peace process, local food, and music shape Northern Ireland.","summaryZh":"海岸地质、两种认同、造船、和平进程、当地饮食与音乐构成北爱尔兰主题。","facts":{"Capital":"Belfast","Languages":"English; Irish and Ulster Scots also used","Part of":"United Kingdom","Landscape":"Coast, hills, farmland, lakes"},"versions":{"A1":{"title":"Northern Ireland – Green Land, Ships, Food, and Music","titleZh":"北爱尔兰——绿色土地、船、食物和音乐","titlePinyin":"Běi Ài'ěrlán — Lǜsè Tǔdì, Chuán, Shíwù hé Yīnyuè","degree":"程度：簡單｜A0–A1","summary":"Easy · source level A0–A1 · 4 illustrated sections.","summaryZh":"简单｜原稿程度 A0–A1｜4段配图阅读。","sections":[{"heading":"Green Land and Lakes","en":"Northern Ireland is part of the United Kingdom. It has many green fields, hills, and lakes.","zh":"北爱尔兰是英国的一部分。这里有很多绿色的田、山和湖。","pinyin":"Běi Ài'ěrlán shì Yīngguó de yí bùfen. Zhèlǐ yǒu hěn duō lǜsè de tián, shān hé hú.","imagePages":["Geography of Northern Ireland","Lough Neagh"],"caption":"Green Land and Lakes"},{"heading":"Shipbuilding and the Titanic","en":"Northern Ireland has a long shipbuilding history. The Titanic was built there.","zh":"北爱尔兰以前很会造船。泰坦尼克号也是在那里建的。","pinyin":"Běi Ài'ěrlán yǐqián hěn huì zàochuán. Tàitǎnníkè Hào yě shì zài nàlǐ jiàn de.","imagePages":["Harland & Wolff","RMS Titanic"],"caption":"Shipbuilding and the Titanic"},{"heading":"Local Food","en":"People often eat potatoes, bread, eggs, and meat. A big breakfast is also common.","zh":"人们常吃土豆、面包、鸡蛋和肉。这里也很常吃很丰富的早餐。","pinyin":"Rénmen cháng chī tǔdòu, miànbāo, jīdàn hé ròu. Zhèlǐ yě hěn cháng chī hěn fēngfù de zǎocān.","imagePages":["Ulster fry","Northern Irish cuisine"],"caption":"Local Food"},{"heading":"Traditional Music","en":"Traditional music is also popular. People may listen to music in pubs or at local events.","zh":"传统音乐也很受欢迎。人们会在酒馆或当地活动里听音乐。","pinyin":"Chuántǒng yīnyuè yě hěn shòu huānyíng. Rénmen huì zài jiǔguǎn huò dāngdì huódòng lǐ tīng yīnyuè.","imagePages":["Music of Northern Ireland","Irish traditional music session"],"caption":"Traditional Music"}]},"A2":{"title":"Northern Ireland – Green Land, Two Identities, Shipbuilding, and Local Food","titleZh":"北爱尔兰——绿色土地、两种认同、造船和当地食物","titlePinyin":"Běi Ài'ěrlán — Lǜsè Tǔdì, Liǎng Zhǒng Rèntóng, Zàochuán hé Dāngdì Shíwù","degree":"程度：中｜A1–A2","summary":"Standard · source level A1–A2 · 5 illustrated sections.","summaryZh":"中｜原稿程度 A1–A2｜5段配图阅读。","sections":[{"heading":"Coast and Giant’s Causeway","en":"Northern Ireland is in the northeast of Ireland and is part of the United Kingdom. It has green fields, hills, lakes, and a long coast. One famous place by the sea has many tall dark rocks.","zh":"北爱尔兰在爱尔兰岛东北部，也是英国的一部分。这里有绿色的田地、山、湖和很长的海岸。海边还有一个很有名的地方，可以看到很多高高的黑色石柱。","pinyin":"Běi Ài'ěrlán zài Ài'ěrlán Dǎo dōngběibù, yě shì Yīngguó de yí bùfen. Zhèlǐ yǒu lǜsè de tiándì, shān, hú hé hěn cháng de hǎi'àn. Hǎibiān hái yǒu yí ge hěn yǒumíng de dìfang, kěyǐ kàndào hěn duō gāogāo de hēisè shízhù.","imagePages":["Giant's Causeway","Geography of Northern Ireland"],"caption":"Coast and Giant’s Causeway"},{"heading":"Two Identities","en":"Northern Ireland has a special history. Some people feel more British, while some feel more Irish. Other people feel connected to both. Because of this, culture and identity can be different from one family or area to another.","zh":"北爱尔兰有很特别的历史。有些人觉得自己比较像英国人，有些人觉得自己比较像爱尔兰人，也有人觉得两边都有关系。所以，不同家庭和地区的文化认同可能不太一样。","pinyin":"Běi Ài'ěrlán yǒu hěn tèbié de lìshǐ. Yǒuxiē rén juéde zìjǐ bǐjiào xiàng Yīngguó rén, yǒuxiē rén juéde zìjǐ bǐjiào xiàng Ài'ěrlán rén, yě yǒu rén juéde liǎngbiān dōu yǒu guānxi. Suǒyǐ, bùtóng jiātíng hé dìqū de wénhuà rèntóng kěnéng bù tài yíyàng.","imagePages":["People of Northern Ireland","Northern Ireland"],"caption":"Two Identities"},{"heading":"Belfast Shipbuilding","en":"The capital has a long shipbuilding history. Many large ships were built there. One of the most famous ships in history, the Titanic, was also built there. The city was also known for factories and cloth making.","zh":"首都有很长的造船历史。以前这里建过很多大型船只。历史上很有名的泰坦尼克号也是在这里建的。这座城市以前也有很多工厂，还会做布。","pinyin":"Shǒudū yǒu hěn cháng de zàochuán lìshǐ. Yǐqián zhèlǐ jiàn guò hěn duō dàxíng chuánzhī. Lìshǐ shàng hěn yǒumíng de Tàitǎnníkè Hào yě shì zài zhèlǐ jiàn de. Zhè zuò chéngshì yǐqián yě yǒu hěn duō gōngchǎng, hái huì zuò bù.","imagePages":["Harland & Wolff","RMS Titanic","Linen in Ireland"],"caption":"Belfast Shipbuilding"},{"heading":"The 1998 Peace Agreement","en":"For many years, Northern Ireland had serious conflict between different groups. In 1998, an important peace agreement helped reduce the violence. After that, different political groups began to work together more.","zh":"很多年来，北爱尔兰不同人群之间有很严重的冲突。1998年，一个重要的和平协议帮助减少了暴力。后来，不同的政治团体也开始有更多合作。","pinyin":"Hěn duō nián lái, Běi Ài'ěrlán bùtóng rénqún zhījiān yǒu hěn yánzhòng de chōngtū. Yī jiǔ jiǔ bā nián, yí ge zhòngyào de hépíng xiéyì bāngzhù jiǎnshǎo le bàolì. Hòulái, bùtóng de zhèngzhì tuántǐ yě kāishǐ yǒu gèng duō hézuò.","imagePages":["Good Friday Agreement","The Troubles"],"caption":"The 1998 Peace Agreement"},{"heading":"Food and Music","en":"Local food is often simple and filling. People eat potatoes, bread, eggs, meat, and milk products. A traditional breakfast may have eggs, sausage, bacon, and different kinds of bread. Traditional music is also common in pubs and local events.","zh":"当地食物通常比较简单，也很有饱足感。人们常吃土豆、面包、鸡蛋、肉和奶制品。传统早餐可能有鸡蛋、香肠、培根和不同的面包。在酒馆和当地活动里，也常常可以听到传统音乐。","pinyin":"Dāngdì shíwù tōngcháng bǐjiào jiǎndān, yě hěn yǒu bǎozúgǎn. Rénmen cháng chī tǔdòu, miànbāo, jīdàn, ròu hé nǎizhìpǐn. Chuántǒng zǎocān kěnéng yǒu jīdàn, xiāngcháng, péigēn hé bùtóng de miànbāo. Zài jiǔguǎn hé dāngdì huódòng lǐ, yě chángcháng kěyǐ tīngdào chuántǒng yīnyuè.","imagePages":["Ulster fry","Irish traditional music session"],"caption":"Food and Music"}]},"B1":{"title":"Northern Ireland – Two Identities, Coastal Land, Industry, and Local Culture","titleZh":"北爱尔兰——两种认同、海岸、工业和地方文化","titlePinyin":"Běi Ài'ěrlán — Liǎng Zhǒng Rèntóng, Hǎi'àn, Gōngyè hé Dìfāng Wénhuà","degree":"程度：難｜A2–B1","summary":"Deep · source level A2–B1 · 6 illustrated sections.","summaryZh":"难｜原稿程度 A2–B1｜6段配图阅读。","sections":[{"heading":"Coastal Land and Volcanic Columns","en":"Northern Ireland is in the northeast of the island of Ireland and is part of the United Kingdom. It has green farmland, mountains, lakes, and a long coastline. One famous natural area has thousands of dark stone columns beside the sea. They were formed by volcanic activity millions of years ago.","zh":"北爱尔兰在爱尔兰岛东北部，是英国的一部分。这里有绿色农田、山、湖和很长的海岸线。海边有一个很有名的自然景观，可以看到几千根深色石柱。这些石柱是在几百万年前的火山活动中形成的。","pinyin":"Běi Ài'ěrlán zài Ài'ěrlán Dǎo dōngběibù, shì Yīngguó de yí bùfen. Zhèlǐ yǒu lǜsè nóngtián, shān, hú hé hěn cháng de hǎi'ànxiàn. Hǎibiān yǒu yí ge hěn yǒumíng de zìrán jǐngguān, kěyǐ kàndào jǐ qiān gēn shēnsè shízhù. Zhèxiē shízhù shì zài jǐ bǎi wàn nián qián de huǒshān huódòng zhōng xíngchéng de.","imagePages":["Giant's Causeway","Geography of Northern Ireland"],"caption":"Coastal Land and Volcanic Columns"},{"heading":"Britain, Ireland, and Partition","en":"The history of Northern Ireland is closely connected with both Britain and Ireland. In 1921, most of Ireland separated from the United Kingdom, but six counties in the northeast stayed in the UK. This created Northern Ireland and shaped much of its later political history.","zh":"北爱尔兰的历史和英国、爱尔兰都有很深的关系。1921年，爱尔兰大部分地区离开英国，但是东北部六个地区继续留在英国。这以后形成了北爱尔兰，也影响了后来的政治历史。","pinyin":"Běi Ài'ěrlán de lìshǐ hé Yīngguó, Ài'ěrlán dōu yǒu hěn shēn de guānxi. Yī jiǔ èr yī nián, Ài'ěrlán dà bùfen dìqū líkāi Yīngguó, dànshì dōngběibù liù ge dìqū jìxù liú zài Yīngguó. Zhè yǐhòu xíngchéng le Běi Ài'ěrlán, yě yǐngxiǎng le hòulái de zhèngzhì lìshǐ.","imagePages":["Partition of Ireland","Northern Ireland"],"caption":"Britain, Ireland, and Partition"},{"heading":"The Troubles and the 1998 Agreement","en":"For many years, there was serious conflict between communities with different political and national ideas. This period became especially violent from the late 1960s. In 1998, a major peace agreement helped reduce the violence and created a system where different political groups could share power.","zh":"很多年来，不同政治想法和国家认同的人群之间有很严重的冲突。从二十世纪六十年代末开始，这些冲突变得特别激烈。1998年，一个重要的和平协议帮助减少了暴力，也建立了让不同政治团体一起管理的制度。","pinyin":"Hěn duō nián lái, bùtóng zhèngzhì xiǎngfǎ hé guójiā rèntóng de rénqún zhījiān yǒu hěn yánzhòng de chōngtū. Cóng èrshí shìjì liùshí niándài mò kāishǐ, zhèxiē chōngtū biàn de tèbié jīliè. Yī jiǔ jiǔ bā nián, yí ge zhòngyào de hépíng xiéyì bāngzhù jiǎnshǎo le bàolì, yě jiànlì le ràng bùtóng zhèngzhì tuántǐ yìqǐ guǎnlǐ de zhìdù.","imagePages":["The Troubles","Good Friday Agreement"],"caption":"The Troubles and the 1998 Agreement"},{"heading":"Different National Identities","en":"Because of this history, people in Northern Ireland can have different national identities. Some mainly see themselves as British, some as Irish, and others feel connected to both. English is used most widely, but Irish and Ulster Scots can also be seen and heard in local culture.","zh":"因为这段历史，北爱尔兰人的国家认同可以很不一样。有些人主要认为自己是英国人，有些认为自己是爱尔兰人，也有人觉得两边都有关系。英语使用得最多，但是在当地文化中也可以看到和听到爱尔兰语以及另一种当地语言。","pinyin":"Yīnwèi zhè duàn lìshǐ, Běi Ài'ěrlán rén de guójiā rèntóng kěyǐ hěn bù yíyàng. Yǒuxiē rén zhǔyào rènwéi zìjǐ shì Yīngguó rén, yǒuxiē rènwéi zìjǐ shì Ài'ěrlán rén, yě yǒu rén juéde liǎngbiān dōu yǒu guānxi. Yīngyǔ shǐyòng de zuì duō, dànshì zài dāngdì wénhuà zhōng yě kěyǐ kàndào hé tīngdào Ài'ěrlányǔ yǐjí lìng yì zhǒng dāngdì yǔyán.","imagePages":["People of Northern Ireland","Irish language in Northern Ireland","Ulster Scots dialects"],"caption":"Different National Identities"},{"heading":"Belfast Industry and Shipbuilding","en":"Northern Ireland also has an important industrial history. Belfast became famous for shipbuilding, linen cloth, and heavy industry. Large ships were built in its shipyards, including the Titanic. Linen made from flax was also sold to many parts of the world, and Belfast became an important industrial city.","zh":"北爱尔兰也有很重要的工业历史。贝尔法斯特以前以造船、亚麻布和重工业闻名。很多大型船只在这里建造，包括泰坦尼克号。当地用亚麻做的布也卖到世界很多地方，让这座城市成为重要的工业城市。","pinyin":"Běi Ài'ěrlán yě yǒu hěn zhòngyào de gōngyè lìshǐ. Bèi'ěrfǎsītè yǐqián yǐ zàochuán, yàmá bù hé zhònggōngyè wénmíng. Hěn duō dàxíng chuánzhī zài zhèlǐ jiànzào, bāokuò Tàitǎnníkè Hào. Dāngdì yòng yàmá zuò de bù yě mài dào shìjiè hěn duō dìfang, ràng zhè zuò chéngshì chéngwéi zhòngyào de gōngyè chéngshì.","imagePages":["Harland & Wolff","RMS Titanic","Linen in Ireland"],"caption":"Belfast Industry and Shipbuilding"},{"heading":"Food, Pubs, and Traditional Music","en":"Traditional food is often simple and filling. Potatoes, bread, meat, and dairy foods are common. One local breakfast can include eggs, sausage, bacon, potato bread, and soda bread. Music is also an important part of local life, especially traditional songs, dancing, and live music in pubs.","zh":"传统食物常常比较简单，也很有饱足感。土豆、面包、肉和奶制品都很常见。一种当地早餐会有鸡蛋、香肠、培根、土豆面包和苏打面包。音乐也是当地生活很重要的一部分，传统歌曲、跳舞和酒馆里的现场音乐都很常见。","pinyin":"Chuántǒng shíwù chángcháng bǐjiào jiǎndān, yě hěn yǒu bǎozúgǎn. Tǔdòu, miànbāo, ròu hé nǎizhìpǐn dōu hěn chángjiàn. Yì zhǒng dāngdì zǎocān huì yǒu jīdàn, xiāngcháng, péigēn, tǔdòu miànbāo hé sūdǎ miànbāo. Yīnyuè yě shì dāngdì shēnghuó hěn zhòngyào de yí bùfen, chuántǒng gēqǔ, tiàowǔ hé jiǔguǎn lǐ de xiànchǎng yīnyuè dōu hěn chángjiàn.","imagePages":["Ulster fry","Irish traditional music session"],"caption":"Food, Pubs, and Traditional Music"}]}}},{"slug":"denmark","name":"Denmark","region":"Europe","flag":"dk","mapId":"208","readOrder":38,"summary":"Flat islands, Viking seafaring, hygge, practical design, cycling, and rye-bread food traditions shape Denmark.","summaryZh":"低平岛屿、维京航海、hygge、实用设计、自行车与黑麦饮食传统共同构成丹麦特色。","facts":{"Landscape":"Flat land and 400+ islands","History":"Viking seafaring","Culture":"Hygge and practical design","Food":"Rye bread and open sandwiches"},"versions":{"A1":{"title":"Denmark – Sea, Vikings, Hygge, and Bikes","titleZh":"丹麦——大海、维京人、舒适生活和自行车","titlePinyin":"Dānmài — Dàhǎi, Wéijīngrén, Shūshì Shēnghuó hé Zìxíngchē","degree":"程度：簡單｜A0–A1","summary":"Easy · source level A0–A1 · 4 illustrated sections.","summaryZh":"简单｜原稿程度 A0–A1｜4段配图阅读。","learningWords":[{"word":"flat","zh":"平坦的","pinyin":"píngtǎn de","kk":"/flæt/","level":1},{"word":"sailing","zh":"航海","pinyin":"hánghǎi","kk":"/ˈselɪŋ/","level":2},{"word":"Danish Vikings","zh":"丹麦的维京人","pinyin":"Dānmài de Wéijīng rén","kk":"/ˈdenɪʃ ˈvaɪkɪŋz/","level":2},{"word":"sailors","zh":"水手","pinyin":"shuǐshǒu","kk":"/ˈselɚz/","level":2},{"word":"rye","zh":"黑麦","pinyin":"hēimài","kk":"/raɪ/","level":2},{"word":"materials","zh":"材料","pinyin":"cáiliào","kk":"/məˈtɪriəlz/","level":2}],"sections":[{"heading":"Sea and Flat Land","en":"Denmark is near the sea. It has many islands and flat land.","zh":"丹麦靠近大海。这里有很多岛，土地也很平。","pinyin":"Dānmài kàojìn dàhǎi. Zhèlǐ yǒu hěn duō dǎo, tǔdì yě hěn píng.","imagePages":["Geography of Denmark","List of islands of Denmark","Coast of Denmark"],"caption":"Denmark’s flat land and surrounding sea"},{"heading":"Danish Vikings","en":"Long ago, Danish Vikings traveled by ship. They went to many places in Europe.","zh":"很久以前，丹麦的维京人会坐船去很远的地方。他们去过欧洲很多地方。","pinyin":"Hěn jiǔ yǐqián, Dānmài de Wéijīng rén huì zuò chuán qù hěn yuǎn de dìfang. Tāmen qù guò Ōuzhōu hěn duō dìfang.","imagePages":["Viking Age in Denmark","Viking ship"],"caption":"Danish Viking seafaring"},{"heading":"Hygge","en":"Danish people like hygge. It means having a warm and comfortable time with family or friends.","zh":"丹麦人喜欢 hygge。就是和家人或朋友一起过舒服、放松的时间。","pinyin":"Dānmài rén xǐhuan hygge. Jiùshì hé jiārén huò péngyou yìqǐ guò shūfu, fàngsōng de shíjiān.","imagePages":["Hygge","Culture of Denmark"],"caption":"Hygge and comfortable time together"},{"heading":"Everyday Cycling","en":"Many people in Denmark ride bikes every day. They ride to work, school, or shops.","zh":"丹麦很多人每天骑自行车。他们会骑车去上班、上学或买东西。","pinyin":"Dānmài hěn duō rén měitiān qí zìxíngchē. Tāmen huì qí chē qù shàngbān, shàngxué huò mǎi dōngxi.","imagePages":["Cycling in Denmark","Cycling in Copenhagen"],"caption":"Cycling in everyday Danish life"}]},"A2":{"title":"Denmark – Islands, Vikings, Hygge, Design, and Food","titleZh":"丹麦——岛屿、维京人、舒适生活、设计和食物","titlePinyin":"Dānmài — Dǎoyǔ, Wéijīngrén, Shūshì Shēnghuó, Shèjì hé Shíwù","degree":"程度：中｜A1–A2","summary":"Standard · source level A1–A2 · 5 illustrated sections.","summaryZh":"中等｜原稿程度 A1–A2｜5段配图阅读。","learningWords":[{"word":"flat","zh":"平坦的","pinyin":"píngtǎn de","kk":"/flæt/","level":1},{"word":"sailing","zh":"航海","pinyin":"hánghǎi","kk":"/ˈselɪŋ/","level":2},{"word":"Danish Vikings","zh":"丹麦的维京人","pinyin":"Dānmài de Wéijīng rén","kk":"/ˈdenɪʃ ˈvaɪkɪŋz/","level":2},{"word":"sailors","zh":"水手","pinyin":"shuǐshǒu","kk":"/ˈselɚz/","level":2},{"word":"rye","zh":"黑麦","pinyin":"hēimài","kk":"/raɪ/","level":2},{"word":"materials","zh":"材料","pinyin":"cáiliào","kk":"/məˈtɪriəlz/","level":2}],"sections":[{"heading":"Flat Land and the Sea","en":"Denmark is a flat country near the sea. It has many islands, beaches, and small towns. Because the sea is close, fishing and sailing have been important for a long time.","zh":"丹麦是一个靠海、地势很平的国家。这里有很多岛、海边和小城镇。因为大海很近，所以捕鱼和航海很早就是重要的生活方式。","pinyin":"Dānmài shì yí ge kào hǎi, dìshì hěn píng de guójiā. Zhèlǐ yǒu hěn duō dǎo, hǎibiān hé xiǎo chéngzhèn. Yīnwèi dàhǎi hěn jìn, suǒyǐ bǔyú hé hánghǎi hěn zǎo jiù shì zhòngyào de shēnghuó fāngshì.","imagePages":["Geography of Denmark","List of islands of Denmark"],"caption":"Flat Danish landscapes close to the sea"},{"heading":"Danish Vikings and Sailing","en":"About one thousand years ago, Danish Vikings were very good sailors. They traveled to many parts of Europe by ship. They went there for trade, fighting, and new places to live.","zh":"大约一千年前，丹麦的维京人很会航海。他们坐船到欧洲很多地方。他们去那里做生意、打仗，也寻找新的地方生活。","pinyin":"Dàyuē yì qiān nián qián, Dānmài de Wéijīng rén hěn huì hánghǎi. Tāmen zuò chuán dào Ōuzhōu hěn duō dìfang. Tāmen qù nàlǐ zuò shēngyi, dǎzhàng, yě xúnzhǎo xīn de dìfang shēnghuó.","imagePages":["Viking Age in Denmark","Viking ship"],"caption":"Danish Vikings and maritime travel"},{"heading":"Hygge","en":"A famous Danish idea is hygge. It means enjoying simple and comfortable time with family or friends. People may drink something warm, eat, talk, or relax together at home.","zh":"丹麦有一个很有名的生活方式，叫 hygge。意思就是和家人或朋友一起享受简单、舒服的时间。大家可能一起喝热饮、吃东西、聊天，或在家里放松。","pinyin":"Dānmài yǒu yí ge hěn yǒumíng de shēnghuó fāngshì, jiào hygge. Yìsi jiùshì hé jiārén huò péngyou yìqǐ xiǎngshòu jiǎndān, shūfu de shíjiān. Dàjiā kěnéng yìqǐ hē rèyǐn, chī dōngxi, liáotiān, huò zài jiālǐ fàngsōng.","imagePages":["Hygge","Culture of Denmark"],"caption":"Hygge at home with family and friends"},{"heading":"Danish Design","en":"Denmark is also famous for simple design. Danish furniture and buildings often use simple shapes and natural materials. The design usually tries to be both beautiful and easy to use.","zh":"丹麦也以简单的设计闻名。丹麦家具和建筑常用简单的形状和自然材料。设计通常不只要好看，也要好用。","pinyin":"Dānmài yě yǐ jiǎndān de shèjì wénmíng. Dānmài jiājù hé jiànzhù cháng yòng jiǎndān de xíngzhuàng hé zìrán cáiliào. Shèjì tōngcháng bù zhǐ yào hǎokàn, yě yào hǎoyòng.","imagePages":["Danish design","Danish modern"],"caption":"Simple forms and natural materials in Danish design"},{"heading":"Rye Bread and Everyday Food","en":"Traditional Danish food often includes rye bread, fish, meat, and potatoes. One common lunch is dark bread with fish, eggs, meat, or vegetables on top. It is simple, but there are many different kinds.","zh":"传统丹麦食物常有黑麦面包、鱼、肉和土豆。一种常见的午餐是深色面包，上面放鱼、鸡蛋、肉或蔬菜。做法很简单，但是有很多不同的种类。","pinyin":"Chuántǒng Dānmài shíwù cháng yǒu hēimài miànbāo, yú, ròu hé tǔdòu. Yì zhǒng chángjiàn de wǔcān shì shēnsè miànbāo, shàngmiàn fàng yú, jīdàn, ròu huò shūcài. Zuòfǎ hěn jiǎndān, dànshì yǒu hěn duō bùtóng de zhǒnglèi.","imagePages":["Smørrebrød","Rugbrød"],"caption":"Rye bread and Danish open sandwiches"}]},"B1":{"title":"Denmark – Islands, Vikings, Monarchy, Hygge, Design, and Food","titleZh":"丹麦——岛屿、维京历史、王室、舒适生活、设计和饮食","titlePinyin":"Dānmài — Dǎoyǔ, Wéijīng Lìshǐ, Wángshì, Shūshì Shēnghuó, Shèjì hé Yǐnshí","degree":"程度：難｜A2–B1","summary":"Deep · source level A2–B1 · 6 illustrated sections.","summaryZh":"深入｜原稿程度 A2–B1｜6段配图阅读。","learningWords":[{"word":"flat","zh":"平坦的","pinyin":"píngtǎn de","kk":"/flæt/","level":1},{"word":"sailing","zh":"航海","pinyin":"hánghǎi","kk":"/ˈselɪŋ/","level":2},{"word":"Danish Vikings","zh":"丹麦的维京人","pinyin":"Dānmài de Wéijīng rén","kk":"/ˈdenɪʃ ˈvaɪkɪŋz/","level":2},{"word":"sailors","zh":"水手","pinyin":"shuǐshǒu","kk":"/ˈselɚz/","level":2},{"word":"rye","zh":"黑麦","pinyin":"hēimài","kk":"/raɪ/","level":2},{"word":"materials","zh":"材料","pinyin":"cáiliào","kk":"/məˈtɪriəlz/","level":2}],"sections":[{"heading":"Islands and the Sea","en":"Denmark is a flat country surrounded by water. It has more than 400 islands, and no place in the country is very far from the sea. Because of this, fishing, sailing, ports, and sea travel have been important for a very long time.","zh":"丹麦是一个地势很平、四周和水很接近的国家。这里有四百多个岛，而且国内没有地方离海特别远。所以很长时间以来，捕鱼、航海、港口和海上交通都很重要。","pinyin":"Dānmài shì yí ge dìshì hěn píng, sìzhōu hé shuǐ hěn jiējìn de guójiā. Zhèlǐ yǒu sì bǎi duō ge dǎo, érqiě guónèi méiyǒu dìfang lí hǎi tèbié yuǎn. Suǒyǐ hěn cháng shíjiān yǐlái, bǔyú, hánghǎi, gǎngkǒu hé hǎishàng jiāotōng dōu hěn zhòngyào.","imagePages":["Geography of Denmark","List of islands of Denmark","Coast of Denmark"],"caption":"Denmark’s island geography and maritime setting"},{"heading":"Danish Vikings and Long Ships","en":"Around one thousand years ago, Danish Vikings were skilled sailors and shipbuilders. They traveled to many parts of Europe for trade, war, and settlement. Their long ships were fast and could travel both across the sea and along rivers. This period became one of the best-known parts of Danish history.","zh":"大约一千年前，丹麦的维京人很会航海和造船。他们到欧洲很多地方做生意、打仗，也在那里生活。他们的长船速度快，可以在海上航行，也可以进入河流。这段历史后来成为丹麦最有名的历史之一。","pinyin":"Dàyuē yì qiān nián qián, Dānmài de Wéijīng rén hěn huì hánghǎi hé zàochuán. Tāmen dào Ōuzhōu hěn duō dìfang zuò shēngyi, dǎzhàng, yě zài nàlǐ shēnghuó. Tāmen de chángchuán sùdù kuài, kěyǐ zài hǎishàng hángxíng, yě kěyǐ jìnrù héliú. Zhè duàn lìshǐ hòulái chéngwéi Dānmài zuì yǒumíng de lìshǐ zhī yī.","imagePages":["Viking Age in Denmark","Viking ship"],"caption":"Danish Vikings and long ships"},{"heading":"Monarchy and Parliament","en":"Denmark has one of the oldest monarchies in the world, but today the king does not control the government. Denmark became a constitutional monarchy in the 1800s, and Parliament and elected politicians make political decisions. The royal family is still an important national symbol.","zh":"丹麦有世界上最古老的王室制度之一，不过今天国王不会直接管理政府。十九世纪以后，丹麦成为君主立宪国家，政治决定主要由议会和选出来的政治人物负责。王室现在还是丹麦很重要的国家象征。","pinyin":"Dānmài yǒu shìjiè shàng zuì gǔlǎo de wángshì zhìdù zhī yī, búguò jīntiān guówáng bú huì zhíjiē guǎnlǐ zhèngfǔ. Shíjiǔ shìjì yǐhòu, Dānmài chéngwéi jūnzhǔ lìxiàn guójiā, zhèngzhì juédìng zhǔyào yóu yìhuì hé xuǎn chūlái de zhèngzhì rénwù fùzé. Wángshì xiànzài háishi Dānmài hěn zhòngyào de guójiā xiàngzhēng.","imagePages":["Monarchy of Denmark","Christiansborg Palace"],"caption":"Denmark’s monarchy and parliamentary institutions"},{"heading":"Hygge and Winter Life","en":"A famous Danish idea is hygge. It means enjoying simple and comfortable time, often with family or close friends. People may sit together, eat, drink something warm, talk, or relax at home. During Denmark’s long dark winters, this kind of quiet time is especially common.","zh":"丹麦有一个很有名的生活想法，叫 hygge。大概就是和家人或好朋友一起享受简单、舒服的时间。大家可能一起吃东西、喝热饮、聊天，或在家里放松。丹麦冬天比较长也比较暗，所以这种生活方式特别常见。","pinyin":"Dānmài yǒu yí ge hěn yǒumíng de shēnghuó xiǎngfǎ, jiào hygge. Dàgài jiùshì hé jiārén huò hǎo péngyou yìqǐ xiǎngshòu jiǎndān, shūfu de shíjiān. Dàjiā kěnéng yìqǐ chī dōngxi, hē rèyǐn, liáotiān, huò zài jiālǐ fàngsōng. Dānmài dōngtiān bǐjiào cháng yě bǐjiào àn, suǒyǐ zhè zhǒng shēnghuó fāngshì tèbié chángjiàn.","imagePages":["Hygge","Culture of Denmark"],"caption":"Hygge during Denmark’s darker seasons"},{"heading":"Practical Danish Design","en":"Denmark is also well known for simple and practical design. Danish furniture and buildings often use clean lines, natural materials, and simple shapes. The idea is not only to make something beautiful, but also comfortable and useful in daily life. This style became famous around the world in the 20th century.","zh":"丹麦也以简单又实用的设计闻名。丹麦家具和建筑常用清楚的线条、自然材料和简单的形状。重点不只是好看，也要舒服、好用。这种设计风格在二十世纪开始在世界很多地方变得有名。","pinyin":"Dānmài yě yǐ jiǎndān yòu shíyòng de shèjì wénmíng. Dānmài jiājù hé jiànzhù cháng yòng qīngchu de xiàntiáo, zìrán cáiliào hé jiǎndān de xíngzhuàng. Zhòngdiǎn bù zhǐ shì hǎokàn, yě yào shūfu, hǎoyòng. Zhè zhǒng shèjì fēnggé zài èrshí shìjì kāishǐ zài shìjiè hěn duō dìfang biàn de yǒumíng.","imagePages":["Danish design","Danish modern"],"caption":"Practical Danish furniture and design"},{"heading":"Rye Bread and Open Sandwiches","en":"Traditional Danish food often uses rye bread, fish, pork, and potatoes. One well-known lunch is an open sandwich made with dark rye bread and food such as fish, eggs, meat, or potatoes on top. Danish food has also changed in recent years, with more attention to fresh local and seasonal ingredients.","zh":"传统丹麦食物常会用到黑麦面包、鱼、猪肉和土豆。一种很有名的午餐是开放式三明治，用深色黑麦面包，上面放鱼、鸡蛋、肉或土豆。近些年，丹麦料理也越来越重视当地、新鲜和当季的食材。","pinyin":"Chuántǒng Dānmài shíwù cháng huì yòngdào hēimài miànbāo, yú, zhūròu hé tǔdòu. Yì zhǒng hěn yǒumíng de wǔcān shì kāifàngshì sānmíngzhì, yòng shēnsè hēimài miànbāo, shàngmiàn fàng yú, jīdàn, ròu huò tǔdòu. Jìnxiē nián, Dānmài liàolǐ yě yuèláiyuè zhòngshì dāngdì, xīnxiān hé dāngjì de shícái.","imagePages":["Smørrebrød","Rugbrød"],"caption":"Rye bread and open sandwiches in Danish food culture"}]}}},{"slug":"iceland","name":"Iceland","region":"Europe","flag":"is","mapId":"352","readOrder":39,"summary":"Volcanoes, glaciers, geothermal heat, fishing, old stories, and public hot pools define Iceland.","summaryZh":"火山、冰川、地热、渔业、古老故事与公共热水池共同构成冰岛特色。","facts":{"Location":"North Atlantic Ocean","Landscape":"Volcanoes, lava fields, glaciers","Energy":"Geothermal hot water","Tradition":"Fishing and old stories"},"versions":{"A1":{"title":"Iceland – Ice, Volcanoes, Fish, and Hot Water","titleZh":"冰岛——冰、火山、鱼和热水","titlePinyin":"Bīngdǎo — Bīng, Huǒshān, Yú hé Rèshuǐ","degree":"程度：簡單｜A0–A1","summary":"Easy · source level A0–A1 · 4 illustrated sections.","summaryZh":"简单｜原稿程度 A0–A1｜4段配图阅读。","learningWords":[{"word":"Atlantic","zh":"大西洋","pinyin":"Dàxīyáng","kk":"/ətˈlæntɪk/","level":2},{"word":"volcanoes","zh":"火山","pinyin":"huǒshān","kk":"/vɑlˈkenoz/","level":2},{"word":"glaciers","zh":"冰川","pinyin":"bīngchuān","kk":"/ˈgleʃɚz/","level":2},{"word":"lava fields","zh":"熔岩地","pinyin":"róngyán dì","kk":"/ˈlɑvə fildz/","level":2},{"word":"geothermal","zh":"地热的","pinyin":"dìrè de","kk":"/ˌdʒioˈθɝməl/","level":3},{"word":"economy","zh":"经济","pinyin":"jīngjì","kk":"/ɪˈkɑnəmɪ/","level":3}],"sections":[{"heading":"North Atlantic Island","en":"Iceland is an island in the North Atlantic Ocean. It has ice, volcanoes, mountains, and black beaches.","zh":"冰岛是北大西洋上的一个岛。这里有冰、火山、山和黑色海滩。","pinyin":"Bīngdǎo shì Běi Dàxīyáng shàng de yí ge dǎo. Zhèlǐ yǒu bīng, huǒshān, shān hé hēisè hǎitān.","imagePages":["Geography of Iceland","Volcanism of Iceland","Black sand beach Iceland"],"caption":"Iceland’s North Atlantic landscape"},{"heading":"Hot Water Underground","en":"There is a lot of hot water under the ground. People use it to heat homes and swimming pools.","zh":"地下有很多热水。人们会用这些热水让房子和游泳池变暖。","pinyin":"Dìxià yǒu hěn duō rèshuǐ. Rénmen huì yòng zhèxiē rèshuǐ ràng fángzi hé yóuyǒngchí biàn nuǎn.","imagePages":["Geothermal power in Iceland","Geothermal heating"],"caption":"Geothermal hot water used in everyday life"},{"heading":"Fishing","en":"People in Iceland eat a lot of fish. Fishing has been important there for a long time.","zh":"冰岛人常吃很多鱼。捕鱼在那里很早就是重要的工作。","pinyin":"Bīngdǎo rén cháng chī hěn duō yú. Bǔyú zài nàlǐ hěn zǎo jiù shì zhòngyào de gōngzuò.","imagePages":["Fishing industry in Iceland","Icelandic fisheries"],"caption":"Fishing in Iceland"},{"heading":"Hot Pools","en":"People also like hot pools. They can swim and relax there, even when the weather is cold.","zh":"人们也很喜欢热水池。就算天气很冷，他们还是可以在那里游泳、放松。","pinyin":"Rénmen yě hěn xǐhuan rèshuǐchí. Jiùsuàn tiānqì hěn lěng, tāmen háishi kěyǐ zài nàlǐ yóuyǒng, fàngsōng.","imagePages":["Swimming pools in Iceland","Blue Lagoon (geothermal spa)"],"caption":"Outdoor hot pools in a cold climate"}]},"A2":{"title":"Iceland – Volcanoes, Hot Water, Fishing, Old Stories, and Hot Pools","titleZh":"冰岛——火山、热水、渔业、古老故事和温泉池","titlePinyin":"Bīngdǎo — Huǒshān, Rèshuǐ, Yúyè, Gǔlǎo Gùshi hé Wēnquán Chí","degree":"程度：中｜A1–A2","summary":"Standard · source level A1–A2 · 5 illustrated sections.","summaryZh":"中等｜原稿程度 A1–A2｜5段配图阅读。","learningWords":[{"word":"Atlantic","zh":"大西洋","pinyin":"Dàxīyáng","kk":"/ətˈlæntɪk/","level":2},{"word":"volcanoes","zh":"火山","pinyin":"huǒshān","kk":"/vɑlˈkenoz/","level":2},{"word":"glaciers","zh":"冰川","pinyin":"bīngchuān","kk":"/ˈgleʃɚz/","level":2},{"word":"lava fields","zh":"熔岩地","pinyin":"róngyán dì","kk":"/ˈlɑvə fildz/","level":2},{"word":"geothermal","zh":"地热的","pinyin":"dìrè de","kk":"/ˌdʒioˈθɝməl/","level":3},{"word":"economy","zh":"经济","pinyin":"jīngjì","kk":"/ɪˈkɑnəmɪ/","level":3}],"sections":[{"heading":"Volcanoes and Glaciers","en":"Iceland is an island in the North Atlantic Ocean. It has volcanoes, glaciers, black beaches, and large open land. In some places, people can see ice and volcanic land very close together.","zh":"冰岛是北大西洋上的一个岛国。这里有火山、冰川、黑色海滩和大片空地。在一些地方，可以看到冰川和火山地形离得很近。","pinyin":"Bīngdǎo shì Běi Dàxīyáng shàng de yí ge dǎoguó. Zhèlǐ yǒu huǒshān, bīngchuān, hēisè hǎitān hé dàpiàn kōngdì. Zài yìxiē dìfang, kěyǐ kàndào bīngchuān hé huǒshān dìxíng lí de hěn jìn.","imagePages":["Geology of Iceland","Volcanism of Iceland","Vatnajökull"],"caption":"Volcanoes and glaciers close together in Iceland"},{"heading":"Geothermal Heat","en":"There is a lot of heat under the ground, so Iceland uses hot water from underground. It can heat homes, buildings, and swimming pools. This is very useful during the cold winter.","zh":"地下有很多热能，所以冰岛会使用地下热水。这些热水可以给房子、建筑和游泳池供暖。在寒冷的冬天，这非常有用。","pinyin":"Dìxià yǒu hěn duō rènéng, suǒyǐ Bīngdǎo huì shǐyòng dìxià rèshuǐ. Zhèxiē rèshuǐ kěyǐ gěi fángzi, jiànzhù hé yóuyǒngchí gōngnuǎn. Zài hánlěng de dōngtiān, zhè fēicháng yǒuyòng.","imagePages":["Geothermal power in Iceland","Geothermal heating"],"caption":"Geothermal heat beneath Iceland"},{"heading":"Fishing and Food","en":"The sea is very important to Iceland. Fishing has been an important job for hundreds of years. People catch fish such as cod, and seafood is still common in Icelandic food today.","zh":"大海对冰岛很重要。几百年来，捕鱼一直是很重要的工作。人们会捕鳕鱼等鱼类，今天冰岛人的饮食里还是很常见海鲜。","pinyin":"Dàhǎi duì Bīngdǎo hěn zhòngyào. Jǐ bǎi nián lái, bǔyú yìzhí shì hěn zhòngyào de gōngzuò. Rénmen huì bǔ xuěyú děng yúlèi, jīntiān Bīngdǎo rén de yǐnshí lǐ háishi hěn chángjiàn hǎixiān.","imagePages":["Fishing industry in Iceland","Icelandic fisheries"],"caption":"Fishing and seafood in Iceland"},{"heading":"Old Stories and Language","en":"Iceland also has a long tradition of old stories. Many stories were written hundreds of years ago and talk about families, travel, and life in early Iceland. Icelandic has also changed less than many other European languages.","zh":"冰岛也有很长的古老故事传统。很多故事是几百年前写的，内容会讲家族、旅行和早期冰岛人的生活。冰岛语和很多欧洲语言相比，变化也比较少。","pinyin":"Bīngdǎo yě yǒu hěn cháng de gǔlǎo gùshi chuántǒng. Hěn duō gùshi shì jǐ bǎi nián qián xiě de, nèiróng huì jiǎng jiāzú, lǚxíng hé zǎoqī Bīngdǎo rén de shēnghuó. Bīngdǎoyǔ hé hěn duō Ōuzhōu yǔyán xiāngbǐ, biànhuà yě bǐjiào shǎo.","imagePages":["Icelandic sagas","Icelandic language"],"caption":"Icelandic sagas and the Icelandic language"},{"heading":"Hot Pools and Social Life","en":"People in Iceland often go to hot pools. They go there to swim, relax, and talk with friends. Even when the weather is cold, outdoor hot pools are still very popular.","zh":"冰岛人常常会去热水池。他们会去游泳、放松，也会和朋友聊天。就算天气很冷，户外热水池还是很受欢迎。","pinyin":"Bīngdǎo rén chángcháng huì qù rèshuǐchí. Tāmen huì qù yóuyǒng, fàngsōng, yě huì hé péngyou liáotiān. Jiùsuàn tiānqì hěn lěng, hùwài rèshuǐchí háishi hěn shòu huānyíng.","imagePages":["Swimming pools in Iceland","Blue Lagoon (geothermal spa)"],"caption":"Hot pools as places to swim, relax, and talk"}]},"B1":{"title":"Iceland – Volcanoes, Glaciers, Hot Water, Fishing, and Old Language","titleZh":"冰岛——火山、冰川、热水、渔业和古老语言","titlePinyin":"Bīngdǎo — Huǒshān, Bīngchuān, Rèshuǐ, Yúyè hé Gǔlǎo Yǔyán","degree":"程度：難｜A2–B1","summary":"Deep · source level A2–B1 · 6 illustrated sections.","summaryZh":"深入｜原稿程度 A2–B1｜6段配图阅读。","learningWords":[{"word":"Atlantic","zh":"大西洋","pinyin":"Dàxīyáng","kk":"/ətˈlæntɪk/","level":2},{"word":"volcanoes","zh":"火山","pinyin":"huǒshān","kk":"/vɑlˈkenoz/","level":2},{"word":"glaciers","zh":"冰川","pinyin":"bīngchuān","kk":"/ˈgleʃɚz/","level":2},{"word":"lava fields","zh":"熔岩地","pinyin":"róngyán dì","kk":"/ˈlɑvə fildz/","level":2},{"word":"geothermal","zh":"地热的","pinyin":"dìrè de","kk":"/ˌdʒioˈθɝməl/","level":3},{"word":"economy","zh":"经济","pinyin":"jīngjì","kk":"/ɪˈkɑnəmɪ/","level":3}],"sections":[{"heading":"Volcanoes, Lava Fields, and Glaciers","en":"Iceland is an island in the North Atlantic Ocean. It was formed by strong volcanic activity, and the land is still changing today. The country has volcanoes, lava fields, glaciers, black beaches, and large open areas with very few trees. In some places, ice and volcanic land can be seen very close together.","zh":"冰岛是北大西洋上的一个岛国。它是由很强的火山活动形成的，而且今天土地还在继续变化。这里有火山、熔岩地、冰川、黑色海滩，还有大片几乎没有树的地方。在一些地区，冰川和火山地形离得非常近。","pinyin":"Bīngdǎo shì Běi Dàxīyáng shàng de yí ge dǎoguó. Tā shì yóu hěn qiáng de huǒshān huódòng xíngchéng de, érqiě jīntiān tǔdì hái zài jìxù biànhuà. Zhèlǐ yǒu huǒshān, róngyán dì, bīngchuān, hēisè hǎitān, hái yǒu dàpiàn jīhū méiyǒu shù de dìfang. Zài yìxiē dìqū, bīngchuān hé huǒshān dìxíng lí de fēicháng jìn.","imagePages":["Geology of Iceland","Volcanism of Iceland","Vatnajökull"],"caption":"Volcanic land, lava fields, and glaciers in Iceland"},{"heading":"Geothermal Energy","en":"Because there is a lot of heat under the ground, Iceland uses geothermal energy in daily life. Hot water from underground is used to heat many homes, swimming pools, and buildings. This means people can use naturally hot water even during the cold winter.","zh":"因为地下有很多热能，冰岛在日常生活中大量使用地热能源。地下热水会用来给很多房子、游泳池和建筑供暖。所以就算冬天很冷，人们还是可以使用天然的热水。","pinyin":"Yīnwèi dìxià yǒu hěn duō rènéng, Bīngdǎo zài rìcháng shēnghuó zhōng dàliàng shǐyòng dìrè néngyuán. Dìxià rèshuǐ huì yòng lái gěi hěn duō fángzi, yóuyǒngchí hé jiànzhù gōngnuǎn. Suǒyǐ jiùsuàn dōngtiān hěn lěng, rénmen háishi kěyǐ shǐyòng tiānrán de rèshuǐ.","imagePages":["Geothermal power in Iceland","Geothermal heating"],"caption":"Geothermal energy used for heating"},{"heading":"Early Settlement and Turf Homes","en":"People began to settle in Iceland more than one thousand years ago. Early families came mainly from northern Europe and built farms near the coast. Because wood was limited, some old homes were built with stone, wood, and thick grass roofs to keep the inside warm.","zh":"一千多年前，人们开始在冰岛长期生活。早期居民主要来自欧洲北部，他们在靠海的地方建立农场。因为木材不多，一些以前的房子会用石头、木头和厚草屋顶来建，这样可以让屋里更暖。","pinyin":"Yì qiān duō nián qián, rénmen kāishǐ zài Bīngdǎo chángqī shēnghuó. Zǎoqī jūmín zhǔyào láizì Ōuzhōu běibù, tāmen zài kàohǎi de dìfang jiànlì nóngchǎng. Yīnwèi mùcái bù duō, yìxiē yǐqián de fángzi huì yòng shítou, mùtou hé hòu cǎo wūdǐng lái jiàn, zhèyàng kěyǐ ràng wūlǐ gèng nuǎn.","imagePages":["Icelandic turf house","Settlement of Iceland"],"caption":"Traditional Icelandic turf houses and early settlement"},{"heading":"Fishing and the Economy","en":"The sea has always been important to Iceland. Fishing became one of the main parts of the country’s economy because farming was difficult in the cold climate. Cod and other fish were dried, salted, and later exported. Even today, seafood is still strongly connected with Icelandic food and coastal towns.","zh":"大海一直对冰岛很重要。因为寒冷的气候让农业比较困难，捕鱼很早就成为国家经济的重要部分。鳕鱼和其他鱼类以前会晒干、加盐，后来也大量卖到国外。直到今天，海鲜还是和冰岛的饮食以及海边城镇有很深的关系。","pinyin":"Dàhǎi yìzhí duì Bīngdǎo hěn zhòngyào. Yīnwèi hánlěng de qìhòu ràng nóngyè bǐjiào kùnnan, bǔyú hěn zǎo jiù chéngwéi guójiā jīngjì de zhòngyào bùfen. Xuěyú hé qítā yúlèi yǐqián huì shàigān, jiā yán, hòulái yě dàliàng mài dào guówài. Zhídào jīntiān, hǎixiān háishi hé Bīngdǎo de yǐnshí yǐjí hǎibiān chéngzhèn yǒu hěn shēn de guānxi.","imagePages":["Fishing industry in Iceland","Icelandic fisheries"],"caption":"Fishing as a major part of Iceland’s economy"},{"heading":"Old Language and Stories","en":"The Icelandic language is unusual because it has changed less than many other European languages. Modern Icelanders can still read some old stories written hundreds of years ago more easily than many people in other countries can read very old forms of their own language. These stories often describe families, travel, conflict, and life in early Iceland.","zh":"冰岛语很特别，因为和很多欧洲语言相比，它的变化比较少。今天的冰岛人还是比较容易看懂一些几百年前写的古老故事。这些故事常常会写家族、旅行、冲突和早期冰岛人的生活。","pinyin":"Bīngdǎoyǔ hěn tèbié, yīnwèi hé hěn duō Ōuzhōu yǔyán xiāngbǐ, tā de biànhuà bǐjiào shǎo. Jīntiān de Bīngdǎo rén háishi bǐjiào róngyì kàndǒng yìxiē jǐ bǎi nián qián xiě de gǔlǎo gùshi. Zhèxiē gùshi chángcháng huì xiě jiāzú, lǚxíng, chōngtū hé zǎoqī Bīngdǎo rén de shēnghuó.","imagePages":["Icelandic sagas","Icelandic language"],"caption":"Old Icelandic stories and language"},{"heading":"Public Pools and Hot Baths","en":"Iceland also has a strong culture of public swimming pools and hot baths. These places are not only for exercise. People also go there to relax, talk with friends, and spend time together. Because warm water is easy to get from underground, outdoor hot pools are common even when the air is cold.","zh":"冰岛也有很强的公共游泳池和泡热水文化。这些地方不只是拿来运动。人们也会去那里放松、和朋友聊天、一起待一段时间。因为地下热水很容易取得，所以就算外面很冷，户外热水池也很常见。","pinyin":"Bīngdǎo yě yǒu hěn qiáng de gōnggòng yóuyǒngchí hé pào rèshuǐ wénhuà. Zhèxiē dìfang bù zhǐ shì ná lái yùndòng. Rénmen yě huì qù nàlǐ fàngsōng, hé péngyou liáotiān, yìqǐ dāi yí duàn shíjiān. Yīnwèi dìxià rèshuǐ hěn róngyì qǔdé, suǒyǐ jiùsuàn wàimiàn hěn lěng, hùwài rèshuǐchí yě hěn chángjiàn.","imagePages":["Swimming pools in Iceland","Blue Lagoon (geothermal spa)"],"caption":"Public swimming pools and hot baths"}]}}}];
